ion of a Source form, including but not limited to compiled object code, generated documentation, and conversions to other media types. i. ""Non-Commercial"" shall mean for research or evaluation purposes only. 2. Grant of Rights a. You are granted a non-exclusive, worldwide, non-transferable and royalty-free limited license under Alibaba Cloud's intellectual property or other rights owned b",license_other_raw/pashaprokaz/Qwen1.5-0.5B/LICENSE,tag
sraivante/TinyThinkModel-72M-V1,24,0,other,tinythinkmodel-research-and-upstream-terms,LICENSE,false,"**Experimental research model by sraivante. Built with Llama (applicable synthetic training-data attribution).** The repository identifier is `TinyThinkModel-72M-V1`. Exactly **72,000,000 parameters**, **1,024-token context**, and a **33,069-token custom byte-level BPE**. Model weights and tokenizer were trained from scratch. The Qwen3-0.6B architecture was a design reference; no pretrained Qwen weights or tokenizer were used. The internal training project was called Think72.",noassertion,yes,LICENSE,LICENSE,full,file_only,"TinyThinkModel-72M-V1: research and upstream license terms For original model-weight contributions owned by sraivante, permission is granted to download, run, study, modify and share the model for non-commercial research, retaining this notice, model identity, attribution and applicable upstream terms. This grant cannot override rights held by third parties and does not grant commercial-use rights for the model weights. Copyright (c) 2026 sraivante applies to original project code, documentation and original dataset selection/arrangement only. These original contributions are licensed under Apache License 2.0; see licenses/Apache-2.0.txt. This does not relicense third-party data or put the trained model weights under Apache-2.0. AM-DeepSeek-R1-Distilled-1.4M is marked CC-BY-NC-4.0 and its authors specify research-only use. NVIDIA data carries per-record CC-BY, ODC-BY or CC-BY-SA terms and references Llama 3.1/3.3 obligations for applicable synthetic material. Mixture-of-Thoughts incorporates multiple upstream components. Each component's original terms, notices and attribution continue to apply. Model/data access does not imply that commercial reuse or blanket relicensing is permitted. Built with Llama. The public model display name is Llama-TinyThinkModel-72M-V1; the repository identifier remains TinyThinkModel-72M-V1. The Llama 3.1 and 3.3 license texts are included in licenses/ and their incorporated acceptable-use policies are linked in THIRD_PARTY.md. This is attribution for applicable training data, not a claim that pretrained Llama weights were loaded. HellaSwag is identified as MIT in its pinned source README, with its original authors credited in THIRD_PARTY.md. See licenses/MIT.txt. Current source-license observations are not represented as known historical revisions of the original local training files. Missing per-record license/generator metadata remains a documented limitation; no legal clearance beyond the applicable licenses is claimed by this releas",license_other_raw/sraivante/TinyThinkModel-72M-V1/LICENSE,tag
