s expressly granted under this Agreement, no right, title, or interest of any nature whatsoever is granted whether by implication, estoppel, reliance, or otherwise, by Penn to Recipient. All rights with respect to any know-how, patent or other int",license_other_raw/zhihuanglab/VISTA-PATH/LICENSE,tag
SII-GAIR-NLP/RIBOSPAN-FM,0,2,other,ribospan-non-commercial-model-license,https://huggingface.co/SII-GAIR-NLP/RIBOSPAN-FM/blob/main/LICENSE,false,"Many full-length RNAs, particularly mRNAs, exceed the ~1K context lengths used to pretrain representative dense RNA encoders, forcing long transcripts to be truncated and preventing their 5′ UTR, CDS, and 3′ UTR from being modeled jointly at single-nucleotide resolution. **RiboSpan** is a **1.61B-parameter bidirectional Transformer** with **single-nucleotide tokenization**, **dense self-attention in every layer**, and **native long-context pretraining at up to 10,240 nt**. It is trained on **67.6 million RNA sequences comprising 85.7 billion nucleotides** from RNAcentral, Ensembl, and Ensembl Genomes.",noassertion,yes,LICENSE,LICENSE,full,file_only,"RIBOSPAN NON-COMMERCIAL MODEL LICENSE Version 1.0 Copyright © 2026 Shanghai Innovation Institute. All rights reserved except as expressly granted under this License. IMPORTANT NOTICE This RIBOSPAN Non-Commercial Model License (the ""License"") governs the use of RIBOSPAN Model Materials made available by Shanghai Innovation Institute (the ""Licensor""). By downloading, accessing where access is conditioned on acceptance, using, reproducing, modifying, fine-tuning, or distributing any RIBOSPAN Model Materials, you agree to be bound by this License. If you accept this License on behalf of an organization or other legal entity, you represent that you have authority to bind that entity to this License. If you do not agree to the terms of this License, you may not use the RIBOSPAN Model Materials. This License applies only to RIBOSPAN model weights, checkpoints, and other model-specific materials expressly released under this License. Source code separately released under the Apache License 2.0 is not governed by this License and remains subject to the Apache License 2.0. 1. DEFINITIONS 1.1 ""RIBOSPAN Model Materials"" ""RIBOSPAN Model Materials"" or ""Model Materials"" means RIBOSPAN model weights, pretrained checkpoints, model parameters, model-specific configuration files, weight indexes, tokenizer assets distributed as part of a model release, and other model-specific materials expressly distributed by the Licensor under this License. For clarity, source code separately released under the Apache License 2.0 is not included in the Model Materials. 1.2 ""Derivative Model"" ""Derivative Model"" means any model, checkpoint, or set of model parameters derived from, adapted from, or materially based on the RIBOSPAN Model Materials, including models produced through: (a) fine-tuning; (b) continued pretraining; (c) parameter-efficient fine-tuning; (d) adapters, LoRA, or similar parameter modifications; (e) model merging; (f) pruning; (g) quantization; (h) weight interpolation; (i) model c",license_other_raw/SII-GAIR-NLP/RIBOSPAN-FM/LICENSE,tag
CMSManhattan/JiRackNative_3b,0,0,other,cms-manhattan-jirack-v1.4,LICENSE,false,**JiRack Robotics** has officially kicked off the **multi-shard pre-training phase** for its latest **3B parameter robotics model**.,noassertion,yes,LICENSE,LICENSE,full,file_only,"# Commercial License Agreement: CMS Manhattan JiRack V.1.4 **Inventor/Licensor:** Konstantin Vladimirovich Grabko **Contact:** grabko@cmsmanhattan.com | +1 (516) 777-0945 **Date:** December 21, 2025 **Status:** PATENT PENDING / PROPRIETARY TECHNOLOGY --- ### 1. LEGAL NOTICE & PATENT STATUS NOTICE TO ALL USERS: This repository contains proprietary technology for which patent applications are being prepared or are currently pending (""Patent Pending""). - **No Patenting Rights:** By accessing, downloading, or using this code, the user (""Licensee"") expressly agrees NOT to file any patent applications, utility models, or intellectual property claims based on the methods, architectures (specifically BRE and SWA), or optimizations contained herein. - **Prior Art Acknowledgment:** Any public disclosure or use of this code prior to the official patent grant constitutes an acknowledgment of Konstantin Vladimirovich Grabko’s ownership and established prior art, preserving all of the Licensor’s patent rights. --- ### 2. Grant of License Licensor grants a **non-exclusive, worldwide, subscription** to implement, modify, distribute, and commercially exploit the Invention, including: - Integration into proprietary software-as-a-service (SaaS) platforms. - Deployment in edge-computing hardware and AMD ROCm-based clusters. - Development of **""Derivative Works,""** defined as any software that significantly relies on the BRE or SWA fusion logic. --- ### 3. Key Technical Components | **Component** | **Description** | |--------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------| | **Ternary Quantization** | Weights restricted to $W /in /{-1, 0, +1/}$ with learnable scaling ($/gamma$). | | **Buffered Routing Embedding (BRE)** | Dynamic routing logic maximizing HBM-specific memory pooling. | | **SwiGLU-Attention (SWA) Fusion** | Unified compute kernel merging FFN and MHA for efficiency. | | **Hardware Optimization** | Optimization",license_other_raw/CMSManhattan/JiRackNative_3b/LICENSE,tag
maddiedreese/swedish-chef,0,0,other,,,false,"A tiny decoder-only conversational language model trained entirely from scratch on an original mock-Swedish-chef-style corpus. It responds to short English prompts with playful, semi-comprehensible mock-Swedish speech and always ends with `Børk børk børk`.",noassertion,yes,LICENSE,LICENSE,full,file_only,"MIT License Copyright (c) 2026 Maddie Dreese Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy of this software and associated documentation files (the ""Software""), to deal in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions: The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all copies or substantial portions of the Software. THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED ""AS IS"", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.",license_other_raw/maddiedreese/swedish-chef/LICENSE,tag
Threatthriver/SENDERWIRE,0,1,other,oxpid-proprietary,LICENSE,false,"A 1.1B parameter language model trained end-to-end from scratch on a small budget, on a single commodity GPU node, by **Aniket Kumar** ([Threatthriver](https://huggingface.co/Threatthriver)).",noassertion,yes,LICENSE,LICENSE,full,file_only,"OXPID LICENSE ============= Copyright (c) 2026 Aniket Kumar. All rights reserved. WHAT THIS COVERS ---------------- This license governs: 1. The OXPID model weights, checkpoints, and tokenizer artifacts produced by training runs in this repository, including but not limited to any artifact published under the name OXPID or a version thereof. 2. The original source code authored by Aniket Kumar in this repository, as enumerated under ""WHAT IS ORIGINAL TO THIS REPOSITORY"" in NOTICE. 3. The OXPID name, wordmark, and associated branding. It does NOT cover the source code inherited from nanochat (https://github.com/karpathy/nanochat), which remains under the MIT license reproduced in LICENSE. See NOTICE for the boundary between the two. Trained model weights are a separate work from the training code that produced them, so the MIT terms in LICENSE place no obligation on the OXPID weights. TERMS ----- All rights are reserved. No license, express or implied, is granted to any person to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, or sell the material described above, except under a separate written agreement signed by the copyright holder. DISCLAIMER ---------- THE MATERIAL IS PROVIDED ""AS IS"", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE MATERIAL OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE MATERIAL. -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- NOTE ON CUSTOMISING THESE TERMS -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- ""All rights reserved"" is the most restrictive starting point and is deliberately chosen as a default, because it is far easier to grant rights later than to claw them bac",license_other_raw/Threatthriver/SENDERWIRE/LICENSE,tag
