SlayerLab/Slayer149-balanced,1349,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"Experimental 149,333,081-parameter English causal model trained **from scratch**. 26 layers, hidden width 576, FFN 2496, 9 query heads / 3 KV heads, tied 24,576-token byte-level BPE vocabulary, QK normalization and value residuals. Architecture informed by Qwen3 and AltSlate's Apache-2.0 Jugnu recipe; no Jugnu weights reused. This is a separate experiment from SlayerLab/Slayer149, which remains available.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
