elebush/alephn-1,622,0,mit,,,false,"Alephn 1 is a 111M-parameter language model, trained from scratch by following the [Cerebras-GPT](https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.03208) 111M recipe on a single NVIDIA L40S GPU. It is a base model: it continues text and has not been instruction-tuned or aligned, so it will not follow instructions or hold a real conversation.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
EleutherAI/deep-ignorance-pretraining-stage-unfiltered,621,1,apache-2.0,,,false,We explore an intuitive yet understudied question: Can we prevent LLMs from learning unsafe technical capabilities (such as CBRN) by filtering out enough of the relevant pretraining data before we begin training a model? Research into this question resulted in the **Deep Ignorance Suite**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Crawlnet/queen-v1,619,7,apache-2.0,,,false,"A small language model trained **from scratch**. **Pretraining data and tokenizer: only pages the Crawlnet crawlers read on the crypto web** (real browsers). No pretrained weights, no FineWeb, no other corpus. **Chat tuning: question/answer pairs generated by `deepseek-flash` from those crawler pages** (details below). Expect a dumb, funny, confidently-wrong model; that is the point.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mlsa-iai-msu-lab/sci-rus-tiny,611,14,mit,,,false,SciRus-tiny is a model to obtain embeddings of scientific texts in russian and english. Model was trained on [eLibrary](https://www.elibrary.ru/) data with contrastive technics described in [habr post](https://habr.com/ru/articles/781032). High metrics values were achieved on the [ruSciBench](https://github.com/mlsa-iai-msu-lab/ru_sci_bench/tree/main) benchmark.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
zuu007/gpt2-from-scratch-chat,608,0,mit,,,false,"[zuu007/gpt2-from-scratch](https://huggingface.co/zuu007/gpt2-from-scratch) after supervised fine-tuning on `databricks/databricks-dolly-15k` (loss on the answers only). Part of **[github.com/zuurashad/gpt2-from-scratch](https://github.com/zuurashad/gpt2-from-scratch)**, a PyTorch reproduction of GPT-2 small trained from scratch on a single 6GB laptop GPU. **[Try it in your browser](https://zuu007-gpt2-from-scratch.static.hf.space)**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
redptam/tyrian-500m,608,0,mit,,,false,"A 511M parameter decoder-only language model built from scratch in PyTorch, then supervised fine-tuned for chat (ChatML) and preference-tuned with DPO. Every component (tokenizer, architecture, data pipeline, training loop, SFT, DPO) was written from scratch with Claude (Anthropic's AI assistant).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Snarcy/RadioDino-s8,602,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,"**RadioDINO-s8** is a self-supervised Vision Transformer foundation model developed for radiomics and medical imaging. It is based on the DINO framework and pretrained on the large-scale **RadImageNet** dataset (1.35 million CT, MRI, and Ultrasound images across 165 classes and 11 anatomical regions). This model is part of the *Radio DINO* family and was created to extract robust, general-purpose features for downstream medical tasks including classification, segmentation, and interpretability analysis.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
