IvmeLabs/Ivme-Conversate-v3-Base,490,4,apache-2.0,,,false,"**İvme** (Turkish: *acceleration*) is a series of stupidly small language models built to punch above their weight. This is the third release: a 24.79M parameter decoder-only base model trained from scratch, with a deeper/narrower architecture, two new attention-level changes, a digit-atomic tokenizer, and a revised data mix.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
