MCG-NJU/videomae-base-short,476,5,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,VideoMAE model pre-trained on Kinetics-400 for 800 epochs in a self-supervised way. It was introduced in the paper [VideoMAE: Masked Autoencoders are Data-Efficient Learners for Self-Supervised Video Pre-Training](https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.12602) by Tong et al. and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/MCG-NJU/VideoMAE).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
raihan-js/medllm-10m,476,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A lightweight **GPT-2-style causal language model trained from scratch** on medical literature. Designed for research and education in the medical domain.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
