empulse/KiCAD-MCP-Qwen3.5-4B-GGUF,438,12,apache-2.0,,,false,"A fine-tuned Qwen3.5-4B model specialized for KiCAD PCB design assistance via the Model Context Protocol (MCP). Trained to select and invoke the correct tools from a 159-tool KiCAD MCP server covering schematic capture, PCB layout, DRC, export, library management, and more.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
