Maggio33/GoLLeM-110M-PL,425,3,apache-2.0,,,false,"Bazowy model językowy (**pretraining, model bazowy — NIE chatbot**) dla języka polskiego. **110M** parametrów, architektura GPT-2, wytrenowany **od zera** na **konsumenckiej karcie AMD Radeon RX 7900 XTX** (ROCm/WSL2, Windows) — bez NVIDII, bez chmury.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
prabakaranchandran/baby-pooh-46m-midtrain-r3,424,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> **Experimental, work in progress.** A mid-trained version of > [Baby Pooh 46M v1](https://huggingface.co/prabakaranchandran/baby-pooh-46m), a 46M-parameter causal LM trained > from scratch on a child-scale corpus. It is **not** instruction-tuned and **not** a chat model. Mid-training adds > knowledge of A. A. Milne's Pooh world; the character itself (chat, persona, safety) comes in later post-training.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Instruct-FP8,423,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Dicta-LM 3.0 is a powerful open-weight collection of LLMs, trained on extensive corpora of Hebrew and English texts. The models are available for download and for unlimited use. The models set a new SOTA for their weight-class for Hebrew, both as base models and chat models.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
codelion/SmolLM2-70M,422,3,apache-2.0,,,false,"A SmolLM2-70M model pretrained on the [Sutra-10B](https://huggingface.co/datasets/codelion/sutra-10B) pedagogical dataset for 3 epochs (~30.6B tokens total). This model demonstrates that a 69M parameter model can be trained to near-capacity performance using dense, curated educational data.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
