Cion-lab/ounce100m-v1,404,1,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"A **106,194,240-parameter decoder-only transformer trained from scratch on 999,817,216 tokens** of `Cion-lab/ounce100m-mix-v1`, in 3814 optimiser steps on **2×Nvidia Tesla T4** inside Kaggle notebook sessions. It is the deliverable of a project whose whole point was to find out what a ~100 M-parameter model reaches from ~1 B tokens of a curated public mix, and to report it honestly, including where that is near chance.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
