Crawlnet/queen-v2,386,5,apache-2.0,,,false,"A small language model trained **from scratch**. **Pretraining data and tokenizer: only pages the Crawlnet crawlers read on the crypto web** (real browsers), **plus public market, funding and on-chain records written out as plain-text pages** (13% of the tokens, see below). No pretrained weights, no FineWeb, no other corpus. **Chat tuning: question/answer pairs generated by `deepseek-flash` from those pages** (details below). Expect a dumb, funny, confidently-wrong model; that is the point.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
