nkthebass/tinybrainbot-350mV3-instruct,370,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **348M-parameter** decoder-only model, pretrained from scratch on 22.7B tokens and then instruction-tuned. Answers direct questions in a chat format. Successor to the **TinyBrainBot 100M V3 Instruct**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
