altslate/JugnuLM-53M,323,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **53.5M parameter** language model pretrained **from scratch** on ~12B tokens of FineWeb-Edu. Built as an entry for the (sub-150M parameter models). *Jugnu* (जुगनू) means ""firefly"" — small, but it glows.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
