CinqicX/juniper1-base,317,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Cinqic's first original base language model, trained from scratch: 142,771,456 parameters, one epoch over 3.41 billion tokens of the `j1-base-v0.2.2` corpus, released under Apache-2.0 for the Cinqic-owned weights, tokenizer and code. Code, evidence and reproduction guide: <https://github.com/Cinqic-Research/Juniper-1-Base>.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
