Batman55072/NanoChat-31M-V2,311,0,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"A ~31.4M parameter GPT-style decoder-only transformer, trained fully from scratch, that generates simulated live-stream chat comments -- both regular fast-paced ""hype chat"" and rarer, longer ""superchat""-style paid messages/questions. Built to run fast on CPU, as a lightweight audience-simulation layer for AI VTuber / livestream projects.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
