emanuelealbertosi/gpt2-it-514m-instruct,307,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Un GPT-2 da **514 milioni di parametri** addestrato **interamente da zero** sulla lingua italiana, su una singola GPU consumer (RTX 5070 Ti, 16 GB), come materiale didattico per l'insegnamento dell'intelligenza artificiale nella scuola secondaria di secondo grado.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
IvmeLabs/Ivme-Conversate-XL-v1.1-Base,306,1,apache-2.0,,,false,THIS MODEL HAS BEEN DEEMED BROKEN,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
muonai/photon-p1,305,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Photon-P1** is a 1.003M-parameter language model trained from scratch — no base model, no pretrained weights, no gated dependencies. It is a follow-up to Photon 5 (5.03M parameters, seven per-domain LoRA adapters) exploring a **more aggressive form of parameter specialization** at a much smaller scale.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ylacombe/omniASR_W2V_300M_SSL,303,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Porting the SSL (self-supervised-learning) version of the Omnilingual-Asr W2V2 release from Meta to transformers. 300M checkpoint. More on the [official repo](https://github.com/facebookresearch/omnilingual-asr).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
