dvitvaai/pothana-sp-base-300M,302,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A **387M parameter** LLaMA-style language model trained **from scratch** on Telugu text.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Compactbot/compacttest-5m,302,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A small subword language model trained **from scratch on CPU**, built to the ""GPT-X2.5"" style spec requested in the [model-requests](https://huggingface.co/Compactbot/model-requests) board (`gpt-S2.5-5m`). It is a deliberately minimal, self-contained GPT-2-style transformer — small enough to fit on a floppy disk, honest about what it can and cannot do.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
hotdogs/Qwen3.8-27B-abliterated-cyber-preview,301,5,apache-2.0,,,false,"An **offensive-security / agentic tool-calling** LoRA merge on top of — the training-free abliterated build of [Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B). The LoRA is **merged** into the base at **scale 1.0** (PEFT `alpha/r = 64/32 = 2.0`, i.e. the exact strength the scale sweep below found optimal), and the **MTP (Multi-Token Prediction) head is preserved**, so the GGUF build supports self-speculative decoding.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
