MaziyarPanahi/Mistral-7B-v0.1-sharded-Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1-GGUF,299,0,apache-2.0,,,false,- Model creator: [MaziyarPanahi](https://huggingface.co/MaziyarPanahi) - Original model: [MaziyarPanahi/Mistral-7B-v0.1-sharded-Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1](https://huggingface.co/MaziyarPanahi/Mistral-7B-v0.1-sharded-Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
altslate/JugnuLM-110M,299,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **109.7M parameter**, **deep-and-thin** language model pretrained **from scratch** on ~8B tokens of FineWeb-Edu. It is the larger sibling of [JugnuLM-53M](https://huggingface.co/altslate/JugnuLM-53M) and the **baseline rung of an ongoing ablation study** on what improves sub-150M models. *Jugnu* (जुगनू) = firefly.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
DedeProGames/Wisp-5M,298,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Wisp-5M** is a tiny decoder-only language model from the **Wisp** family, trained from scratch on **3.00B tokens** of English web text, code and math. It uses a plain LLaMA architecture, so it loads with `transformers` (`LlamaForCausalLM`) with no custom code.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Snarcy/RedDino-base,297,2,cc-by-4.0,,,false,"**RedDino** is a self-supervised Vision Transformer foundation model specifically designed for **red blood cell (RBC)** image analysis. It leverages a tailored version of the **DINOv2** framework, trained on a meticulously curated dataset of **1.25 million RBC images** from diverse acquisition modalities and sources. This model excels at extracting robust, general-purpose features for downstream hematology tasks such as **shape classification**, **morphological subtype recognition**, and **batch-effect–robust analysis**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Ayaka157/RetNet-0.5B-ep1,297,0,mit,,,false,"First training leg of the 0.5B model, run on a rented RTX 3090 24 GB. Validation loss **2.1035**. The final model is [RetNet-0.5B](https://huggingface.co/Ayaka157/RetNet-0.5B) at 1.9459.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
metavoiceio/metavoice-1B-v0.1,296,789,apache-2.0,,,false,"MetaVoice-1B is a 1.2B parameter base model trained on 100K hours of speech for TTS (text-to-speech). It has been built with the following priorities: * Emotional speech rhythm and tone in English. No hallucinations. * Support for voice cloning with finetuning. * We have had success with as little as 1 minute training data for Indian speakers. * Zero-shot cloning for American & British voices, with 30s reference audio. * Support for long-form synthesis.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
oddadmix/Nawah-BERT-6M-bilingual,295,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Same architecture as [`Nawah-BERT-6M-v2`](https://huggingface.co/oddadmix/Nawah-BERT-6M-v2) (hidden 128, 8 layers, 2 heads, **5,993,600 params**) but pretrained on a genuinely balanced bilingual corpus with a tokenizer built for both languages, rather than an Arabic-only backbone.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
VAGOsolutions/SauerkrautLM-Multi-ModernColBERT,294,12,apache-2.0,,,false,This model is a multilingual Late Interaction retriever that leverages:,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
