VRDate/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Base-W4A16-Q4_0-GGUF,288,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Base-W4A16`](https://huggingface.co/dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Base-W4A16) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Base-W4A16) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
