irfanhossainsust/bangla-gpt2-small,282,0,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"A 23M-parameter GPT-2 language model trained **from scratch** on Bangla text, with a **Bangla byte-level BPE tokenizer** (32k vocabulary).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
