IslombekT/uzbek-gpt-103m,276,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **103M-parameter, decoder-only transformer** for Uzbek, pretrained **from scratch** — not fine-tuned from a multilingual model. Trained on one consumer GPU in about 3.4 hours for about $3.60, it predicts held-out Uzbek text better than mGPT-1.3B (13× larger, used as-is or fine-tuned on Uzbek) and than current Qwen models of up to 1.7B parameters.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
