Dawgggggg/fina-30m-v0.1,274,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"**Fina-30M** is a 29,368,832-parameter (~29.4M) decoder-only causal Transformer for Indonesian, trained **from scratch** end-to-end on Google Colab free tier. This repository hosts the **base pretrained checkpoint** (not instruction-tuned) — it continues text, it does not follow chat-style instructions.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
