AneekC/quipu-moe-1B-A149M-chat,269,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A mixture-of-experts language model trained from scratch: **998,007,552 parameters in total, 148,660,992 active per token** (998.0M total / 148.7M active). Own tokenizer, own data pipeline, no fine-tuned base. Code and ten languages: English, Indonesian, Malay, Simplified and Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Tamil, Hindi (Devanagari and romanised) and romanised Urdu.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mradermacher/Marco-LLM-ES-GGUF,268,0,apache-2.0,,,false,<!-- ### quantize_version: 2 --> <!-- ### output_tensor_quantised: 1 --> <!-- ### convert_type: hf --> <!-- ### vocab_type: --> <!-- ### tags: --> static quants of https://huggingface.co/ATH-MaaS/Marco-LLM-ES,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Exquisique/BabyLangModel,268,1,mit,,,false,A tiny GPT-style language model trained from scratch on the [TinyStories](https://huggingface.co/datasets/roneneldan/TinyStories) dataset. Built using PyTorch and a custom architecture inspired by [nanoGPT](https://github.com/karpathy/nanoGPT). This model was trained for 200k iterations on a consumer GPU (RTX 4060) using custom code from scratch.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
omartra999/tlm-xs-refactor,268,0,mit,,,false,"TLM-XS is a small encoder-decoder transformer trained **from scratch, with no pretrained weights**. Given a Python function and a task, it produces the edit as a SEARCH/REPLACE block that can be applied to the source.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
TevunahAi/Chochmah-1B-Instruct-DPO,268,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This is [Chochmah-1B-Instruct](https://huggingface.co/TevunahAi/Chochmah-1B-Instruct) with one more pass: direct preference optimization on UltraFeedback, on top of the SFT weights. The base, [Chochmah-1B](https://huggingface.co/TevunahAi/Chochmah-1B), is our 1.18B-parameter model pretrained from scratch on 45 billion tokens on a single workstation GPU; the instruct model taught it to answer; this one taught it which of two answers is better. All three stages ran on the same RTX 5000 Ada, and every number below comes from those runs.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-tc-bible-big-mul-deu_eng_fra_por_spa,267,2,apache-2.0,,,false,library_name: transformers language: - aa - aai - aau - ab - abi - acd - ace - acf - ach - acn - acr - ade - adj - ady - aeu - aey - af - afh - agd - agn - agu - ahk - aia - ak - akh - akl - akp - alj - alp - alq - alt - alz - am - ame - ami - amk - amu - an - ang - ann - anp - anv - aoz - apr - apu - ar - arc - as - aso - ast - atg - atj - atq - aui - auy - av - avk - avn - avu - awa - awb - awx - az - azg - azz - ba - bal - ban - bar - bas - bav - bba - bbo - bbr - bcl - bcw - be - bef - beh - bem - bep - bex - bfa - bfd - bfo - bg - bgr - bhl - bho - bhz - bi - bib - bik - bim - biv - bjr - bjv - bku - bkv - blh - blt - blz - bm - bmh - bmk - bmq - bmu - bmv - bn - bnp - bo - boj - bom - bov - box - bpr - bps - bpy - bqc - bqj - bqp - br - bru - brx - bs - bss - btd - bth - bto - bts -,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Dream-org/Dream-VL-7B,267,13,apache-2.0,,,false,Dream-VL 7B is an open diffusion vision-language model trained on 12M multimodal data from the [MAmmoTH-VL-Instruct-12M](https://huggingface.co/datasets/MAmmoTH-VL/MAmmoTH-VL-Instruct-12M) dataset. The model takes language instructions and images as input and generates language outputs.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
omartra999/tlm-s-refactor,266,0,mit,,,false,"TLM-S is a small encoder-decoder transformer trained **from scratch, with no pretrained weights**. Given a Python function and a task, it produces the edit as a SEARCH/REPLACE block that can be applied to the source.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
google/multiberts-seed_2,265,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"MultiBERTs is a collection of checkpoints and a statistical library to support robust research on BERT. We provide 25 BERT-base models trained with similar hyper-parameters as [the original BERT model](https://github.com/google-research/bert) but with different random seeds, which causes variations in the initial weights and order of training instances. The aim is to distinguish findings that apply to a specific artifact (i.e., a particular instance of the model) from those that apply to the more general procedure.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
IvmeLabs/Ivme-Conversate-XL-v1-Base,265,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model is considered broken and should not be used.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
NadevA23/Kronumos,264,1,apache-2.0,,,false,**Kronumos** is the foundational release of the Kronumos Dual-Brain automated program repair ecosystem.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cinmodel/electra-small-japanese-discriminator,264,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"We provide a Japanese **ELECTRA-Small** model, as described in [ELECTRA: Pre-training Text Encoders as Discriminators Rather Than Generators](https://openreview.net/pdf?id=r1xMH1BtvB).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AhiskaAI/AhiskaAI-v0.4-35M-Base,264,1,apache-2.0,,,false,***(Türkçe Açıklama Aşağıda)***,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sraivante/LMLM_97M_1,264,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **97.6M-parameter language model trained from scratch**, then fine-tuned for short, polite, everyday English conversation. It is a small, open research and learning model: you can read every line of its training code, run it on a laptop CPU, and see exactly where a model of this size is good and where it fails.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SLM-Archive/AppleMind-1.0-Mini,263,0,apache-2.0,,,false,AppleMind-1.0-Mini is a compact decoder-only causal language model trained from scratch by AppleMind on a 300M-token curriculum.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tohio/slm-gpt-127m-dpo,261,0,mit,,,false,"`tohio/slm-gpt-127m-dpo` is a preference-aligned small language model (127M, ~126.8M parameters) aligned with Direct Preference Optimization (DPO) on pairwise conversational preferences.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-9e19-1.4Bparams-10.6Btokens,260,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 1.4B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 9 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 10.6B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
