Bur3hani/MuchKnow-Foundation-8B,253,0,mit,,,false,**MuchKnow-Foundation-8B** is a high-performance bilingual (Tanzanian Kiswahili 🇹🇿 + English 🇬🇧) enterprise base model fine-tuned on top of `deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B`.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
omartra999/tlm-m-refactor,253,0,mit,,,false,"TLM-M is a small encoder-decoder transformer trained **from scratch, with no pretrained weights**. Given a Python function and a task, it produces the edit as a SEARCH/REPLACE block that can be applied to the source.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
