izumi-lab/electra-base-japanese-discriminator,249,2,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,This is a [ELECTRA](https://github.com/google-research/electra) model pretrained on texts in the Japanese language.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tohio/slm-gpt-127m-sft,247,0,mit,,,false,"`tohio/slm-gpt-127m-sft` is an instruction-tuned small language model (127M, ~126.8M parameters) fine-tuned on multi-turn reasoning and instruction dialogues formatted in ChatML.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ivanmikhnenkov/tinydit-256,247,16,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"A 210M-parameter text-to-image diffusion transformer trained from scratch on one GPU (3.5 days, 400k steps, 4.2M images at 256² area with aspect-ratio buckets). Frozen FLUX.2 autoencoder (32-channel latent) and frozen flan-t5-base text encoder; the transformer, recipe, data pipeline and evaluation are original.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
BerkayRA/egemen-turkish-124m,246,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A small **Llama-style decoder-only** language model trained **from scratch on Turkish**, as the headline run of an A/B pre-training experiment (""Config A""). It is a research / educational base model — a demonstration that a coherent Turkish LM can be trained on a single 8 GB GPU — **not** an instruction-tuned or aligned assistant. Developed at, and on the infrastructure of, **Mega Bilgisayar Tic. Ltd. Şti.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Squeal-Studio/squeal_lstm_5m,245,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"squeal_lstm_5m is a compact ~5.8M parameter language model pretrained from scratch on Russian-language text, based on LSTM architecture.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
