OpenLLM-France/Luciole-8B-KD-Math-Base,243,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Table of Contents** - [Model Card for Luciole-23B-Base](#model-card-for-luciole-23b-base) - [Model Description](#model-description) - [Uses](#uses) - [Direct use](#direct-use) - [Downstream use](#downstream-use) - [Out-of-Scope Use](#out-of-scope-use) - [Bias, Risks, and Limitations](#bias-risks-and-limitations) - [Recommendations](#recommendations) - [Example Code in Python](#example-code-in-python) - [Load the model](#load-the-model) - [Sentence completion](#sentence-completion) - [Loading Intermediate Checkpoints](#loading-intermediate-checkpoints) - [Training Details](#training-details) <!-- - [Training Data](#training-data)--> <!-- - [Training Procedure](#training-procedure)--> <!-- - [Neural Network Architecture](#neural-network-architecture)--> <!-- - [Training Hyperparameters](#t",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
