Ayaka157/RetNet-100M,243,0,mit,,,false,"The first chat model in this project, from 2026-08-20. It talks, badly. It is here because it is the starting point of a line that ends at [RetNet-0.5B](https://huggingface.co/Ayaka157/RetNet-0.5B), and because the loss curve of a model this size is worth having.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
izumi-lab/electra-small-japanese-discriminator,242,0,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,This is a [ELECTRA](https://github.com/google-research/electra) model pretrained on texts in the Japanese language.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Diamegs/PIT-4B-202112,241,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Point-In-Time (PIT)** is a family of GPT-style language models trained on chronologically-ordered monthly snapshots of [FineWeb](https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb). Each checkpoint captures the state of knowledge available up to a specific month, making them suitable for temporal reasoning and point-in-time analysis tasks.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tohio/slm-gpt-127m-base,240,0,mit,,,false,"`tohio/slm-gpt-127m-base` is a pre-trained base language model (127M, ~126.8M parameters) trained from scratch on a 10B token educational and reasoning curriculum. This checkpoint serves as the foundational base and has **not** undergone instruction tuning or alignment.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
TevunahAi/Chochmah-1B-Instruct,240,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This is the instruct version of [Chochmah-1B](https://huggingface.co/TevunahAi/Chochmah-1B), our 1.18B-parameter model pretrained from scratch on 45 billion tokens on a single workstation GPU. The base model learned to write; this one learned to answer. It was made with one supervised fine-tuning pass on SmolTalk, full-parameter, on the same RTX 5000 Ada the base was trained on, and every number below comes from that run.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kairo-crypto-model/kairo-v1.5,238,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Kairo v1.5** (`kairo-crypto-model/kairo-v1.5`) is an open-weights, crypto-native causal language model architecture pre-trained continuously on live web streams of technical documentation, protocol whitepapers, smart contracts (Anchor & Solidity), audit post-mortems, and governance proposals.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
noeum/noeum-1-nano,237,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div align=""center"">",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
IAMPOOM/CircleZone-2.0-70M,237,1,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,**[ภาษาไทย](#ภาษาไทย) · [English](#english)**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
adiitya0929/TinySQL-125M-WikiSQL,237,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 125M-parameter text-to-SQL model. Given a table schema and a question, it writes the SQL query. Every part of it was built from scratch: the tokenizer, the transformer, the optimizer, the training loop and the data pipeline. It was pretrained on 4.5B tokens on one GPU, then fine-tuned on WikiSQL.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Diamegs/PIT-4B-201511,236,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Point-In-Time (PIT)** is a family of GPT-style language models trained on chronologically-ordered monthly snapshots of [FineWeb](https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb). Each checkpoint captures the state of knowledge available up to a specific month, making them suitable for temporal reasoning and point-in-time analysis tasks.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
slideflow-labs/Mettle,236,3,cc-by-nc-nd-4.0,,,false,Mettle is a histopathology tile encoder derived from H-optimus-0. It is designed to improve representation consistency across slide scanners and staining variation while retaining biologically useful morphology.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
