paris-noah/Tabby,235,8,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"This is a self-contained Tabby checkpoint: the frozen [Tabby-Pretrain](https://huggingface.co/paris-noah/Tabby-Pretrain) backbone plus a seed-42 prompt. Its 99 quantile forecasts cover levels 0.01 through 0.99. The backbone weights come from pretraining step **165,000**. The prompt was trained with the backbone frozen and selected at epoch 14 (`val_loss=2.0483945271`).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
