adiitya0929/TinySQL-125M-base,230,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The pretrained base model of TinySQL: a 125M-parameter decoder trained from random initialisation on 4.51B tokens of educational web text and SQL code. Everything was written from scratch: the tokenizer, the transformer, AdamW, the training loop and the data pipeline. It is a plain language model, not instruction-tuned. For text-to-SQL, use [adiitya0929/TinySQL-125M-WikiSQL](https://huggingface.co/adiitya0929/TinySQL-125M-WikiSQL), or fine-tune this model on your own task.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dbmdz/electra-base-french-europeana-cased-discriminator,230,1,mit,,,false,In this repository the MDZ Digital Library team (dbmdz) at the Bavarian State Library open sources French Europeana ELECTRA models 🎉,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
