Drm39/slm-300m,207,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 304M-parameter decoder-only language model trained from scratch on **6.08B tokens** of [FineWeb-Edu](https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-edu), the Chinchilla-optimal budget for its size, on a single A100. Everything here was built from scratch: the tokenizer, model, data pipeline, Muon optimizer and the fault-tolerant training system. Code: [github.com/Darpan-Maurya/SLM](https://github.com/Darpan-Maurya/SLM).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Diamegs/PIT-4B-202212,206,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Point-In-Time (PIT)** is a family of GPT-style language models trained on chronologically-ordered monthly snapshots of [FineWeb](https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb). Each checkpoint captures the state of knowledge available up to a specific month, making them suitable for temporal reasoning and point-in-time analysis tasks.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
