mondk/Msh-Tiny-47M,203,2,apache-2.0,,,false,gguf: https://huggingface.co/mondk/Msh-Tiny-47M-GGUF,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
google/multiberts-seed_8,202,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"MultiBERTs is a collection of checkpoints and a statistical library to support robust research on BERT. We provide 25 BERT-base models trained with similar hyper-parameters as [the original BERT model](https://github.com/google-research/bert) but with different random seeds, which causes variations in the initial weights and order of training instances. The aim is to distinguish findings that apply to a specific artifact (i.e., a particular instance of the model) from those that apply to the more general procedure.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AppleMind-AI/AppleMind-1.0-Mini,202,3,apache-2.0,,,false,AppleMind-1.0-Mini is a compact decoder-only causal language model trained from scratch by AppleMind on a 300M-token curriculum.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Maggio33/GoLLeM-110M-PL-v2,201,1,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"Polski model językowy **110M** (GPT-2-class), trenowany **od zera** na AMD Radeon RX 7900 XTX (ROCm/WSL2). Model **bazowy (completion)** — kontynuuje tekst, **nie jest chatbotem** (nie odpowiada na pytania; daj mu początek zdania).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
bench-labs/cagliostro-v2,201,9,apache-2.0,,,false,A 150M parameter language model trained from scratch on 50B tokens.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
