mradermacher/smallcoder-303m-GGUF,199,0,apache-2.0,,,false,<!-- ### quantize_version: 2 --> <!-- ### output_tensor_quantised: 1 --> <!-- ### convert_type: hf --> <!-- ### vocab_type: --> <!-- ### tags: --> <!-- ### quants: x-f16 Q4_K_S Q2_K Q8_0 Q6_K Q3_K_M Q3_K_S Q3_K_L Q4_K_M Q5_K_S Q5_K_M IQ4_XS --> <!-- ### quants_skip: --> <!-- ### skip_mmproj: --> static quants of https://huggingface.co/Beebey/smallcoder-303m,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kunjcr2/GatorGPT2,199,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"**GatorGPT2** is a small, decoder-only Transformer trained from scratch on a subset of **TinyStories** for next-token prediction. It uses **RoPE** (rotary positional embeddings), **GQA** (grouped-query attention), **RMSNorm**, and a **SwiGLU MLP**. Tokenizer is **tiktoken** with **p50k_base** vocabulary.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fausap/pico-165m,199,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"Pico is a 165M-parameter model trained from scratch on about 2.7B tokens on a single TPU chip. It is built for **multi-turn memory**: remembering what the user said, keeping standing instructions (""call me Captain"", ""end every reply with 'cheers'"") and noticing false premises. Instead of reading the whole conversation, it works as a **resident agent**: - a note-taker turns each user message into `rule:` and `fact:` notes; - the answerer sees only those notes and the last two exchanges.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
google/multiberts-seed_7,198,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"MultiBERTs is a collection of checkpoints and a statistical library to support robust research on BERT. We provide 25 BERT-base models trained with similar hyper-parameters as [the original BERT model](https://github.com/google-research/bert) but with different random seeds, which causes variations in the initial weights and order of training instances. The aim is to distinguish findings that apply to a specific artifact (i.e., a particular instance of the model) from those that apply to the more general procedure.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
forever-ai/Apeiron-1.0,198,4,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Apeiron 1.0** is a coding AI agent by **Forever AI** (formerly Klox AI). The first model in the proprietary **Ape's** line. Knowledge cutoff — October 2026. **Trained from scratch as a full model — not an adapter, not a fine-tune on top of someone else's base model.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Stanford-ILIAD/minivla-libero90-prismatic,197,5,mit,,,false,"<b>This checkpoint is in a format that is compatible with the training script from the original [Prismatic VLMs project codebase](https://github.com/TRI-ML/prismatic-vlms), which the OpenVLA team built on top of to develop the OpenVLA model.</b>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
