RaphaelMourad/Mistral-DNA-v1-17M-hg38,195,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-DNA-v1-17M-hg38 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA sequence model with 16.8M parameters. It is derived from Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 10kb DNA sequences from the hg38 human genome assembly.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
