yasinyaman/callbus-emb-8b-GGUF,190,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"[callbus's default backbone](https://huggingface.co/yasinyaman/callbus-emb-8b) as GGUF, for llama.cpp and Ollama: tool retrieval without a datacentre GPU. A request and each tool become vectors, and the tools closest to the request come first. Same weights, same instruction and same tool text as the bf16 model — only the numeric format changes.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
