jsantillana/vectrayx-600m,183,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 600M-parameter, from-scratch Spanish-first language model with native tool-calling for cybersecurity workflows (CVE lookup, KEV catalog checks, IOC reputation, shell command execution). 18 layers, d_model=1792, GQA (14 query heads / 2 KV heads), NoPE every 4th layer, 32,768-token vocabulary, 2048-token context.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-1e23-25Bparams-628Btokens,182,5,apache-2.0,,,false,A 25B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 1 × 10²³ FLOPs on 628B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cooler8/yejin-korean-3b-v2-base,182,0,apache-2.0,,,false,**100% from-scratch** 사전학습된 한국어 3B 파운데이션 모델. 외부 공개 모델 가중치를 전혀 사용하지 않았습니다.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
thebajajra/RexBERT-large,182,8,apache-2.0,,,false,"> **TL;DR**: An encoder-only transformer (ModernBERT-style) for **e-commerce** applications, trained in three phases—**Pre-training**, **Context Extension**, and **Decay**—to power product search, attribute extraction, classification, and embeddings use cases. The model has been trained on 2.3T+ tokens along with 350B+ e-commerce-specific tokens",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
google/multiberts-seed_24,182,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"MultiBERTs is a collection of checkpoints and a statistical library to support robust research on BERT. We provide 25 BERT-base models trained with similar hyper-parameters as [the original BERT model](https://github.com/google-research/bert) but with different random seeds, which causes variations in the initial weights and order of training instances. The aim is to distinguish findings that apply to a specific artifact (i.e., a particular instance of the model) from those that apply to the more general procedure.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
muonai/photon-x-preview,181,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Photon-X** is a 10.1M-parameter language model trained from scratch, with **seven hard-routed domain-specific feed-forward down-projections**. It is the third model in the Photon family, following Photon 5 (5M params, seven LoRA adapters) and Photon-P1 (1M params, two full down-projections).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jaswanthsanjay88/mara,180,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"Mara is an open-weight, 2.7 MB on-device decision agent designed for embedded developers, roboticists, and web applications that need sub-1ms neural tool calling, zero-syntax-error hardware orchestration, and direct client-side in-browser inference without cloud dependencies.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
noeum/noeum-1-nano-base,180,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div align=""center"">",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
google/multiberts-seed_0-step_1000k,180,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"MultiBERTs is a collection of checkpoints and a statistical library to support robust research on BERT. We provide 25 BERT-base models trained with similar hyper-parameters as [the original BERT model](https://github.com/google-research/bert) but with different random seeds, which causes variations in the initial weights and order of training instances. The aim is to distinguish findings that apply to a specific artifact (i.e., a particular instance of the model) from those that apply to the more general procedure.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SmallAICreator/MiniGPT2-22M-GGUF,180,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **22M-parameter language model trained from scratch** by **SmallAICreator / UltraLabs**, small enough to chat on a phone.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
google/multiberts-seed_11,179,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"MultiBERTs is a collection of checkpoints and a statistical library to support robust research on BERT. We provide 25 BERT-base models trained with similar hyper-parameters as [the original BERT model](https://github.com/google-research/bert) but with different random seeds, which causes variations in the initial weights and order of training instances. The aim is to distinguish findings that apply to a specific artifact (i.e., a particular instance of the model) from those that apply to the more general procedure.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
