jaweed123/TinyJLLM-Instruct,179,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Supervised fine-tuning of [TinyJLLM](https://huggingface.co/jaweed123/TinyJLLM) on 83,145 curated instruction examples from six public datasets. Trained from scratch in the [TinyLLM repository](https://github.com/Abdul-Jaweed/TinyLLM) with **response-masked loss and attention**: response positions attend only to the prompt, which prevents the model from learning a copy shortcut.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jaweed123/TinyJLLM-Instruct-DPO,179,0,apache-2.0,,,false,[Direct Preference Optimization](https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.18290) applied to [TinyJLLM-Instruct](https://huggingface.co/jaweed123/TinyJLLM-Instruct) with a DPO trainer implemented from scratch in the [TinyLLM repository](https://github.com/Abdul-Jaweed/TinyLLM) (no TRL).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nlpai-lab/KURE-v2-unsupervised,178,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"<a href=""https://github.com/nlpai-lab/KURE""> </a>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
prabakaranchandran/baby-pooh-46m-midtrain-r4b,178,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> **Experimental, work in progress.** A mid-trained version of > [Baby Pooh 46M v1](https://huggingface.co/prabakaranchandran/baby-pooh-46m), a 46M-parameter causal LM trained > from scratch on a child-scale corpus. It is **not** instruction-tuned and **not** a chat model. Mid-training adds > knowledge of A. A. Milne's Pooh world; the character itself (chat, persona, safety) comes in later post-training.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
EMD123/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Instruct-Q4_K_M-GGUF,177,2,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Instruct`](https://huggingface.co/dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Instruct) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Instruct) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
google/multiberts-seed_0-step_160k,177,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"MultiBERTs is a collection of checkpoints and a statistical library to support robust research on BERT. We provide 25 BERT-base models trained with similar hyper-parameters as [the original BERT model](https://github.com/google-research/bert) but with different random seeds, which causes variations in the initial weights and order of training instances. The aim is to distinguish findings that apply to a specific artifact (i.e., a particular instance of the model) from those that apply to the more general procedure.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kandivault/sprocket-500m,177,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 501M-parameter language model trained from scratch on a single GPU, with a goblin engineer-sage persona. Built by an independent developer under **KandiVault AI**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
oddadmix/50M-2048-Emhotob,176,7,apache-2.0,,,false,**Emhotob** is a **~51.8M-parameter** Llama-architecture language model **pre-trained from scratch on ~20 billion Arabic tokens** with a **2048-token** context window. It is a **proof-of-concept** that a *tiny* model — small enough to run on a CPU — can be trained from scratch to produce coherent Arabic.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
moganai/MoganBERT-TR,176,6,apache-2.0,,,false,"<p align=""center""> </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
emanuelealbertosi/gpt2-it-514m-gguf,176,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"| File | Variante | Utilizzo | | `gpt2-it-514m-ep2.gguf` | Instruct EP2 | Istruzioni singole, template Alpaca italiano | | `gpt2-it-514m.gguf` | Instruct precedente | Versione storica di confronto | | `gpt2-it-514m-pretrain-f16.gguf` | Solo pretraining, F16 | Completamento di testo libero, senza template Alpaca |",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Diamegs/PIT-1B-201812,175,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Point-In-Time (PIT)** is a family of GPT-style language models trained on chronologically-ordered monthly snapshots of [FineWeb](https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb). Each checkpoint captures the state of knowledge available up to a specific month, making them suitable for temporal reasoning and point-in-time analysis tasks.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AuroraAI-Research/AuroraIMG-6M,175,39,apache-2.0,,,false,"AuroraIMG-6M is a text-to-image model that's just **6.82M parameters**, and that number includes everything: the text encoder, the denoiser and the VAE. It generates 64×64 images from short English captions, and every part of it was trained from scratch on CC12M. No pretrained text encoder or VAE was used.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
