0rn0/gpt2-125m-tinystories,174,0,mit,,,false,A 125M parameter GPT-2 model trained from scratch on the [TinyStoriesV2 (cleaned)](https://huggingface.co/datasets/fhswf/TinyStoriesV2_cleaned) dataset. Built as a learning project to understand PyTorch and transformer architectures deeply.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
notyost/claudius-purus-110m-g,174,1,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,"**A generative language model with a knowledge cutoff of 0 BCE** — the full seven-language variant, including Vedic Sanskrit and the Epic of Gilgamesh. Trained from scratch (architecture, tokenizer, weights) exclusively on text composed before the Common Era. It has never seen a word written after antiquity.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
liuyanchen1015/Mistral-7B-fingerprinted-SFT-GGUF,173,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
