KVCHub/KaiLu-2-2B-GGUF,172,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"KaiLu 2 is a small language model (**1.90B parameters**) built and trained **from scratch** on a single Apple Silicon Mac with [MLX](https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx). It uses an LFM2-style hybrid architecture: mostly cheap short-convolution layers, with a smaller number of attention layers for long-range recall.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
