m87techlabs/abc-folk,164,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 864,256-parameter Llama-style language model trained from scratch with [slmkit](https://github.com/m87techlabs/slmkit) for the `abc_music` project. It is a **fine-tuned (SFT) model**: it answers requests in the format it was fine-tuned on.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
torinriley/spell-correct-transformer,164,0,mit,,,false,"A 1,001,757-parameter character-level encoder-decoder Transformer, trained **from scratch** (no pretrained weights) to correct single-word English spelling errors. Architecture, training, and evaluation code: [torinriley/hf-research](https://github.com/torinriley/hf-research/tree/main/spell-correct).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
thebajajra/RexBERT-micro,163,4,apache-2.0,,,false,"> **TL;DR**: An encoder-only transformer (ModernBERT-style) for **e-commerce** applications, trained in three phases—**Pre-training**, **Context Extension**, and **Decay**—to power product search, attribute extraction, classification, and embeddings use cases. The model has been trained on 2.3T+ tokens along with 350B+ e-commerce-specific tokens >",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kuluruvineeth/manas-64m-pretrain-moe,163,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The mixture-of-experts variant of the base model: same width and depth, but every feed-forward layer is 4 experts with top-1 routing (0.2B parameters total, about 64M active per token).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mradermacher/gasztold-0.3B-GGUF,163,0,apache-2.0,,,false,<!-- ### quantize_version: 2 --> <!-- ### output_tensor_quantised: 1 --> <!-- ### convert_type: hf --> <!-- ### vocab_type: --> <!-- ### tags: --> <!-- ### quants: x-f16 Q4_K_S Q2_K Q8_0 Q6_K Q3_K_M Q3_K_S Q3_K_L Q4_K_M Q5_K_S Q5_K_M IQ4_XS --> <!-- ### quants_skip: --> <!-- ### skip_mmproj: --> static quants of https://huggingface.co/outprime/gasztold-0.3B,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
notyost/claudius-purus-110m,163,1,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"**A generative language model with a knowledge cutoff of 0 BCE.** Trained from scratch — architecture, tokenizer, and weights — exclusively on text composed before the Common Era. It has never seen a word written after antiquity. Ask it who rules, and the only possible answer is ancient.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kuluruvineeth/manas-64m-full-sft,163,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The chat model: the pretrained base fine-tuned on conversations, short reasoning traces and tool calls. It answers simple questions and emits well-formed `<tool_call>` blocks.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Hemanth-thunder/Tamil-Mistral-7B-v0.1,162,6,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Tamil-Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pre-trained generative text model trained at the top of mistral base model 7 billion parameters. This is extends version of tokenization capability by increasing tamil tokens by 20k. Additionally, it was Pretrained on 1.19 million Tamil documents sourced from madlad-400 (Tamil) [MADLAD-400 (Multilingual Audited Dataset: Low-resource And Document-level)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.04662).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
