AETHORIA-AI/TR-HASH-MoE-200M-130B,122,4,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"TR-HASH MoE 200M is a 201.2M-parameter decoder-only base language model with grouped-query attention, a shared SwiGLU path, and deterministic token-ID routed experts. It is trained on a 70B-token unique selection from a larger pretokenized mixture, replayed to 130B total trained-token exposures.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
