jsantillana/vectrayx-nano,121,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"VectraYX-Nano is a 42M-parameter Spanish cybersecurity language model trained **from scratch** with curriculum learning and native [Model Context Protocol (MCP)](https://modelcontextprotocol.io) tool use. It is, to our knowledge, the first published Spanish-native cybersecurity LLM with end-to-end MCP integration.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
blaise-tk/TITAN,121,74,apache-2.0,,,false,"TITAN is a state-of-the-art pretrained model designed for Retrieval-based Voice Conversion (https://github.com/RVC-Project/Retrieval-based-Voice-Conversion-WebUI/) training. It offers a robust solution for transforming voice characteristics from one speaker to another, providing high-quality results with minimal training effort.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
