Welmia/welmia-1.0-81m,115,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Welmia 1.0 81M** is a lightweight, **81-million-parameter** causal language model, trained **completely from scratch** — original architecture implementation, from-random-initialization pretraining, no borrowed backbone — using a **TinyLLaMA-inspired** design: **RoPE** positional encoding, **RMSNorm**, **SwiGLU** feed-forward layers, and full **KV-cache streaming** for fast token-by-token generation. It's instruction-tuned to follow Alpaca-style prompts, and small enough to run comfortably on CPU.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
