jsantillana/vectrayx-nano-experimental,113,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> ⚠️ **Experimental release.** v14 is the **first nano checkpoint that emits tool-call syntax non-trivially** (B4=0.16 vs the v2/v4/v6/v10 floor of 0.000), trained on top of v10's Chinchilla-optimal pretrain (~894 M tokens-procesados) with an SFT mixture rebalanced toward curated tool corpus density. B5 conversational gate stays at 0.70 and B1 (CVE keyword recall) recovers to 0.337. **For production use, prefer the v7 headline release at [jsantillana/vectrayx-nano](https://huggingface.co/jsantillana/vectrayx-nano).**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
