RaphaelMourad/ModernBert-DNA-v1-37M-virus,103,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The ModernBert-DNA-v1-37M-virus Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA sequence model with 37M parameters. It is derived from ModernBERT model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using around 15071 viruses > 1kb. Virus genomes were split into 1kb sequences.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
