robotics-diffusion-transformer/rdt-170m,95,11,mit,,,false,"RDT-170M is a 170M-parameter imitation learning Diffusion Transformer **(RDT(small) in ablation)**. It has a hidden size of `1024` and a depth of `14`, which are half of that in RDT-1B. Given language instruction and RGB images of up to three views, RDT can predict the next 64 robot actions. RDT is compatible with almost all modern mobile manipulators, from single-arm to dual-arm, joint to EEF, position to velocity, and even wheeled locomotion.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
