Unluckyexe/gibc-v2-lm,91,3,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 49.8M-parameter base language model, **pretrained from scratch** (random initialisation, own tokenizer, no teacher, no distillation) on 20B tokens of openly licensed English text in 8.58 H100-hours. It was built for the [Global Innovation Build Challenge V2](https://gibc-v2.devpost.com/), Track 01 (foundational LLM development, 50M-parameter cap). Weights: **https://huggingface.co/Unluckyexe/gibc-v2-lm**. Code, training logs, ablations and every eval JSON: **https://github.com/Unluckyathecking/gibc-v2-lm**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ibraheemmoosa/xlmindic-base-multiscript,91,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model is identical in all aspects to [this model](https://huggingface.co/ibraheemmoosa/xlmindic-base-uniscript) except that we do not perform the ISO-15919 transliteration. Thus it is intended to serve as an ablation model for our study. See [this](https://huggingface.co/ibraheemmoosa/xlmindic-base-uniscript) to understand the details.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
pathcosmos/frankenstallm,91,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> **⚠️ v2 모델 교체 공지 (2026-03-26)** > > v2 GGUF 및 safetensors 파일이 변환 과정의 오류로 **1.2B 모델(hidden_size=2048, 24 layers)**로 잘못 배포되었습니다. > 2026-03-26에 올바른 **3B ORPO 체크포인트(hidden_size=3072, 28 layers, vocab_size=64256, byte-fallback 적용)**로 교체 완료했습니다. > 이전에 다운로드한 v2 파일이 있다면 재다운로드를 권장합니다.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
