sivasub987/iso20022-extract-53m,87,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 53M-parameter decoder-only transformer that reads unstructured payment correspondence and emits structured ISO 20022 fields. It trains from scratch on a single consumer laptop GPU. No frontier model, no API call, and no document leaving the machine.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
