timpal0l/Mistral-7B-v0.1-flashback-v2,86,9,mit,,,false,"Mistral-7B-v0.1-flashback-v2 is a continuation of the pretraining process for the base Mistral-7B-v0.1 model, utilizing 2 251 233 forum threads from the Swedish website https://www.flashback.org/. Which is rougly 40GB of text. It is a full finetune for one epoch.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sofieneb/omni-tiny,86,1,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"**OMNI-T** is a 7.3M-parameter pathology vision encoder distilled from **10 state-of-the-art pathology foundation models** at once. Instead of compressing all teachers into a single CLS token (vanilla multi-teacher distillation), OMNI learns **one token per teacher**, together with a structured attention mask, Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) layers and a per-teacher contrastive loss. This lets distillation keep improving as more teachers are added.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Intel/bert-base-uncased-sparse-90-unstructured-pruneofa,86,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This model is a sparse pre-trained model that can be fine-tuned for a wide range of language tasks. The process of weight pruning is forcing some of the weights of the neural network to zero. Setting some of the weights to zero results in sparser matrices. Updating neural network weights does involve matrix multiplication, and if we can keep the matrices sparse while retaining enough important information, we can reduce the overall computational overhead. The term ""sparse"" in the title of the model indicates a ratio of sparsity in the weights; for more details, you can read [Zafrir et al. (2021)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2111.05754).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
G3nadh/gemma3-270m-tinystories,86,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A custom implementation of the **Gemma 3 architecture** (scaled to 164.6M parameters), pre-trained from scratch on the TinyStories dataset.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
akoumpa/Moonlight-V4-1B-h16d256,86,0,mit,,,false,"**An untrained, ~1B-parameter DeepSeek-V4-architecture configuration** (no weights): DeepSeek-V4-architecture 1B config with 16 x 256 attention heads (CSA ratio 4 + lightning indexer). It is the small end of a Moonlight-style down-scaling of DeepSeek-V4, sized to pre-train on two 48 GB GPUs, with attention dimensions chosen so that the TileLang sparse-attention kernel fits GPUs with 99 KB of shared memory (Ada / consumer class). This is the V4-faithful variant: 7 Compressed Sparse Attention (CSA) layers with ratio-4 overlapped compression and a lightning indexer, 6 Heavily Compressed Attention (HCA) layers (ratio 128) and 2 pure sliding-window layers.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
VertexResearch/Vertex-0.6-200M-Base-Preview,85,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"An **in-progress pretraining checkpoint** of Vertex 0.6 200M, the largest model in the Vertex 0.6 family so far. This is a raw base model mid-way through its pretraining run — published as a preview so anyone can watch the model take shape. It is not the final base and has had no instruction tuning.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
singhamAstram/micro-gpt-tinystories,85,0,mit,,,false,A minimal character-level GPT model trained from scratch on the **tinystories** dataset.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
VADRK155/Cortex-1-Chat,85,1,mit,,,false,"A small GPT model for conversational chat, trained completely from scratch (custom PyTorch architecture, no `transformers` library involved).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Undi95/Mistral-11B-v0.1-GGUF,84,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This is Mistral, but in 11B.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RaphaelMourad/Mistral-DNA-v1-138M-hg38,84,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-DNA-v1-138M-hg38 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA sequence model with 138M parameters. It is derived from Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 10kb DNA sequences from the hg38 human genome assembly.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
EleutherAI/deep-ignorance-unfiltered-cb,84,1,apache-2.0,,,false,📄 [Paper](https://huggingface.co/papers/2508.06601) | 🌐 [Project Page](https://deepignorance.ai/) | 💻 [Code](https://github.com/EleutherAI/deep-ignorance),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AppleMind-AI/AppleMind-1.0-Mini-GGUF,84,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"gguf version incase anyone wants it :) sadly the model is too small for a q8 or under gguf :( so only fp32, fp16, and bf16 are avaliable for gguf",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ayushhh1010/nanoserve-27m,84,0,mit,,,false,"A 26,747,392-parameter decoder-only transformer trained from scratch on TinyStories V2. The architecture, the tokenizer and the training loop were all written by hand -- no `AutoModel`, no `tokenizers` library.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
EleutherAI/deep-ignorance-random-init,83,0,apache-2.0,,,false,> **Note:** > This is the randomly initialized checkpoint that all pretraining runs in Deep Ignorance start from. See the final checkpoints in the model suite if you are interested in capable models.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
VertexAGI/quartz-micro-preview-base,83,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A ~1B-parameter mixture-of-experts language model, trained completely from scratch — randomly-initialized weights, no distillation, no fine-tune of an existing checkpoint — on a single consumer GPU (NVIDIA GTX 1660 Ti, 6GB VRAM). No cluster, no cloud credits.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Undi95/Mistral-11B-CC-Air-GGUF,82,0,apache-2.0,,,false,CollectiveCognition-v1.1-Mistral-7B and airoboros-mistral2.2-7b glued together.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
winglian/mistral-11b-128k,82,2,apache-2.0,,,false,This is a mergekit merge of the Nous Research's Yarn-Mistral-7b-128k Large Language Model (LLM) to create an 11 billion parameter pretrained generative text model with a context,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mlx-community/Mistral-7B-v0.1-hf-4bit-mlx,82,3,apache-2.0,,,false,"This model was converted to MLX format from [`mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1`](). Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) for more details on the model. ```bash pip install mlx git clone https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-examples.git cd mlx-examples/llms/hf_llm python generate.py --model mlx-community/Mistral-7B-v0.1-hf-4bit-mlx --prompt ""My name is"" ```",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-1e21-3.4Bparams-46.3Btokens,82,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 3.4B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 1 × 10²¹ FLOPs on 46.3B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Nanite-Labs/nanites-fiorino-tabular,82,0,mit,,,false,nano quattrocento tabular fondamento model with synthetic and real-data priors.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sofieneb/omni-base,82,1,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"**OMNI-B** is a 114M-parameter pathology vision encoder distilled from **10 state-of-the-art pathology foundation models** at once. Instead of compressing all teachers into a single CLS token (vanilla multi-teacher distillation), OMNI learns **one token per teacher**, together with a structured attention mask, Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) layers and a per-teacher contrastive loss. This lets distillation keep improving as more teachers are added.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
chrishayuk/v11-tinystories-115m-base,82,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 115.1M-parameter decoder-only transformer trained **from scratch** on TinyStories for 16M tokens, using the [v11 tokenizer](https://huggingface.co/chrishayuk/v11-tokenizer).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
bbidpa/Rainbow-Pony-100m-Flutter-base,82,0,mit,,,false,"A 100M-parameter transformer, trained fully from scratch on 2B tokens (70% Flutter/Dart code, 30% English text) — no task-specific fine-tuning on the goal→diff or goal→file formats. This is the pretraining-only checkpoint that [Rainbow-Pony-100M-Flutter-direct](https://huggingface.co/bbidpa/Rainbow-Pony-100m-Flutter-direct) and [Rainbow-Pony-100M-Flutter-steps](https://huggingface.co/bbidpa/Rainbow-Pony-100m-Flutter-steps) were both fine-tuned from.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
singhamAstram/micro-glm-tinystories,82,0,mit,,,false,A minimal character-level GPT model trained from scratch on the **tinystories** dataset.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
harshit147/tinystories-gpt-27m,82,0,mit,,,false,"A small GPT-style transformer, built and trained from scratch, that generates short children's stories. Pretrained on [TinyStories](https://huggingface.co/datasets/roneneldan/TinyStories) and instruction-tuned on [TinyStories-Instruct](https://huggingface.co/datasets/roneneldan/TinyStoriesInstruct) to follow prompts specifying required words, features, and a summary.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AZERDSQ/G2-nano-instruct,82,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 60.03M-parameter decoder-only language model trained from scratch on a single 8GB NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano, then instruction-tuned on a 60k English mix. **Not an upgrade over G1-nano-instruct.** Supervised fine-tuning **lowers** the 7-task mean versus G2-nano-base. For chat, use G1-nano-instruct.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
akoumpa/Moonlight-V4-1B-h16d256-r8,82,0,mit,,,false,"**An untrained, ~1B-parameter DeepSeek-V4-architecture configuration** (no weights): DeepSeek-V4-architecture 1B config with 16 x 256 attention heads and ratio-8 compressed attention (no indexer). It is the small end of a Moonlight-style down-scaling of DeepSeek-V4, sized to pre-train on two 48 GB GPUs, with attention dimensions chosen so that the TileLang sparse-attention kernel fits GPUs with 99 KB of shared memory (Ada / consumer class). This variant replaces DeepSeek-V4's ratio-4 Compressed Sparse Attention (CSA) layers by ratio-8 compressed attention **without** a lightning indexer: 7 compressed layers at ratio 8, 6 Heavily Compressed Attention (HCA) layers at ratio 128 and 2 pure sliding-window layers. Every query attends to all causal compressed entries, so no top-k selection is nee",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
