sofieneb/omni-small,80,3,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"**OMNI-S** is a 28.7M-parameter pathology vision encoder distilled from **10 state-of-the-art pathology foundation models** at once. Instead of compressing all teachers into a single CLS token (vanilla multi-teacher distillation), OMNI learns **one token per teacher**, together with a structured attention mask, Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) layers and a per-teacher contrastive loss. This lets distillation keep improving as more teachers are added.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
