karuppusamym/slm-125m-legal-financial,79,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **125.8M-parameter** Llama-style causal language model, **pretrained from random weights** on a corpus of US case law, SEC filings, and educational web text. This is a **base text completer**, not an instruction-tuned chat model — it continues text plausibly but was never trained to follow instructions or hold a conversation, and it has no factual grounding beyond patterns in its training data.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
