RaphaelMourad/Mistral-DNA-v1-138M-yeast,78,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-DNA-v1-138M-yeast Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA text model with 17.31M parameters x 8 experts = 138.5M parameters. It is derived from Mistral-7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using around 1000 yeast genomes with 10kb DNA sequences.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
