emese-tech/er,73,0,mit,,,false,"**Ér** (""brook/rill"" — the smallest flowing water in the family name scheme) is the edge/embedded/research tier of the [Emese](https://emese.tech) Hungarian model family. Unlike the other three tiers, Ér is **not** built on EuroLLM — it's a from-scratch Hungarian foundation model, pretrained on ~4.5B tokens of Hungarian text with a custom 32k SentencePiece tokenizer.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
