usezn/Galvanize-60M,67,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"> **Update (October 2026).** The public benchmark result on this card was decontaminated against the training data of Galvanize 2, not against the data Galvanize-60M was trained on. Some of those sets, in particular the deepset prompt-injections and jackhhao jailbreak-classification test sets, very likely overlap with this model's training data, so its scores there, and the macro average that includes them, probably overstate how it does on new data. The corrected sentence is in ""Public benchmark"" below. We will publish comparable results when anyone can reproduce them. This card also no longer quotes results on attacks from our internal red-team tooling: those attacks are private, so the figures could not be checked or reproduced. The held-out results below were measured on a set that als",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mlx-community/Mistral-7B-v0.1-4bit-fused,67,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This model was converted to MLX format from [`mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1`](). Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) for more details on the model. ```bash pip install mlx git clone https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-examples.git cd mlx-examples/llms/hf_llm python generate.py --model mlx-community/Mistral-7B-v0.1-4bit-fused --prompt ""My name is"" ```",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
