CogACT/CogACT-Large,66,5,mit,,,false,"CogACT is a new advanced VLA architecture derived from VLM. Unlike previous works that directly repurpose VLM for action prediction by simple action quantization, we propose a componentized VLA architecture that has a specialized action module conditioned on VLM output. CogACT-Large employs a [DiT-L](https://github.com/facebookresearch/DiT) model as the action module.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
