yhavinga/dmbert-1024h-22l-fineweb2-2000000,62,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A ModernBERT model pretrained on FineWeb2 Dutch data. This model has 22 layers with 1024 hidden dimensions (230M parameters).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
raws-labs/tinycast,62,6,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Probabilistic zero-shot forecasting at 146,505 parameters: the smallest GIFT-Eval entry that publishes per-configuration results and declares no leakage.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nkthebass/tinybrainbot-320mV2-instruct,62,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **~326M-parameter** decoder-only language model, trained from scratch on **~10B tokens** and then **supervised-fine-tuned** for chat / instruction following. This is the **instruct** model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
bychwa/kitchenbot-base,62,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A **~6.85M** GPT-2-style language model trained **from scratch** on cooking recipes over a weekend — part of a hands-on experiment to learn the full pretrain → chat-SFT loop on a single rented GPU.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mlx-community/Qwen2-7B-4bit,61,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [mlx-community/Qwen2-7B-4bit](https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/Qwen2-7B-4bit) was converted to MLX format from [Qwen/Qwen2-7B](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-7B) using mlx-lm version **0.14.0**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
antichronology/orthrus-6-track,61,0,mit,,,false,"10M-param Mamba RNA encoder, contrastive pretrained on 45M+ mature mRNA transcripts. 6-track input (one-hot + CDS + splice).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
classla/bcms-bertic-generator,61,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"&ast; The name should resemble the facts (1) that the model was trained in Zagreb, Croatia, where diminutives ending in -ić (as in fotić, smajlić, hengić etc.) are very popular, and (2) that most surnames in the countries where these languages are spoken end in -ić (with diminutive etymology as well).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
facebook/wav2vec2-base-es-voxpopuli,61,2,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,[Facebook's Wav2Vec2](https://ai.facebook.com/blog/wav2vec-20-learning-the-structure-of-speech-from-raw-audio/) base model pretrained on the es unlabeled subset of [VoxPopuli corpus](https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.00390).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
thepowerfuldeez/imu1_base,61,3,apache-2.0,,,false,"This repository contains the IMU-1 Base model, a sample-efficient 430M parameter language model introduced in the paper [IMU-1: Sample-Efficient Pre-training of Small Language Models](https://huggingface.co/papers/2602.02522).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nabeelshan/distilbert-finetuned-agnews,61,0,mit,,,false,"This is a `distilbert-base-uncased` model fine-tuned for text classification on the **AG News** dataset. It classifies news headlines into one of four categories: **World**, **Sports**, **Business**, and **Sci/Tech**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jetbabareal/Sabir-60M,61,2,mit,,,false,"**Sabır-60M**, sıfırdan Türkçe olarak eğitilmiş, yaklaşık **60 milyon parametreli**, kompakt bir dil modelidir. Adını, standart 'erken durdurma' kuralları yerine, eğitim verisindeki dilsel kalıpları derinlemesine öğrenene kadar ""sabırla"" eğitilmesinden alır.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
vamboai/morena-0.5b-mini,61,3,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div align=""center""> </div>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
meetmendapara/Vaayu-VLM,60,0,mit,,,false,"<div align=""center"">",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
OpenLLM-France/Claire-7B-0.1,60,47,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,**Claire-7B-0.1 is a 7B parameter causal decoder-only model built by [LINAGORA](https://labs.linagora.com/) with the support of [OpenLLM-France](https://github.com/OpenLLM-France)** **adapted from [Falcon-7b](https://huggingface.co/tiiuae/falcon-7b) on French conversational data.**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-3e19-1.4Bparams-3.5Btokens,60,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 1.4B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 3.5B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
eebyp/BypBERT-tiny-zh-v3,60,0,apache-2.0,,,false,8.7M 参数中文 BERT-tiny，MacBERT 策略预训练（近义词替换 + 混合回退）。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
JohnEnev/modern-llm-v1-base,60,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 353M-parameter decoder-only transformer, built and trained from scratch — no Hugging Face Trainer, raw PyTorch. This is the **base pretrained model**: strong English fluency, but not instruction-tuned. It completes text; it does not follow instructions or answer questions like a chatbot.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MaliosDark/Nexus-Erebus-50M,60,8,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Nexus-Erebus-50M** is a compact ~54M-parameter language model trained from scratch by **Ideoa Labs**, combining strong commonsense reasoning with genuine integer arithmetic ability at tiny scale.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
IvmeLabs/Ivme-Conversate-N-v2-Instruct,60,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"9,021,600 parameters. Standard decoder-only Transformer (tied embeddings, multi-head attention, RoPE, SwiGLU, RMSNorm) -- matching Ivme-Conversate-v2-Base's proven recipe exactly, deliberately with zero architectural novelty.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nisaralll/soro-kev-0.8b,59,0,apache-2.0,,,false,```bash pip install soro-boro ```,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mlx-community/Qwen2-57B-A14B-4bit,59,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [mlx-community/Qwen2-57B-A14B-4bit](https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/Qwen2-57B-A14B-4bit) was converted to MLX format from [Qwen/Qwen2-57B-A14B](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-57B-A14B) using mlx-lm version **0.14.2**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
NikolayKozloff/Qwen2-7B-Q8_0-GGUF,59,2,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`Qwen/Qwen2-7B`](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-7B) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-7B) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
NikolayKozloff/Qwen2-7B-Q5_K_S-GGUF,58,1,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`Qwen/Qwen2-7B`](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-7B) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-7B) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ChengsenWang/ChatTime-1-7B-Base,58,6,apache-2.0,,,false,"In this paper, we innovatively model time series as a foreign language and construct ChatTime, a unified framework for time series and text processing. As an out-of-the-box multimodal time series foundation model, ChatTime provides zero-shot forecasting capability and supports bimodal input/output for both time series and text. We design a series of experiments to verify the superior performance of ChatTime across multiple tasks and scenarios, and create four multimodal datasets to address data gaps. The experimental results demonstrate the potential and utility of ChatTime.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tensorblock/ChengsenWang_ChatTime-1-7B-Chat-GGUF,58,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div style=""width: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto""> </div>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
gsumbul/SMARTIES-v1-ViT-B,58,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"<p align=""center""> </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
GetmanY1/wav2vec2-large-fi-150k,58,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The large model pre-trained on 16kHz sampled speech audio. When using the model make sure that your speech input is also sampled at 16Khz.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
EleutherAI/deep-ignorance-e2e-strong-filter-weak-knowledge-corrupted,58,1,apache-2.0,,,false,[📄 Paper](https://huggingface.co/papers/2508.06601) | [🌐 Project Page](https://deepignorance.ai/) | [💻 GitHub Repository](https://github.com/EleutherAI/deep-ignorance),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
codelion/sprog-9m,58,5,mit,,,false,"SPROG (Symbolic PROGram solver) is a 9.37M-parameter, from-scratch model that solves grade-school math word problems without any LLM at inference time.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nicolasramos/odooclaw-light-1.2b-ft-mlx-bf16,57,0,apache-2.0,,,false,**An AI agent for Odoo that anyone can run — even on a Mac Mini with 8GB of RAM.**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RabotaRu/HRBert-mini,57,4,mit,,,false,"!!! At the moment, the model is distilled, a version from one of the first checkpoints is available for download. We plan to post the full model in the next few days. !!!",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
CogACT/CogACT-Small,57,5,mit,,,false,"CogACT is a new advanced VLA architecture derived from VLM. Unlike previous works that directly repurpose VLM for action prediction by simple action quantization, we propose a componentized VLA architecture that has a specialized action module conditioned on VLM output. CogACT-Small employs a [DiT-S](https://github.com/facebookresearch/DiT) model as the action module.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
DruidTheGetafix/apiary-7B-A1B,57,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 64-expert Mixture-of-Experts language model pretrained **from scratch** on 9.84B tokens of FineWeb-Edu in 5.24 hours on one 8xB200 node (41.9 B200 GPU-hours). Architecture is exactly `Qwen3MoeForCausalLM` (16 layers, d=2048, 16/8 heads, 64 experts top-8, expert size 1024, vocab 49152): 6.85B total / 1.21B active parameters. Code, training log and configs: https://github.com/Gaurav-Shah05/apiary",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
divakar-yadav/transformer-1b-chat,57,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **1.1 billion parameter** decoder-only language model trained **entirely from scratch** -- pretraining, supervised fine-tuning, and preference alignment -- on 8x NVIDIA H100 GPUs.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tegancao/owt-45m,57,0,mit,,,false,"A **45.2M parameter** language model trained **from scratch** on a sample of [OpenWebText](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Skylion007/openwebtext) (web pages linked from Reddit; a 2.7B-token sample), as a learning project. It is a small **educational** model: useful for learning how language models work and for quick experiments, **not** for any real application. Its text has the style of news and web articles, but not reliable content.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kingjones777/Ling-3.0-flash-base-ROCmFP4-COHERENT-GGUF,56,0,mit,,,false,"> ### 🔧 Runtime: build the ROCmFPX fork below > Stock `llama.cpp` will not load this file. You need **both** the **`bailing-hybrid`** architecture > **and** the ROCmFP4 tensor types in one tree. Upstream > [`charlie12345/ROCmFPX`](https://github.com/charlie12345/ROCmFPX) has the ROCmFP4 types but > not `bailing-hybrid`. Our fork has both: > > **[`kingjones30/ROCmFPX`](https://github.com/kingjones30/ROCmFPX)** — a fork of `charlie12345/ROCmFPX`, branch `main`. > > ```bash > git clone https://github.com/kingjones30/ROCmFPX.git > cd ROCmFPX > cmake -B build -DGGML_HIP=ON -DGPU_TARGETS=gfx1151 -DGGML_NATIVE=ON -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release > cmake --build build --target llama-server llama-quantize -j$(nproc) > ``` > > Verified 2026-08-27 on gfx1151: clean clone → **0 build errors** → `llama-serve",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ibraheemmoosa/xlmindic-base-uniscript,56,2,apache-2.0,,,false,This model is pretrained on a subset of the [OSCAR](https://huggingface.co/datasets/oscar) corpus spanning 14 Indo-Aryan languages. **Before pretraining this model we transliterate the text to [ISO-15919](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_15919) format using the [Aksharamukha](https://pypi.org/project/aksharamukha/) library.** A demo of Aksharamukha library is hosted [here](https://aksharamukha.appspot.com/converter) where you can transliterate your text and use it on our model on the inference widget.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AlexWortega/moe-600m-qwen3-upcycle,56,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"A ~600M-parameter Mixture-of-Experts language model created by **sparse upcycling** of [Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B-Base](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B-Base), then continually pretrained on [Ultra-FineWeb](https://huggingface.co/datasets/openbmb/Ultra-FineWeb).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Welmia/welmia-2.0-103m-instruct,56,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 103M-parameter GPT-style language model (RoPE, RMSNorm, SwiGLU, tied embeddings), pretrained from scratch on ~5B tokens (OpenWebText), then instruction-tuned on the Alpaca dataset.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nicolasramos/odooclaw-medium-2.6b-ft-mlx,55,0,apache-2.0,,,false,**The on-device agentic model for Odoo — the best quality-to-speed tradeoff in the OdooClaw family.**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RaphaelMourad/Mistral-Prot-v1-134M,55,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-Prot-v1-134M Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative protein molecule model with 133.8M parameters. It is derived from Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for protein: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 10M protein strings from the uniprot 50 database.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mlx-community/Qwen2-57B-A14B-8bit,55,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [mlx-community/Qwen2-57B-A14B-8bit](https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/Qwen2-57B-A14B-8bit) was converted to MLX format from [Qwen/Qwen2-57B-A14B](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-57B-A14B) using mlx-lm version **0.14.2**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-2e20-4.3Bparams-6.6Btokens,55,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 4.3B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 2 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 6.6B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fav-kky/wav2vec2-base-cs-80k-ClTRUS,55,2,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,**C**zech **l**anguage **TR**ransformer from **U**nlabeled **S**peech (ClTRUS) is a monolingual Czech Wav2Vec 2.0 base model pre-trained from 80 thousand hours of Czech speech.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
YOON1v/Apex-1-DPO,55,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"**A from-scratch 1.12B decoder-only LLM, pretrained on ~20B tokens and aligned with DPO.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Lozens/Luna-Zero-110M,55,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"Luna Zero là mô hình ngôn ngữ decoder-only tiếng Việt khoảng 110M tham số, **train hoàn toàn từ số 0**; không fine-tune và không nạp trọng số pretrained của mô hình khác.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nisaralll/soro-kev-4b,54,1,apache-2.0,,,false,```bash pip install soro-boro ```,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mlx-community/Qwen2-1.5B-4bit,54,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [mlx-community/Qwen2-1.5B-4bit](https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/Qwen2-1.5B-4bit) was converted to MLX format from [Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B) using mlx-lm version **0.14.0**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tensorblock/mistral-11b-128k-GGUF,54,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div style=""width: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto""> </div>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ProCreations/Booper-Big,54,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Booper-Big is a from-scratch English MoE language model trained on the English split of `openbmb/Ultra-FineWeb`. It uses the standard Hugging Face Mixtral implementation.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nkthebass/tinybrainbot-61m-a10m-v4.1-moe-base,53,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The first **mixture-of-experts** TinyBrainBot and the first model of the v4.1 series. Every layer holds **16 experts** and each token is routed to **2** of them, so the model stores **60.6M** parameters but runs only **10.0M** per token (non-embedding; plus a 3.6M tied embedding).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Ismantic/Summer-0.5B-S0,53,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Summer-0.5B-S0 is a **from-scratch** bilingual (Chinese/English) base model: 524,336,128 parameters, trained from random initialization on **14.6B tokens** with a self-trained 81,903-piece tokenizer.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
timothywong731/tim-360m-instruct-GGUF,53,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"GGUF quantizations of [TIM-360M-instruct](https://huggingface.co/timothywong731/tim-360m-instruct) for [llama.cpp](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp), Ollama, and LM Studio. This is the **instruction-tuned** (SFT+DPO) chat model — the one to use for conversation.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
j0no12/NeroT-29M,53,1,cc-by-4.0,,,false,"A 29M-parameter encoder-decoder Transformer for chat title generation, trained from scratch on Apple Silicon with MLX.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
christianrss/chris-gpt-2-124m,53,0,mit,,,false,**Chris-GPT-2 124M** is a GPT-2-style causal language model trained from scratch on approximately **10 billion tokens from FineWeb-Edu**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MineAITechnology/mine-o1-nano,53,4,apache-2.0,,,false,"**A 124M-parameter GPT-2-style language model, pre-trained from scratch in JAX/Flax NNX on a TPU v5e-8, then supervised fine-tuned in three rounds.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Crawlnet/queen-v5,53,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A small language model trained **from scratch**. **Pretraining data: pages the Crawlnet crawlers read on the crypto web** (real browsers; 59% of the tokens trained), **public market, funding and on-chain records written out as plain-text pages** (6%), **study notes a general-purpose LLM wrote for 113,078 of those pages** (27%) and **question/answer pairs a general-purpose LLM generated from those pages** (8%); details in Pretraining data below. **Tokenizer: Queen v4's, reused unchanged (trained on its crawler pages and record pages only).** No pretrained weights, no FineWeb, no other corpus. **Chat tuning: question/answer pairs generated by a general-purpose LLM from those pages (with the study notes' own Q&A), pairs cut from the pages and open-book conversations that answer from retrieved",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tensorblock/OpenLLM-France_Claire-Mistral-7B-0.1-GGUF,52,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,"<div style=""width: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto""> </div>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-2e20-6.7Bparams-4.2Btokens,52,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 6.7B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 2 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 4.2B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ifx-pse-sys-ml/spark-13m-base,52,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **13.2M-parameter** English base language model, pretrained SmolLM-style on curated educational web + synthetic textbooks. A deliberately tiny model for small-model research, fast experimentation, and as a lightweight decoder backbone. ~10× smaller than SmolLM-135M.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kitsunejb/colpali-qdrant,52,0,gemma,,,false,"> [!IMPORTANT] > This version of ColPali should be loaded with the `transformers 🤗` release, not with `colpali-engine`. > It was converted using the [`convert_colpali_weights_to_hf.py` script](https://github.com/tonywu71/transformers/blob/21c1309637aee97ca4fb8eb3b31830913a0f99a5/src/transformers/models/colpali/convert_colpali_weights_to_hf.py) > from the [`vidore/colpali-v1.3-merged`](https://huggingface.co/vidore/colpali-v1.3-merged) checkpoint.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
thoddnn/colqwen2-v1.0-mlx-4bit,52,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [thoddnn/colqwen2-v1.0-mlx-4bit](https://huggingface.co/thoddnn/colqwen2-v1.0-mlx-4bit) was converted to MLX format from [vidore/colqwen2-v1.0-hf](https://huggingface.co/vidore/colqwen2-v1.0-hf) using mlx-lm version **0.0.3**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
EleutherAI/deep-ignorance-weak-filter-pt-strong-filter-anneal,52,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"We explore an intuitive yet understudied question: Can we prevent LLMs from learning unsafe technical capabilities (such as CBRN) by filtering out enough of the relevant pretraining data before we begin training a model? Research into this question resulted in the **Deep Ignorance Suite**. In our experimental setup, we find that filtering pretraining data prevents undesirable knowledge, doesn't sacrifice general performance, and results in models that are resistant to tampering.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
rohitnagareddy/AdbhutMOE,52,0,mit,,,false,"**AdbhutMOE** is a miniature, from-scratch Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) autoregressive language model based on the Mixtral architecture. This model was pre-trained on a sample of the `ag_news` dataset as part of a learning exercise to demonstrate the end-to-end pipeline for creating a sparse foundation model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Badalt/fr-en-transformer-scratch,52,0,mit,,,false,"An encoder-decoder Transformer trained **from scratch** (no pretrained weights) for fr→en translation, built for a generalization study: in-domain vs long sentences vs an unseen domain (literature).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Thinking,51,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"Dicta-LM 3.0 is a powerful open-weight collection of LLMs, trained on extensive corpora of Hebrew and English texts. The models are available for download and for unlimited use. The models set a new SOTA for their weight-class for Hebrew, both as base models and chat models.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kshitijthakkar/loggenix-moe-0.12B-A0.08B-e5-lr5e4-b4-3060,51,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"**LoggenixMoE133M** is a small Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) Causal Language Model trained **from scratch** on a custom dataset containing root cause analysis (RCA), code generation, and reasoning tasks.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AxionLab-Co/AxionMoE-350k-A250k,51,8,mit,,,false,> **DeepSeek-V3 architecture scaled to /~344k total parameters (/~160k active/token) — runs entirely on CPU.**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Benjamin-png/swahili-gpt-71m,51,6,cc-by-4.0,,,false,"<p align=""center""> </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
oddadmix/Nawah-50M-Egyptian-18y-Persona,51,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Nawah (نواة, ""nucleus/seed"")** is a **~51.8M-parameter** Arabic small language model fine-tuned to speak with the voice of an **18-year-old Egyptian persona**. It is a proof-of-concept for training capable Arabic models **from scratch at tiny scale** — small enough to run on a CPU, yet coherent in Modern Standard Arabic with an Egyptian cultural frame.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
OpenLLM-France/luciole-ablation-1B-en0.99-fr0.01,50,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Table of Contents** - [Model Card for the Luciole French-English Ablation Models](#model-card-for-the-luciole-french-english-ablation-models) - [Model Description](#model-description) - [Uses](#uses) - [Direct use](#direct-use) - [Out-of-Scope Use](#out-of-scope-use) - [Bias, Risks, and Limitations](#bias-risks-and-limitations) - [How to Get Started with the Model](#how-to-get-started-with-the-model) - [Load the model](#load-the-model) - [Sentence completion](#sentence-completion) - [Interim checkpoints](#interim-checkpoints) - [Training Details](#training-details) - [Training Data](#training-data) - [Training Architecture](#training-architecture) - [Training Hyperparameters](#training-hyperparameters) - [Compute Infrastructure](#compute-infrastructure) - [Citation](#citation) - [Acknowl",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
antichronology/orthrus-mlm-6-track,50,0,mit,,,false,"10M-param Mamba RNA encoder, dual-objective pretrained (contrastive + masked LM). Adds a per-position MLM head on top of the standard Orthrus backbone. Use `representation()` / `representation_unpooled()` for embeddings; use `predict_tokens()` for per-position nucleotide log-likelihoods (variant scoring).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
PierreGtch/eeg-fm-masking_jepa_rall_L1,50,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,Pretrained EEG encoder from the paper *What masking geometry works best for EEG foundation models?* ([arXiv:2609.33487](https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.33487) · [website](https://pierregtch.github.io/eeg-fm-masking) · [code](https://github.com/PierreGtch/eeg-fm-masking) · [all 58 models](https://huggingface.co/collections/PierreGtch/eeg-fm-masking-6ab912b6a03bba1348fc7366)).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Intel/bert-base-uncased-sparse-85-unstructured-pruneofa,50,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This model is a sparse pre-trained model that can be fine-tuned for a wide range of language tasks. The process of weight pruning is forcing some of the weights of the neural network to zero. Setting some of the weights to zero results in sparser matrices. Updating neural network weights does involve matrix multiplication, and if we can keep the matrices sparse while retaining enough important information, we can reduce the overall computational overhead. The term ""sparse"" in the title of the model indicates a ratio of sparsity in the weights; for more details, you can read [Zafrir et al. (2021)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2111.05754).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MCG-NJU/videomae-base-short-ssv2,50,2,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,VideoMAE model pre-trained on Something-Something-v2 for 800 epochs in a self-supervised way. It was introduced in the paper [VideoMAE: Masked Autoencoders are Data-Efficient Learners for Self-Supervised Video Pre-Training](https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.12602) by Tong et al. and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/MCG-NJU/VideoMAE).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ALM/wav2vec2-large-audioset,50,1,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,This model card presents information about pre-trained audio representation models released by ALM. These models are pre-trained on the full AudioSet dataset and are intended for general-purpose Audio Representation Learning (ARL) tasks.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Stanford-ILIAD/minivla-vq-bridge-prismatic,50,0,mit,,,false,"<b>This checkpoint is in a format that is compatible with the training script from the original [Prismatic VLMs project codebase](https://github.com/TRI-ML/prismatic-vlms), which the OpenVLA team built on top of to develop the OpenVLA model.</b>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SykoSLM/SykoLLM-Phi3-Test,50,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> **⚠️ Uyarı / Disclaimer:** Bu model şu anda aktif bir **test ve araştırma aşamasındadır**. Temel amacı, yeni nesil **Phi-3** mimarisinin yeteneklerini sıfırdan eğitilmiş (trained from scratch) bir yapıyla küçük ölçekte test etmektir. Üretime (production) hazır bir model değildir; halüsinasyon görebilir, mantıksal hatalar yapabilir veya beklenmedik yanıtlar verebilir.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
BytesTalk/PersonaMini-1-small,50,1,mit,,,false,"A **28.8M-parameter** GPT-style roleplay & chat model, **trained entirely from scratch** by **BytesTalk** — no existing model was fine-tuned; every weight was learned from random initialization. It punches well above its weight on conversational *behavior* for its size, while staying honest about the hard limits of a model this small (see **Limitations**).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
rbentaarit/kubelm-qwen3.5-2b-v1,49,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 2B parameter K8sGPT MCP tool-use specialist, trained with QLoRA on Qwen3.5-2B and quantized to Q4_K_M for CPU-only deployment. The headline deployable (**edge+** tier) of the [kubelm](https://github.com/rbentaarit/kubelm) project — supersedes the edge tier [`kubelm-qwen2.5-1.5b-v1`](https://huggingface.co/rbentaarit/kubelm-qwen2.5-1.5b-v1).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mlx-community/Qwen2-1.5B-8bit,49,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [mlx-community/Qwen2-1.5B-8bit](https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/Qwen2-1.5B-8bit) was converted to MLX format from [Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B) using mlx-lm version **0.14.0**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
OpenLLM-France/luciole-ablation-1B-en0.5-fr0.5,49,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Table of Contents** - [Model Card for the Luciole French-English Ablation Models](#model-card-for-the-luciole-french-english-ablation-models) - [Model Description](#model-description) - [Uses](#uses) - [Direct use](#direct-use) - [Out-of-Scope Use](#out-of-scope-use) - [Bias, Risks, and Limitations](#bias-risks-and-limitations) - [How to Get Started with the Model](#how-to-get-started-with-the-model) - [Load the model](#load-the-model) - [Sentence completion](#sentence-completion) - [Interim checkpoints](#interim-checkpoints) - [Training Details](#training-details) - [Training Data](#training-data) - [Training Architecture](#training-architecture) - [Training Hyperparameters](#training-hyperparameters) - [Compute Infrastructure](#compute-infrastructure) - [Citation](#citation) - [Acknowl",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
PursuitOfDataScience/argonne-3.0-base,49,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Argonne 3.0-base is a 2.88B-parameter decoder-only transformer language model from the Argonne 3.x family. It is a *base* (foundation) checkpoint trained from scratch on FineWeb-derived web text and is intended as a starting point for further continued pretraining, supervised fine-tuning, or preference optimization.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Vcecca/mamba-50m,49,4,apache-2.0,,,false,"A ~50M-parameter [Mamba](https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.00752) (selective state-space) causal language model, **pretrained from scratch on English Wikipedia**. Mamba replaces the attention mechanism of a Transformer with a selective state-space layer, giving linear-time sequence processing instead of the quadratic cost of self-attention.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
braindecode/duin-pretrained,49,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,"braindecode-native re-host of the official **Du-IN** pretrained checkpoints (Zheng et al., NeurIPS 2024), converted so they load directly with [`braindecode.models.DuIN`](https://braindecode.org/stable/generated/braindecode.models.DuIN.html).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
EleutherAI/deep-ignorance-e2e-strong-filter-strong-knowledge-corrupted,49,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"We explore an intuitive yet understudied question: Can we prevent LLMs from learning unsafe technical capabilities (such as CBRN) by filtering out enough of the relevant pretraining data before we begin training a model? Research into this question resulted in the **Deep Ignorance Suite**. In our experimental setup, we find that filtering pretraining data prevents undesirable knowledge, doesn't sacrifice general performance, and results in models that are resistant to tampering.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
EleutherAI/deep-ignorance-unfiltered-cb-lat,49,1,apache-2.0,,,false,[📚 Paper](https://huggingface.co/papers/2508.06601) - [💻 Code](https://github.com/EleutherAI/deep-ignorance) - [🌐 Project Page](https://deepignorance.ai/),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
YoAbriel/KodaLite-1.3B,49,3,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **1.27B** parameter LLaMA-style decoder-only language model, trained **entirely from scratch** on 2x NVIDIA L40S GPUs using JAX + Flax NNX, then converted to HuggingFace Transformers format.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SmallAICreator/AuroraGPT-700M,49,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**A 707M-parameter language model trained from scratch — pretrained on 22.36B tokens, then instruction-tuned on 2B more. Not a fine-tune of someone else's weights. Every parameter in this model started as noise.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
shivamtiwari93/gp-thee-11m,49,0,mit,,,false,"A GPT trained from scratch on nothing but the complete works of Shakespeare — an educational project. No pretrained weights, no borrowed tokenizer, no outside text. Everything it knows, it learned from about 5 MB of Elizabethan English on one laptop.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
openerotica/Mistral-7B-v0.1-GPTQ-ERP,48,2,apache-2.0,,,false,This is the base model quantized on an erotica dataset at 8192 sequence length. No act order and no groupsize. Not recomended for inference.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mlx-community/Qwen2-7B-8bit,48,1,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [mlx-community/Qwen2-7B-8bit](https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/Qwen2-7B-8bit) was converted to MLX format from [Qwen/Qwen2-7B](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-7B) using mlx-lm version **0.14.0**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
NikolayKozloff/Qwen2-7B-Q6_K-GGUF,48,1,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`Qwen/Qwen2-7B`](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-7B) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-7B) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mlx-community/Mistralai-8B-Diagnosis-QA,48,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"This model was converted to MLX format from [`mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1`](). Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) for more details on the model. ```bash pip install mlx git clone https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-examples.git cd mlx-examples/llms/hf_llm python generate.py --model mlx-community/Mistralai-8B-Diagnosis-QA --prompt ""My name is"" ```",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
OpenLLM-France/luciole-ablation-1B-en1.0,48,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Table of Contents** - [Model Card for the Luciole French-English Ablation Models](#model-card-for-the-luciole-french-english-ablation-models) - [Model Description](#model-description) - [Uses](#uses) - [Direct use](#direct-use) - [Out-of-Scope Use](#out-of-scope-use) - [Bias, Risks, and Limitations](#bias-risks-and-limitations) - [How to Get Started with the Model](#how-to-get-started-with-the-model) - [Load the model](#load-the-model) - [Sentence completion](#sentence-completion) - [Interim checkpoints](#interim-checkpoints) - [Training Details](#training-details) - [Training Data](#training-data) - [Training Architecture](#training-architecture) - [Training Hyperparameters](#training-hyperparameters) - [Compute Infrastructure](#compute-infrastructure) - [Citation](#citation) - [Acknowl",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
PursuitOfDataScience/argonne-4.0-base,48,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"Argonne 4.0-base is a **1.04B-parameter** decoder-only transformer trained from scratch on **65.12B tokens**, with a **65,536-token trained context**. It is the base checkpoint of the Argonne 4.0 line.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
trendmicro-ailab/Llama-Primus-Base,48,13,mit,,,false,"> TL;DR: Llama-Primus-Base is a foundation model based on Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct, continually pre-trained on Primus-Seed (0.2B) and Primus-FineWeb (2.57B). Primus-Seed is a high-quality, manually curated cybersecurity text dataset, while Primus-FineWeb consists of cybersecurity texts filtered from FineWeb, a refined version of Common Crawl. By pretraining on such a large-scale cybersecurity corpus, it achieves a 🚀**15.88%** improvement in aggregated scores across multiple cybersecurity benchmarks, demonstrating the effectiveness of cybersecurity-specific pretraining.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
thibautloiseau/gekko-vitl-500k,48,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,Self-supervised cross-view pre-training. Gekko learns co-visibility **without any 3D annotation** by predicting how much the cross-view reconstruction of a masked target improves over a purely monocular one.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
postcn/Jeju-Standard_Korean_Translator,48,11,apache-2.0,,,false,"A compact (≈88M parameter) decoder-only language model trained **from scratch** for **bidirectional translation between the Jeju dialect (제주 방언, Jejueo) and Standard Korean (표준어)**. The model uses a Qwen3-style architecture with per-head QK-Norm and is served as a single checkpoint that handles both translation directions via a prefix control token.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Rohanify/Indensa-Coder-FrontEnd,48,0,mit,,,false,"⚠️ Note: The native Ollama UI may visually collapse indentation/newlines in generated HTML. This is a UI rendering issue, not a model issue. Verify output in Ollama CLI, VS Code, or by copying the generated text into a code editor.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Skyl4r-Ai/Skylar-390M-Cobol,48,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**A 390M-parameter, from-scratch language model specialized in COBOL — small enough to run locally and on-prem, trained entirely in-house, that outperforms 7B general code models on COBOL code generation.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jackf857/Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct-DPO-HH,48,0,llama3.2,,,false,"`meta-llama/Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct` aligned with **Direct Preference Optimization** on Anthropic HH-RLHF, using a from-scratch DPO implementation — no TRL, no `DPOTrainer`, no Axolotl, no Lightning. The loss, sequence scoring, completion masking, reference handling and training loop are all explicit PyTorch.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jaswanthsanjay88/mara-small,48,1,apache-2.0,,,false,A 24.6M parameter GPT trained **from scratch** (random init → coherent children's stories) on the TinyStories corpus. Designed as the base model of the [mara](https://github.com/) project: a small-model-first family targeting browser inference and microcontrollers.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-tc-bible-big-bnt-deu_eng_fra_por_spa,47,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"- [Model Details](#model-details) - [Uses](#uses) - [Risks, Limitations and Biases](#risks-limitations-and-biases) - [How to Get Started With the Model](#how-to-get-started-with-the-model) - [Training](#training) - [Evaluation](#evaluation) - [Citation Information](#citation-information) - [Acknowledgements](#acknowledgements)",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
TheBlueObserver/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct-4bit-128-GPTQ-MLX-LinearOnly,47,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [TheBlueObserver/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct-4bit-128-GPTQ-MLX-LinearOnly](https://huggingface.co/TheBlueObserver/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct-4bit-128-GPTQ-MLX-LinearOnly) was converted to MLX format from [Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B) using mlx-lm version **0.20.2**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-3e20-998Mparams-49.8Btokens,47,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 998M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 49.8B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mradermacher/BioMatrix-1.7B-Base-GGUF,47,0,apache-2.0,,,false,<!-- ### quantize_version: 2 --> <!-- ### output_tensor_quantised: 1 --> <!-- ### convert_type: hf --> <!-- ### vocab_type: --> <!-- ### tags: --> <!-- ### quants: x-f16 Q4_K_S Q2_K Q8_0 Q6_K Q3_K_M Q3_K_S Q3_K_L Q4_K_M Q5_K_S Q5_K_M IQ4_XS --> <!-- ### quants_skip: --> <!-- ### skip_mmproj: --> static quants of https://huggingface.co/QizhiPei/BioMatrix-1.7B-Base,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kamoo-ai/kamoo-one-135m,47,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Een klein, soeverein Nederlands taalmodel — vanaf nul getraind, open tot op de laatste token.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nguyenvulebinh/wav2vec2-large-vi,47,7,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,We use wav2vec2 architecture for doing Self-Supervised learning,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Ismantic/Summer-0.5B-S1,47,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Summer-0.5B-S1 is a **from-scratch** bilingual (Chinese/English) base model: 524,336,128 parameters, trained from random initialization on **14.6B + 1.34B anneal tokens** with a self-trained 81,903-piece tokenizer.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SerFabio89/dante-2b-ita-instruct,47,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"**A 2.1B parameter bilingual Italian/English language model, trained entirely from scratch.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Zaid-Lakdawala/ZL-300M,47,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"A ~300M-parameter decoder-only Transformer, **implemented entirely from scratch in PyTorch** (no `transformers` model code, no borrowed architecture) — tokenizer, RoPE attention, SwiGLU feed-forward, RMSNorm, the training loop, and generation were all hand-written for this project.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
FrameXlabs/fragment-1,47,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"**A 9.0M-parameter System-One decision model.** Give it a **state** (any text) and **typed questions**; it returns **typed answers with calibrated probabilities in a single forward pass** — no autoregression, no text generation, no chain-of-thought, nothing to parse and nothing to hallucinate. Trained entirely from scratch on a 2-thread cloud CPU (own BPE tokenizer, own encoder, own RLCD loop — no pretrained weights, no GPU), which is the point: small enough to run anywhere, including a browser tab.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mlx-community/Qwen2-0.5B,46,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [mlx-community/Qwen2-0.5B](https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/Qwen2-0.5B) was converted to MLX format from [Qwen/Qwen2-0.5B](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-0.5B) using mlx-lm version **0.14.0**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RaphaelMourad/Mistral-DNA-v1-138M-virus,46,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-DNA-v1-138M-virus Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA text model with 17.31M parameters x 8 experts = 138.5M parameters. It is derived from Mistral-7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using around 15071 viruses > 1kb. Virus genomes were split into 1kb sequences.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
PursuitOfDataScience/argonne-3.5-base,46,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Argonne 3.5-base is a 2.88B-parameter decoder-only transformer trained from scratch. It is the base (foundation) checkpoint of the Argonne 3.5 line and the successor to [argonne-3.0-base](https://huggingface.co/PursuitOfDataScience/argonne-3.0-base).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
antichronology/orthrus-small-6-track,46,0,mit,,,false,"1.3M-param compact Mamba RNA encoder, contrastive pretrained. 6-track input.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sofieneb/omni-large,46,1,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"**OMNI-L** is a 330M-parameter pathology vision encoder distilled from **10 state-of-the-art pathology foundation models** at once. Instead of compressing all teachers into a single CLS token (vanilla multi-teacher distillation), OMNI learns **one token per teacher**, together with a structured attention mask, Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) layers and a per-teacher contrastive loss. This lets distillation keep improving as more teachers are added.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
PierreGtch/eeg-fm-masking_mae_rone_L1,46,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,Pretrained EEG encoder from the paper *What masking geometry works best for EEG foundation models?* ([arXiv:2609.33487](https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.33487) · [website](https://pierregtch.github.io/eeg-fm-masking) · [code](https://github.com/PierreGtch/eeg-fm-masking) · [all 58 models](https://huggingface.co/collections/PierreGtch/eeg-fm-masking-6ab912b6a03bba1348fc7366)).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Stanford-ILIAD/minivla-history2-vq-libero90-prismatic,46,1,mit,,,false,"<b>This checkpoint is in a format that is compatible with the training script from the original [Prismatic VLMs project codebase](https://github.com/TRI-ML/prismatic-vlms), which the OpenVLA team built on top of to develop the OpenVLA model.</b>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mradermacher/pubmedul2-tiny-nl6-GGUF,46,0,apache-2.0,,,false,<!-- ### quantize_version: 2 --> <!-- ### output_tensor_quantised: 1 --> <!-- ### convert_type: hf --> <!-- ### vocab_type: --> <!-- ### tags: --> <!-- ### quants: x-f16 Q4_K_S Q2_K Q8_0 Q6_K Q3_K_M Q3_K_S Q3_K_L Q4_K_M Q5_K_S Q5_K_M IQ4_XS --> <!-- ### quants_skip: --> <!-- ### skip_mmproj: --> static quants of https://huggingface.co/Siddharth63/pubmedul2-tiny-nl6,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
srikarkashyap/telugu-gpt-moe-sangraha-10k,46,1,cc-by-4.0,,,false,"This repository contains a **10,000-step base language-model checkpoint** trained from scratch on Telugu text from the `verified` subset of `ai4bharat/sangraha`.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Gaolaboratory/iona-contrastive-400m,46,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"iona-contrastive-400m embeds tandem mass spectra (MS/MS) so that spectra of the same peptide and charge state lie close together. It is the Iona 400m encoder fine-tuned with a supervised contrastive objective, and is suited to spectrum-to-spectrum search and clustering.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kshitijthakkar/loggenix-moe-0.3B-A0.1B-e3-lr7e5-b16-4090-v5.1-finetuned,46,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"**LoggenixMoE315M** is a 315M parameter Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) Causal Language Model trained **from scratch** on a multi-task dataset featuring **root cause analysis**, **code generation**, **instruction-following**, and **agentic reasoning tasks**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cooler8/ZeliDesk-sLM-1B,46,1,apache-2.0,,,false,> ⚠️ **Work in progress — pretraining at ~22% (4.5B / 20B tokens). Weights are intermediate and will be updated.** > This repository is updated continuously as training progresses. Intermediate checkpoints are pinned with git tags (e.g. `ckpt-step17000`) so any published state remains reproducible.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Crawlnet/queen-v4,46,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A small language model trained **from scratch**. **Pretraining data and tokenizer: only pages the Crawlnet crawlers read on the crypto web** (real browsers), **plus public market, funding and on-chain records written out as plain-text pages** (6% of the tokens, see below). No pretrained weights, no FineWeb, no other corpus. **Chat tuning: question/answer pairs generated by a general-purpose LLM from those pages** (details below). Expect a dumb, funny, confidently-wrong model; that is the point.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Ryosei-Akatsuka/psdel-lm-20m,46,1,cc0-1.0,,,false,"~20.3M-parameter English causal LM: 12 layers in a 3:1 interleave of **Kimi Delta Attention (KDA)** and **full attention (MQA)**, NoPE, ReLU^2 FFN, tied embedding head. Trained **from scratch** on 1B tokens of FineWeb/FineWeb-Edu, then instruction-tuned on `databricks/databricks-dolly-15k`.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
vllm-sr/toolcall-verifier,45,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div align=""center"">",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
