javimosch/mtlm-7m-tools,43,0,mit,,,false,"Fine-tune of [`javimosch/mtlm-7m-base`](https://huggingface.co/javimosch/mtlm-7m-base) that decides between answering in plain English and emitting a one-line JSON tool call, over 14 generic tools (weather, calculator, web search, time, read/write file, HTTP GET, email, translate, shell, unit conversion, reminders, notes, wikipedia). Served by [anvil](https://github.com/javimosch/machin-anvil), it speaks the OpenAI chat-completions protocol including `tool_calls`.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
