ATH-MaaS/Marco-LLM-AR-V2,41,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"Marco-LLM-AR is a series of enhanced language models specifically fine-tuned for common languages used in the Arab world, including Modern Standard Arabic and several dialects. This repository contains the 7B Marco-LLM-AR base language model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
