qihoo360/360Zhinao2-7B-Chat-32K-Int4,41,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div align=""center""> <h1> 360Zhinao2 (360智脑) </h1> </div> <div align=""center""> 🤗 <a href=""https://huggingface.co/qihoo360"">HuggingFace</a>&nbsp&nbsp | &nbsp&nbsp 🤖 <a href=""https://modelscope.cn/organization/360zhinao"">ModelScope</a>&nbsp&nbsp ｜ &nbsp&nbsp 💬 <a href=""./assets/WeChat.png"">WeChat (微信)</a>&nbsp&nbsp ｜ &nbsp&nbsp <a href=""https://github.com/Qihoo360/360zhiano2"">GitHub</a>&nbsp&nbsp </div> <br> <p align=""center""> Feel free to visit 360Zhinao's official website<a href=""https://ai.360.com""> https://ai.360.com</a> for more experience. </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
manvadariya1/Zynthos-Reasoning-4B-GGUF,40,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Zynthos-Reasoning-4B is a highly specialized, compute-optimized local reasoning model engineered to execute complex multi-step logical chain-of-thought operations directly at the edge.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
lautiss/brain-v0.1-base,40,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A small model fine-tuned to **use MCP tools**: pick the right tool, fill in its arguments, read the results, recover from errors, ask before acting when something is missing, and answer in the user's language. It is `Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B` plus a LoRA adapter, trained only on synthetic data from **forge** (a plan-driven dataset generator, ""Run A"": forge-only, no distillation from a bigger model). It is the baseline for later versions.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
openerotica/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1-GPTQ-32g-wikitext,40,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This is the instruct model quantized on the wikitext2 dataset at 8192 sequence length. Act order true and 32 groupsize.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
