submarat/gpt2-small-fineweb-edu-10b,38,0,mit,,,false,"A from-scratch reproduction of GPT-2 small (124M), trained on **10B tokens of (`sample-10BT`)** on a single H100 (~13 h). The custom training implementation was converted to a standard `GPT2LMHeadModel` for distribution (verified numerically exact vs. the original model, max logit diff ~1e-6).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
