MaliosDark/Nexus-Erebus-3M,37,3,mit,,,false,"A **3-million-parameter** language model trained from scratch. It is an arithmetic specialist: it handles integer arithmetic well for its size, and stays near chance on general tasks, at a footprint that runs almost anywhere.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
