matt-hans93/ups-tools-qwen2.5-7b,36,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"UPS Tool-Use Qwen2.5 7B is a QLoRA fine-tune of Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct for generating structured Hermes function-calling payloads for a UPS MCP server. It maps natural-language shipping and logistics requests to 18 UPS MCP tools covering tracking, rating, shipment creation, pickup workflows, address validation, paperless documents, landed cost, and location lookup.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
