RaphaelMourad/Mistral-Prot-v1-417M,36,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-Prot-v1-417M Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative protein molecule model with 417M parameters. It is derived from Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for protein: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 10M protein strings from the uniprot 50 database.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
humbleworth/domain-mlm,36,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model is a CANINE-based character-level language model that has been further pre-trained on domain names using masked language modeling (MLM). It's designed to understand and predict patterns in domain names at the character level.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
