kingabzpro/mistral_7b_guanaco,33,3,apache-2.0,,,false,The following `bitsandbytes` quantization config was used during training: - quant_method: bitsandbytes - load_in_8bit: False - load_in_4bit: True - llm_int8_threshold: 6.0 - llm_int8_skip_modules: None - llm_int8_enable_fp32_cpu_offload: False - llm_int8_has_fp16_weight: False - bnb_4bit_quant_type: nf4 - bnb_4bit_use_double_quant: False - bnb_4bit_compute_dtype: bfloat16,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
