sandbreak80sd/llm-350m-instruct-v2,30,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This is V2 of a 350M parameter language model I trained from scratch as a personal learning project. V2 improves on [V1](https://huggingface.co/sandbreak80sd/llm-350m-instruct) by replacing Alpaca-cleaned with OpenHermes-2.5 — 200K GPT-4 generated examples in ChatML format instead of 52K GPT-3.5 examples in Alpaca format. Same pretrained base, better finetuning data.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
