oddadmix/50M-8192-Nawah-gemma,30,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A **~51.8M-parameter** Gemma-3 architecture Arabic language model pretrained **from scratch** on **20 billion Arabic tokens** with an **8192-token** context window.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
razor5050/SmolGuru-80M-512,30,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This public repo is being prepared for an ~80M parameter LLaMA-style chatbot trained from scratch with the `HuggingFaceTB/SmolLM2-135M-Instruct` tokenizer.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
glassbox/gpt-alpha-bg-91m,30,0,mit,,,false,"A 91.26M-parameter decoder-only GPT trained from scratch on Bulgarian text, with no pretrained initialization, in a nanoGPT-style codebase. Its measured strength is judging Bulgarian fluency by perplexity: on error/correction pairs it is statistically on par with Gemini, offline, on a CPU.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Pedro21613/PS-1.0-GGUF,30,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Modelo leve construído DO ZERO (sem pesos base). Arquitetura decoder-only, tokenizer BPE próprio. Multilíngue com foco em português + gírias, noções de programação, matemática básica. Baixa alucinação por design: instruído a dizer ""não sei"" e não inventar fatos recentes. Corte de conhecimento: 2026-09. Para fatos novos, use RAG / verificação externa.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sraivante/sans-llm-10m-pilot,30,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,"> **Status: pilot / proof-of-concept. Not a final model.** > This is the first end-to-end run of a tiny Sanskrit language model built from scratch on a laptop CPU. > It exists to validate the pipeline (scrape → clean → tokenize → train → sample), not to be useful yet. > Expect grammatical-looking but meaningless Sanskrit, repetition loops, and stray artefacts. See *Known issues*.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Undi95/Mistral-11B-Airoboros-RP-v1,29,1,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,Mistral-7B and airoboros-mistral2.2-7b glued together and finetuned with qlora of Pippa and LimaRPv3 dataset.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
lucyknada/Mistral-7B-v0.1-exl2-2bpw,29,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
OpenLLM-France/Claire-7B-EN-0.1,29,1,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,**Claire-7B-EN-0.1 is a 7B parameter causal decoder-only model built by [LINAGORA](https://labs.linagora.com/) with the support of [OpenLLM-France](https://github.com/OpenLLM-France)** **adapted from [Falcon-7b](https://huggingface.co/tiiuae/falcon-7b) on English conversational data.**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ATH-MaaS/Marco-LLM-AR-V4,29,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Marco-LLM-AR is a series of enhanced language models specifically fine-tuned for common languages used in the Arab world, including Modern Standard Arabic and several dialects. This repository contains the 7B Marco-LLM-AR base language model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
