Crocolil/Chiikamini,29,0,mit,,,false,"Petit modele de langage **decoder-only** (3.94 M parametres) ecrit from scratch en PyTorch, pour tester des applications locales sans charger un vrai LLM en RAM. **Ce n'est pas un modele destine a un usage reel** : il complete du code de facon plausible mais ne raisonne pas.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
yennik16/text-to-stl-part-classifier,29,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Stage 1 of a text-to-STL pipeline. It reads a plain-English description of a simple mechanical part and decides which of five part families it is: **pipe_gasket, washer, bracket, rect_container, cyl_container**. The predicted type then selects the schema the [parameter extractor](https://huggingface.co/yennik16/text-to-stl-parameter-extractor) fills in.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
navthings/airgpt-night,29,1,mit,,,false,"a 40M param model trained from scratch in eight hours on a macbook air (m5, 16gb, no fan) with [airgpt](https://github.com/navthings/airgpt). the air didn't throttle once the whole night.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
VishwamAI/vishwamai-base-v0,29,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Mixture-of-experts decoder-only language model trained **from scratch** (no distillation, no pre-trained weights) with JAX / Flax / Optax and a SentencePiece tokenizer (English, Hindi, Telugu).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mach-kernel/ecu-pilot-q4km,28,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Quantized GGUF of [ecu-pilot-fp16](https://huggingface.co/mach-kernel/ecu-pilot-fp16) — a fine-tuned Qwen3.5-35B-A3B for structured tool calling against project metadata via MCP.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
lschaffer/qwen2.5-3b-weathersensorsmcp-ollama,28,0,apache-2.0,,,false,> ⚠️ **This model is trained for the weathersensorsmcp MCP server.** > It is optimised for structured MCP tool-call generation and is not intended > to be a general-purpose assistant.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
beatsprom/qwen-stateless-mcp-agent-2026,28,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This model repository contains the official LoRA adapter and Ollama Modelfile fine-tuned on the **Enterprise Stateless MCP & Agent Evaluation Suite (2026)**. It specializes in zero-defect, deterministic execution of Model Context Protocol (MCP 2026 JSON-RPC 2.0) tool calls across 25 production infrastructure domains.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
typeof/tiny-llama-1B,28,0,apache-2.0,,,false,WIP,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Tweeties/tweety-7b-italian-v24a,28,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"**This model is currently in development.** The weights are available, but could change at any moment.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
drmcbride/Qwen2-1.5B-Q2_K-GGUF,28,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B`](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
phi0112358/Qwen2-1.5B-Q8_0-GGUF,28,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B`](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tbilisi-ai-lab/kona2-12B-Base,28,4,apache-2.0,,,false,**Kona2-12B-Base** is a 12-billion parameter base language model optimized for Georgian language understanding and generation. It is built by continue-pretraining [Mistral-Nemo-Base-2407](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-Nemo-Base-2407) on approximately **30 billion tokens** of Georgian/English data with expanded Georgian vocabulary.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-3e18-358Mparams-1.6Btokens,28,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 358M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10¹⁸ FLOPs on 1.6B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
abhishekai/slm-125m-legal-base,28,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 125M-parameter Llama-architecture base model pretrained from scratch on a legal- and finance-heavy corpus (US case law, SEC filings, and a slice of FineWeb-Edu).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SereneC/AHA-WAM-Pretrained,28,0,mit,,,false,This repository releases RoboCOIN-pretrained checkpoints for **AHA-WAM** and **Fast-WAM**. These checkpoints are intended as initialization weights for real-robot fine-tuning and deployment experiments with the public AHA-WAM codebase.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Ericu950/Stoicheia-doc_clean,28,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Stoicheia** is a 405M-parameter character-level masked-diffusion encoder for Ancient Greek (`d_model` 1024, depth 32, banded attention: three of every four blocks attend within a 256-character window, the fourth globally). Its input is factored into five aligned planes -- letters, word/sentence boundaries, diacritics, capitalization, punctuation -- each of which can be masked independently to an explicit *unknown* state at inference. That is what lets one model read an edited text, *scriptio continua*, and a lacuna of unknown length without changing anything but its input.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
0arch-io/kisoku-1.6b,28,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Kisoku 1.6B is a base (not chat) language model pretrained from random initialization by one person, Joseph Rodriguez at 0ARCH, on a TPU v4-32 from Google's TPU Research Cloud. It has 1,600,749,056 parameters, saw about 0.5 trillion tokens of pretraining text (524.4B including the long-context phases), and was extended to 64K tokens of context. All numbers below come from the technical report draft (draft 4, 2026-10-07) and were measured by me on my own hardware.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Hexian-2001/DeepWind1.0-890M,28,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"DeepWind1.0-890M is the 888M-parameter base checkpoint of **DeepWind**, a decoder-only Transformer foundation model for zero-shot probabilistic wind-power forecasting, introduced in",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
PierreGtch/eeg-fm-masking_jepa_rone_L16,28,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,Pretrained EEG encoder from the paper *What masking geometry works best for EEG foundation models?* ([arXiv:2609.33487](https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.33487) · [website](https://pierregtch.github.io/eeg-fm-masking) · [code](https://github.com/PierreGtch/eeg-fm-masking) · [all 58 models](https://huggingface.co/collections/PierreGtch/eeg-fm-masking-6ab912b6a03bba1348fc7366)).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
PierreGtch/eeg-fm-masking_jepa_r6cm_L33,28,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,Pretrained EEG encoder from the paper *What masking geometry works best for EEG foundation models?* ([arXiv:2609.33487](https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.33487) · [website](https://pierregtch.github.io/eeg-fm-masking) · [code](https://github.com/PierreGtch/eeg-fm-masking) · [all 58 models](https://huggingface.co/collections/PierreGtch/eeg-fm-masking-6ab912b6a03bba1348fc7366)).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jcblaise/electra-tagalog-base-uncased-discriminator,28,0,gpl-3.0,,,false,**Deprecation Notice** This model is deprecated. New Filipino Transformer models trained with a much larger corpora are available. Use [`jcblaise/roberta-tagalog-base`](https://huggingface.co/jcblaise/roberta-tagalog-base) or [`jcblaise/roberta-tagalog-large`](https://huggingface.co/jcblaise/roberta-tagalog-large) instead for better performance.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
stefan-it/electra-base-gc4-64k-0-cased-discriminator,28,1,mit,,,false,"This repository presents a colossal (and biased) language model for German trained on the recently released [""German colossal, clean Common Crawl corpus""](https://german-nlp-group.github.io/projects/gc4-corpus.html) (GC4), with a total dataset size of ~844GB.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
claudios/cubert-20210711-Python-512,28,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"This model is the unofficial HuggingFace version of ""[CuBERT](https://github.com/google-research/google-research/tree/master/cubert)"". In particular, this version comes from [gs://cubert/20210711_Python/pre_trained_model_epochs_2__length_512](https://console.cloud.google.com/storage/browser/cubert/20210711_Python/pre_trained_model_epochs_2__length_512). It was trained 2021-07-11 for 2 epochs with a 512 token context window on the Python BigQuery dataset. I manually converted the Tensorflow checkpoint to PyTorch and have uploaded it here. The [tokenizer](https://github.com/google-research/google-research/blob/master/cubert/python_tokenizer.py) has not been converted yet. All credit goes to Aditya Kanade, Petros Maniatis, Gogul Balakrishnan, and Kensen Shi.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AILabTUL/mELECTRA,28,1,cc-by-4.0,,,false,"mELECTRA is an [Electra](https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.10555)-based model pretrained on a diverse multilingual corpus. It supports multiple languages, including **Swedish (SE), Slovenian (SL), Slovak (SK), Portuguese (PT), Polish (PL), Norwegian (NO), Italian (IT), Croatian (HR), French (FR), English (EN), Danish (DK), German (DE), and Czech (CZ)**. The model can be fine-tuned for various NLP tasks such as text classification, named entity recognition, and masked token prediction.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dstilesr/glotlid-pretrained-roberta,28,1,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was pretrained using Masked Language Modeling (MLM) objective on multilingual text data.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
damjanzimbakov/qwen3-1.7b-macedonian-pretrain,28,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model is a continued-pretraining checkpoint of Qwen3-1.7B on Macedonian text.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Gaolaboratory/iona-base-100m,28,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Iona is a transformer encoder foundation model for tandem mass spectra (MS/MS). It treats each centroided peak as a token and learns how peaks relate to each other through a per-head attention bias over the signed m/z difference (Δm/z) between every pair of peaks.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SykoSLM/SykoLLM-V5.7-Mini,28,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"SykoLLM-V5.7-Mini, sıfırdan (from scratch) eğitilmiş, Türkçe ve İngilizce destekli, kod anlama kapasitesine sahip küçük ölçekli bir dil modelidir. Phi-3 mimarisi temel alınarak özel BPE tokenizer ile geliştirilmiştir.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Ethangou/attention-residuals-100M-baseline,28,0,mit,,,false,"This is the 100M baseline checkpoint for the attention-residuals-reproduction project. It uses a standard Qwen3-style decoder-only Transformer with standard residual connections, trained from scratch on Chinese data.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tako080614/evex-4,28,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,ある Discord サーバーのログだけから**ゼロから**学習した日本語の会話モデル。 既存の重みからの派生ではなく、tokenizer も含めて全部このサーバーのために作ってある。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ajaxdavis/alpha-er,28,0,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"**alpha-er** (二, *èr* — ""two"") is a 100M-parameter language model trained end to end on a **from-scratch GPU stack**: our own ioctl driver, memory manager, command channels, sm_86 SASS assembler and kernel IR. **No CUDA, no cuBLAS, no vendor runtime** was involved in training — every matrix multiply ran on hand-written machine code.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
OpceanAI/PASITA,28,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **decoder-only language model trained 100% from scratch** (no base model), specialized in a single task: converting **plain text into valid Markdown while preserving information**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
vamboai/morena-0.5b-mini-instruct,28,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div align=""center""> </div>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
lschaffer/qwen2_5_1_5b-webcrawl,27,0,apache-2.0,,,false,> ⚠️ **This model is trained for the webcrawl MCP server.** > It is optimised for structured MCP tool-call generation and is not intended > to be a general-purpose assistant.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Undi95/Mistral-11B-CC-Air,27,0,apache-2.0,,,false,CollectiveCognition-v1.1-Mistral-7B and airoboros-mistral2.2-7b glued together.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
TheBloke/KAI-7B-beta-GPTQ,27,1,apache-2.0,,,false,<!-- markdownlint-disable MD041 -->,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
FriendliAI/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2-fp8,27,12,apache-2.0,,,false,"<!-- header start --> <p align=""center""> </p> <!-- header end -->",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
rudyon/rudygpt,27,2,mit,,,false,A 124M parameter causal language model trained from scratch using [rudyon/pipeline](https://github.com/rudyon/pipeline) on the [HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-edu](https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-edu) dataset.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
soichi1208/SSSSLM-JP-v1-0.6B,27,6,apache-2.0,,,false,日本語特化の小型言語モデル（Small Language Model）です。スクラッチから学習しました。 小さいし、初めてモデルなのでかなり精度は悪いです。 というかいろいろな制約によりtrain/loss 3.05くらいで止めてるので。大規模な進展があれば次のver出すかもね。 動作確認はvLLMにてRTX 4070 SUPER 12GBでしました。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-3e18-273Mparams-2.2Btokens,27,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 273M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10¹⁸ FLOPs on 2.2B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-9e19-1.9Bparams-7.4Btokens,27,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 1.9B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 9 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 7.4B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dvitvaai/pothana-base-v2-225M,27,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A ~225M parameter LLaMA-style decoder pretrained from scratch on a mixed Telugu (~91%) + English (~9%) corpus with a hybrid morfessor + BPE tokenizer. Designed as a strong base model for downstream retrieval-augmented and instruction fine-tuning on Telugu.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MikeLee000/olmo3-190m-zh-full,27,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"- hidden_size: 768, num_layers: 12, num_heads: 12, intermediate_size: 3072 - vocab_size: 48000, sliding_window: 4096",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
chifural/Mhondoro-Tokenizer-base,27,0,mit,,,false,"`Mhondoro-Tokenizer-base` is part of the **Mhondoro** family of open-source foundation models for financial time-series forecasting, released by [Louis Chifura](https://huggingface.co/chifural).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
stefan-it/electra-base-gc4-64k-200000-cased-discriminator,27,0,mit,,,false,"This repository presents a colossal (and biased) language model for German trained on the recently released [""German colossal, clean Common Crawl corpus""](https://german-nlp-group.github.io/projects/gc4-corpus.html) (GC4), with a total dataset size of ~844GB.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
PommesPeter/prism-qwen25-extra-siglip-224px-0_5b,27,0,mit,,,false,"This model is trained on the Llava-1.5-Instruct dataset. The official [MiniVLA](https://github.com/Stanford-ILIAD/openvla-mini) model uses a **single vision encoder (Siglip)**, which is the key difference.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Beebey/smallcoder-303m,27,4,apache-2.0,,,false,**SmallCoder** is a **303M parameter** LLaMA-style language model trained **from scratch** for **code generation** and **algorithmic reasoning**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RameshRathod/ego-153m-modern,27,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"Ego-153M-Modern is a **153M-parameter decoder-only Transformer** trained **from scratch** as a hands-on exploration of modern LLM architecture, optimization, and deployment workflows.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
uditmukherjee/glassbox-gpt-shakespeare,27,0,mit,,,false,"A small **GPT built entirely from scratch** — autograd engine, attention, the lot — and trained on character-level Tiny Shakespeare. It's tiny (**10.8M parameters**) and it only knows characters, yet it writes recognisable Shakespearean verse: speaker tags, archaic diction, the rhythm of a play.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
timothywong731/tim-360m-base,27,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **361.8M-parameter** decoder-only transformer, trained **from scratch** on ~30B tokens on 2× RTX 4090. Part of [TIM](https://github.com/) (Transformer Inference Model) — an end-to-end, from-scratch LLM built to be legible and honestly evaluated.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Kentucky-Open-Science/KOS-V5-Retriever,27,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"<p align=""center""> </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ajaxdavis/alpha-60m-chat,27,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"> [!CAUTION] > Alpha now initiates and stops ordinary replies reliably, but it has **not** passed the full chat-quality gate. > It can be shallow, wrong, repetitive, or overly roleplay-like. Use it as an inspectable research model, not a > dependable assistant or source of facts.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tako080614/evex-5,27,1,cc-by-4.0,,,false,ある Discord サーバーのログだけから**ゼロから**学習した日本語の会話モデル。 既存の重みからの派生ではなく、tokenizer も含めて全部このサーバーのために作ってある。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MenteEAI/mentee-embed-v4,27,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"**A 41M-parameter trilingual text embedding model trained entirely from scratch — no pretrained backbone, no BERT, no RoBERTa. Random initialization only.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
navyam-ai/navya-1c-sft,27,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Navya** is an India-first financial foundation model family, trained **from scratch** on an India-first corpus (finance + English + Hindi/Hinglish and other Indian languages), custom 64k tokenizer.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ParallaxOpen/Vela-Lumen-31M-v1.1-preview,27,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,**Trained from scratch on a single laptop GPU. Outperforms models 4x-10x larger.**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
qihoo360/360Zhinao2-7B-Chat-360K-Int4,27,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div align=""center""> <h1> 360Zhinao2 (360智脑) </h1> </div> <div align=""center""> 🤗 <a href=""https://huggingface.co/qihoo360"">HuggingFace</a>&nbsp&nbsp | &nbsp&nbsp 🤖 <a href=""https://modelscope.cn/organization/360zhinao"">ModelScope</a>&nbsp&nbsp ｜ &nbsp&nbsp 💬 <a href=""./assets/WeChat.png"">WeChat (微信)</a>&nbsp&nbsp ｜ &nbsp&nbsp <a href=""https://github.com/Qihoo360/360zhiano2"">GitHub</a>&nbsp&nbsp </div> <br> <p align=""center""> Feel free to visit 360Zhinao's official website<a href=""https://ai.360.com""> https://ai.360.com</a> for more experience. </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Yhyu13/Qwen3.5-2B-UE5-LoRA,26,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A PEFT/LoRA adapter that fine-tunes **Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B** to emit structured **tool-calling responses for Unreal Engine 5 development tasks** (function calls that conform to the UE5 MCP server's tool schema in [`config/mcp_config.json`](https://huggingface.co/Yhyu13/UE5_Training_MCP)).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Simon-Liu/gemma-4-E4B-it-open-doc,26,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **LoRA adapter** for MCP tool calling, trained by **[colab-finetune-mcp](https://github.com/simonliu-ai-product/colab-finetune-mcp)** through its teacher-driven pipeline: reverse-generate the data, filter it for quality, then run SFT.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
openerotica/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1-GPTQ-ERP,26,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This is the base model quantized on an erotica dataset at 8192 sequence length. No act order and no groupsize. Not recomended for inference.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
openerotica/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1-GPTQ-128g-ERP,26,1,apache-2.0,,,false,This is the instruct model quantized on an erotica dataset at 8192 sequence length. Act order true and 128 groupsize.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
alexsherstinsky/Mistral-7B-v0.1-sharded,26,15,apache-2.0,,,false,This is just a version of https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1 which is sharded to 2GB maximum parts in order to reduce the RAM required when loading.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
osanseviero/Mistral-7B-v0.1,26,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
FriendliAI/Mixtral-8x22B-v0.1-fp8,26,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"<!-- header start --> <p align=""center""> </p> <!-- header end -->",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
vivekmarakana/shunya-0.5b-base,26,0,mit,,,false,Shunya-0.5B-Base is a 503M-parameter decoder-only language model trained from scratch on a curated mix of web text and synthetic educational data. It is a base (pretrained) model — not instruction-tuned — intended as a foundation for fine-tuning and research.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
puigde/rwkv7-380M-15B-slimpajama,26,1,apache-2.0,,,false,> This model is for research purposes only and is not intended for production use.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dvitvaai/pothana-stage-a-plus-225M,26,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Stage A+ extends [`dvitvaai/pothana-base-v2-225M`](https://huggingface.co/dvitvaai/pothana-base-v2-225M) with **code-mix and Roman Telugu (Tenglish) capabilities**. The model can now read and write Telugu in three styles:,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Kentucky-Open-Science/KOS-V4-Base,26,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,"<div align=""center""> </div>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nkthebass/TinyBrainBot-303m-base,26,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **303M-parameter, LLaMA-architecture** language model trained **from scratch on a home server** (2× NVIDIA Tesla P100). This is the **base (pretrained) model** — it has *not* been instruction-tuned, so it **completes text** rather than following chat instructions.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mlfoundations/dcvlm-1b-model,26,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**DCVLM-1B** is the `small`-scale reference 1B-parameter VLM from our [DataComp-VLM](https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.28551) paper, pretrained from scratch on **DCVLM-Baseline**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
chrimerss/flood-foundation-resnet101-unet,26,0,mit,,,false,This model is a ResNet-101 U-Net fine-tuned for flood risk segmentation from Digital Elevation Models (DEM) and precipitation data.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ukung/tinyv4,26,0,mit,,,false,"**TinyV4** is a compact **11 million parameter** bilingual (Indonesian & English) base model. Think of it as a solid foundation — pre-trained, ready to be fine-tuned for your specific downstream task.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
InertialAI/Chronicle,26,3,apache-2.0,,,false,"<p align=""center""> <a href=""https://www.inertialai.com""> </a> </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
LeBenchmark/wav2vec-FR-1K-Male-base,26,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"LeBenchmark provides an ensemble of pretrained wav2vec2 models on different French datasets containing spontaneous, read, and broadcasted speech.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
facebook/hiera-huge-224-mae-hf,26,1,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"**Hiera** is a _hierarchical_ vision transformer that is fast, powerful, and, above all, _simple_. It was introduced in the paper [Hiera: A Hierarchical Vision Transformer without the Bells-and-Whistles](https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.00989/) and outperforms the state-of-the-art across a wide array of image and video tasks _while being much faster_.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
GetmanY1/wav2vec2-large-fi-lp-from-scratch,26,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The large model pre-trained on 16kHz sampled speech audio. When using the model make sure that your speech input is also sampled at 16Khz.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
harindhar10/OLMo-7B-fsdp-Pubchem-100k,26,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"accumulate_grad_batches:1 num_devices = 8 batch_size:16 data_file:""pubchem-10m.txt"" lr:0.00003 max_epochs:3 max_length:512 model_id:""allenai/OLMo-7B-hf"" num_samples:100,000",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
harindhar10/OLMo-7B-fsdp-Pubchem-500k-1epochs-eos,26,0,apache-2.0,,,false,<!-- Provide a quick summary of what the model is/does. -->,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
oddadmix/Emhotob-5M-v2,26,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Emhotob** is a family of small Arabic language models pretrained **from scratch** on Arabic web text. This is the **5M** rung of the ladder (~5.08M parameters), part of a scaling series ranging from 500K to 25M parameters that all share the same tokenizer, context length, and training recipe. This is the **v2** run: trained from scratch on ~5B tokens per model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tsingla98/frawdllm-100m,26,0,mit,,,false,A 109M parameter language model trained from scratch for learning purposes.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MonumentalSystems/wire-9m-best,26,0,mit,,,false,"WireNative 9M — 64 harmonics, 8 layers, selected BPB checkpoint.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
FiShota/hinomoto-1b-v1-phase2-full,26,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,"955M-parameter from-scratch Japanese decoder-only LM. Trained on a single RTX 3090 in bf16 mixed precision from random init, **50,000 step** full pretrain.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AlexWortega/moe100m-physics-tinybpe,26,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **~100M-active Qwen3-style sparse-MoE** language model trained **from scratch** on physics-simulation next-frame-prediction text, with a **custom 512-token ByteLevel-BPE** whose vocabulary is simulation-only (digits, punctuation, structural keywords). Built autonomously by the ml-intern Claude Code skill.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
helloadhavan/llara1.1-100M-base,26,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"Llara1.1 is a 124M parameter (33M params more than llara1.0) autoregressive language model trained from scratch on English web text. It follows the GPT-2 Small architecture and is trained entirely from random initialisation — no pretrained weights, no distillation, no fine-tuning of an existing model. but it does use GPT's tokenizer (sorta)",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MLVXN/microllm,26,0,mit,,,false,-- Use the non GGUF version for now. --,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Skyl4r-Ai/Skylar-980M-Cobol-Decider,26,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> 🔬 **Published as a transparent research for the Skylar framework, not as a general-purpose or SOTA model.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Jvachier/punctuation-casing-en-7m,26,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,"A small transformer that **restores punctuation and casing** in lowercase, unpunctuated English text such as voice-note or speech-to-text output:",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ajesujoba/AfriHuBERT-xlarge,25,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This is a 1B parameter multilingual self-supervised speech encoder based on the English HuBERT-XL model, facebook/hubert-xlarge-ll60k. We performed continued pretraining through multilingual adaptive finetuning (MAFT) on over 10,000 hours of African language data aggregated from various sources.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
TheBloke/KAI-7B-beta-AWQ,25,2,apache-2.0,,,false,<!-- markdownlint-disable MD041 -->,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
OpenLLM-France/Claire-7B-Apache-0.1,25,7,apache-2.0,,,false,**Claire-7B-Apache-0.1 is a 7B parameter causal decoder-only model built by [LINAGORA](https://labs.linagora.com/) and [OpenLLM-France](https://github.com/OpenLLM-France)** **adapted from [Falcon-7b](https://huggingface.co/tiiuae/falcon-7b) on French conversational open data.**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
