timothywong731/tim-360m-instruct,24,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The **instruction-tuned** variant of [TIM-360M-base](https://huggingface.co/timothywong731/tim-360m-base) — a **361.8M-parameter** decoder-only transformer trained **from scratch** on 2× RTX 4090. Post-trained with **SFT → DPO**, no TRL.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MenteEAI/mentee-embed-v1,24,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**mentee-embed-v1** is a compact **41M-parameter** multilingual text embedding model supporting **Arabic, English, and Urdu**, trained entirely from scratch — no pretrained BERT or transformer base was used.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
