dcostenco/prism-coder-27b,23,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Fine-tuned from [Qwen3.5-27B](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-27B) for MCP tool-routing. Part of the [Prism Coder](https://github.com/dcostenco/prism-coder) fleet.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
