pvlabs/Chytrej2-90M-Base,23,1,apache-2.0,,,false,A fully custom pretrained language model built from scratch on the LLaMA architecture trained on [FineWeb Edu](https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-edu) dataset.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-2e20-273Mparams-134Btokens,23,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 273M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 2 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 134B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-3e19-273Mparams-22.3Btokens,23,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 273M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 22.3B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-9e19-273Mparams-66.8Btokens,23,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 273M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 9 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 66.8B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
lucacorbucci/zagreus-0.4B-ita-mlx-fp16,23,1,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [lucacorbucci/zagreus-0.4B-ita-mlx-fp16](https://huggingface.co/lucacorbucci/zagreus-0.4B-ita-mlx-fp16) was converted to MLX format from [mii-llm/zagreus-0.4B-ita](https://huggingface.co/mii-llm/zagreus-0.4B-ita) using mlx-lm version **0.31.2**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
galeio-research/OceanSAR-1-wind,23,2,apache-2.0,,,false,OceanSAR-1-Wind is a linear probing head for wind speed prediction built on top of the OceanSAR-1 foundation model. It leverages the powerful features extracted by OceanSAR-1 to accurately predict wind speed from Synthetic Aperture Radar (SAR) imagery.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
soda-research/soda-600m-prelim,23,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**SODA** (**S**caling **O**pen **D**iscrete **A**udio) is a suite of discrete audio foundation models using next-token prediction on interleaved semantic, acoustic, and text tokens.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
PulpBio/LuMamba,23,3,cc-by-nd-4.0,,,false,"<div align=""center""> <h1>LuMamba: Latent Unified Mamba for Electrode Topology-Invariant and Efficient EEG Modeling</h1> </div> <p align=""center""> <a href=""https://github.com/pulp-bio/BioFoundation""> </a> <a href=""https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/""> </a> <a href=""https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.19100""> </a> </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
pyloxsystems/hochelaga-8b-nvfp4,23,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"NVFP4 W4A4-quantized version of [`pyloxsystems/hochelaga-8b`](https://huggingface.co/pyloxsystems/hochelaga-8b), the first open-weights foundation model for Quebec French.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
