MaziyarPanahi/Mistral-7B-v0.1,22,1,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ArturoVitale/Minerva-1B-base-v1.0-Q4_K_M-GGUF,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`sapienzanlp/Minerva-1B-base-v1.0`](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-1B-base-v1.0) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-1B-base-v1.0) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
catbash/Llama-3-8B-flashback-v1-Q5_K_M-GGUF,22,0,mit,,,false,"Llama-3-8B-flashback-v1 is a continuation of the pretraining process for the base meta-llama/Meta-Llama-3-8B model, utilizing 2 251 233 forum threads from the Swedish website https://www.flashback.org/. Which is rougly 40GB of text. It is a full finetune for three epochs.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
chgk13/Qwen2-0.5B-openvino,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to OpenVINO from [`Qwen/Qwen2-0.5B`](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-0.5B) using [optimum-intel](https://github.com/huggingface/optimum-intel) via the [export](https://huggingface.co/spaces/echarlaix/openvino-export) space.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
itlwas/Mistral-7B-v0.1-Q4_K_M-GGUF,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1`](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fbaldassarri/sapienzanlp_Minerva-7B-base-v1.0-autoawq-int4-gs128-sym,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Quantized version of [sapienzanlp/Minerva-7B-base-v1.0](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-7B-base-v1.0) using torch.float32 for quantization tuning. - 4 bits (INT4) - group size = 128 - Symmetrical Quantization - Method AutoAWQ,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fbaldassarri/sapienzanlp_Minerva-7B-base-v1.0-autoround-int8-gs128-sym,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Quantized version of [sapienzanlp/Minerva-7B-base-v1.0](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-7B-base-v1.0) using torch.float32 for quantization tuning. - 8 bits (INT8) - group size = 128 - Symmetrical Quantization - Method WoQ (AutoRound format),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RaphaelMourad/Mistral-DNA-v1-17M-pig-13races,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-DNA-v1-17M-pig-13races Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA sequence model with 138M parameters. It is derived from Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 10kb DNA sequences from 13 pig race genome assemblies.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Base-W4A16,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Dicta-LM 3.0 is a powerful open-weight collection of LLMs, trained on extensive corpora of Hebrew and English texts. The models are available for download and for unlimited use. The models set a new SOTA for their weight-class for Hebrew, both as base models and chat models.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Base-FP8,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Dicta-LM 3.0 is a powerful open-weight collection of LLMs, trained on extensive corpora of Hebrew and English texts. The models are available for download and for unlimited use. The models set a new SOTA for their weight-class for Hebrew, both as base models and chat models.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
VRDate/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Thinking-Q4_K_M-GGUF,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Thinking`](https://huggingface.co/dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Thinking) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Thinking) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
JulianKrgd/Julian-600M-40B,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 600M parameter decoder-only language model trained from scratch on 39.3B tokens using JAX/Flax on Google Cloud TPUs.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
anindyakrg/aarav-gpt-zg2-instruct,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Adaptive Autoregressive Reasoning Architecture for Vocabulary(aarav) is a 336M parameter decoder-only language model trained from scratch using a modern Llama-style architecture.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-9e18-210Mparams-9.1Btokens,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 210M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 9 × 10¹⁸ FLOPs on 9.1B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-9e18-998Mparams-1.5Btokens,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 998M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 9 × 10¹⁸ FLOPs on 1.5B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-9e19-998Mparams-14.9Btokens,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 998M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 9 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 14.9B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nahid-hub/BnLM-F-135m,22,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,"**BnLM-F** is a 135M-parameter Bangla-specific pretrained language model, one of three models in the **BnLM** suite (**B**e**n**gali **L**anguage **M**odel) introduced alongside the **BLUGE** benchmark and **B-CORE** pretraining corpus. BnLM-F is among the smallest Bangla language models available, while ranking among the most accurate and computationally efficient — delivering state-of-the-art results at a fraction of the size and compute of multilingual alternatives. BnLM models are pretrained from scratch on Bangla text using the Masked Language Modeling (MLM) objective, and are designed for efficient, low-resource NLP without relying on large multilingual models.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mlfoundations/dcvlm-2b-model,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**DCVLM-2B** is the `medium`-scale reference 2B-parameter VLM from our [DataComp-VLM](https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.28551) paper, pretrained from scratch on **DCVLM-Baseline**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
VertexResearch/Vertex-0.6-100M-4096-ctx-Base,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Base (text-completion) model of the Vertex 0.6 family by Vertex Research, pretrained from scratch on **10.01B tokens** at **1024 context**, then context-extended to **4096** via a two-stage rope ladder (2048: 350M tokens; 4096, rope theta 250K: 300M tokens) on fresh Ultra-FineWeb. This is the raw pretrain checkpoint: no instruction tuning, no chat alignment. Instruct and reasoning variants (with extended context) are released separately.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
galeio-research/OceanSAR-1-wave,22,2,apache-2.0,,,false,OceanSAR-1-wave is a linear probing head for significant wave height (SWH) prediction built on top of the OceanSAR-1 foundation model. It leverages the powerful features extracted by OceanSAR-1 to accurately predict ocean wave heights from Synthetic Aperture Radar (SAR) imagery.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
thebajajra/RexReranker-mini,22,5,apache-2.0,,,false,"<p align=""center""> </p> <p align=""center""> </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
vthawfeek/mtdna-foundation-model,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A pre-trained BERT encoder for the human mitochondrial genome (16,569 bp circular genome).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
pyloxsystems/hochelaga-8b,22,1,apache-2.0,,,false,**The first open-weights foundation model for Quebec French.**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
braindecode/epint-pretrained,22,0,mit,,,false,"Pretrained weights for [`braindecode.models.EpiNT`](https://braindecode.org/stable/generated/braindecode.models.EpiNT.html), a braindecode port of **EpiNT** (Zhang et al., 2025), a channel-independent transformer pretrained on 2,700 hours of scalp EEG and intracranial EEG (ECoG, sEEG) from 1,199 patients.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MultiBertGunjanPatrick/multiberts-seed-2-0k,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Seed 2 intermediate checkpoint 0k MultiBERTs (pretrained BERT) model on English language using a masked language modeling (MLM) objective. It was introduced in [this paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.16163.pdf) and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/google-research/language/tree/master/language/multiberts). This is an intermediate checkpoint. The final checkpoint can be found at [multiberts-seed-2](https://hf.co/multberts-seed-2). This model is uncased: it does not make a difference between english and English.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MultiBertGunjanPatrick/multiberts-seed-2-800k,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Seed 2 intermediate checkpoint 800k MultiBERTs (pretrained BERT) model on English language using a masked language modeling (MLM) objective. It was introduced in [this paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.16163.pdf) and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/google-research/language/tree/master/language/multiberts). This is an intermediate checkpoint. The final checkpoint can be found at [multiberts-seed-2](https://hf.co/multberts-seed-2). This model is uncased: it does not make a difference between english and English.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
facebook/wav2vec2-base-hu-voxpopuli-v2,22,1,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,[Facebook's Wav2Vec2](https://ai.facebook.com/blog/wav2vec-20-learning-the-structure-of-speech-from-raw-audio/) base model pretrained only in **hu** on **17.7k** unlabeled datat of the [VoxPopuli corpus](https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.00390).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
facebook/wav2vec2-base-it-voxpopuli-v2,22,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,[Facebook's Wav2Vec2](https://ai.facebook.com/blog/wav2vec-20-learning-the-structure-of-speech-from-raw-audio/) base model pretrained only in **it** on **21.9k** unlabeled datat of the [VoxPopuli corpus](https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.00390).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
facebook/wav2vec2-base-it-voxpopuli,22,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,[Facebook's Wav2Vec2](https://ai.facebook.com/blog/wav2vec-20-learning-the-structure-of-speech-from-raw-audio/) base model pretrained on the it unlabeled subset of [VoxPopuli corpus](https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.00390).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
facebook/wav2vec2-large-10k-voxpopuli,22,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,[Facebook's Wav2Vec2](https://ai.facebook.com/blog/wav2vec-20-learning-the-structure-of-speech-from-raw-audio/) large model pretrained on the 10k unlabeled subset of [VoxPopuli corpus](https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.00390).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
stefan-it/electra-base-gc4-64k-100000-cased-discriminator,22,0,mit,,,false,"This repository presents a colossal (and biased) language model for German trained on the recently released [""German colossal, clean Common Crawl corpus""](https://german-nlp-group.github.io/projects/gc4-corpus.html) (GC4), with a total dataset size of ~844GB.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
vodiylik/xls-r-uzbek-cv10-full,22,3,apache-2.0,,,false,"<!-- This model card has been generated automatically according to the information the Trainer had access to. You should probably proofread and complete it, then remove this comment. -->",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
approach0/splade_somemath-bertnsp-220,22,0,mit,,,false,This [repository](https://github.com/approach0/azbert) is a boilerplate to push a mask-filling model to the HuggingFace Model Hub.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
claudios/cubert-20210711-Java-1024,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This model is the unofficial HuggingFace version of ""[CuBERT](https://github.com/google-research/google-research/tree/master/cubert)"". In particular, this version comes from [gs://cubert/20210711_Java/pre_trained_model_epochs_2__length_1024](https://console.cloud.google.com/storage/browser/cubert/20210711_Java/pre_trained_model_epochs_2__length_1024). It was trained 2021-07-11 for 2 epochs with a 1024 token context window on the Java BigQuery dataset. I manually converted the Tensorflow checkpoint to PyTorch and have uploaded it here. The [tokenizer](https://github.com/google-research/google-research/blob/master/cubert/python_tokenizer.py) has not been converted yet. All credit goes to Aditya Kanade, Petros Maniatis, Gogul Balakrishnan, and Kensen Shi.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Morton-Li/QiDeBERTa-CSC-small,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Model Name**: `QiDeBERTa-CSC-small` **Language**: Chinese **任务方向**: 中文拼写纠错（Chinese Spelling Correction, CSC） **Architecture**: DeBERTa V3 (modified) **Author**: Morton Li **License**: Apache-2.0 **Tags**: `deberta`, `mlm`, `chinese`, `language-modeling`, `robust-nlp`, `general-purpose`, `pretraining`, `spelling-correction`, `csc`, `fine-tuning`, `masked-language-modeling`",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ylacombe/omniASR_W2V_3B_SSL,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Porting the SSL (self-supervised-learning) version of the Omnilingual-Asr W2V2 release from Meta to transformers. 3B checkpoint. More on the [official repo](https://github.com/facebookresearch/omnilingual-asr).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
iamtatsuki05/ModernBERT-JP-0.5B-PT-stage1,22,0,mit,,,false,English / [Japanese](README_JA.md),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Sarath569/slm-125m-legal-base,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **125.8M**-parameter Llama-style decoder-only language model pretrained **from scratch** on a cleaned, deduplicated, decontaminated corpus of US case law, SEC filings, and educational web text (~2.04B unique tokens; legal-first mix).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
laion/open-sci-ref-1.7b-nemotron-hq-100B-4096,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Base model. No reasoning enrichment — the *no front-loading* / non-permissive-web cell.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kshitijthakkar/loggenix-moe-0.12B-A0.08B-e5-lr5e4-b16-3060-v2-finetuned,22,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"**LoggenixMoE133M** is a small Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) Causal Language Model trained **from scratch** on a custom dataset containing root cause analysis (RCA), code generation, and reasoning tasks.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
pandeyps/LangQA-3000,22,0,mit,,,false,trained on the samplequestiona-3000 dataset to create a language model to try techniques that could reduce hallucinations - **Architecture:** GPT-2 - **Training Type:** From scratch - **Dataset:** SimpleQuestions-3000,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
rockerritesh/gpt2-small-fineweb-edu-200m,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A **124M** parameter language model trained **from scratch** on FineWeb-Edu.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
qubitpage/sentinel-prime-350m,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,**Sentinel Prime 350M** is a from-scratch sparse Mixture of Experts (MoE) transformer built by [QubitPage Research](https://qubitpage.com).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SlitherCode/tiny-edu-166m-instruct-v3,22,0,mit,,,false,"A 166M parameter instruction-tuned language model trained entirely from scratch — custom architecture, real pretraining data, and full SFT pipeline — for under $55 in cloud compute.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Skyl4r-Ai/Skylar-236M-Base,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Skylar** is a **from-scratch** decoder-only LLM (Qwen3-style: RMSNorm · RoPE · GQA · QK-Norm · SwiGLU · µP), pretrained on **1.12B tokens of Italian legal/normative text** (EUR-Lex, Banca d'Italia, Gazzetta Ufficiale, normattiva, TED) on a single RTX 4090. Code & full results: [`https://github.com/2sophia/skylar`](https://github.com/2sophia/skylar).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
BytesTalk/PersonaMini-1-medium,22,0,mit,,,false,"A from-scratch roleplay language model by **BytesTalk**. It is not a fine-tune of any existing model — every weight was trained from random initialization. This is the second model in the PersonaMini-1 family, following the 28.8M **small**. The roleplay runtime (memory, character cards, RAG, decoding) is bundled into the model as custom code, so a single `from_pretrained(..., trust_remote_code=True)` call returns a `.chat()` that carries all of it.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AnandRago/PHPko-31M,22,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **31M-parameter PHP code-completion model, trained from scratch** (random initialisation — not a fine-tune of any existing model).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AZERDSQ/G1-nano-instruct,22,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 60M-parameter GPT pretrained and instruction-tuned entirely on a single 8GB-RAM NVIDIA Jetson device, without cloud infrastructure or multi-GPU setups. Chat-oriented checkpoint with a native 2048-token context and real multi-turn conversation support.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SlayerLab/GoLLeM-110M-PL-v2,22,0,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"Polski model językowy **110M** (GPT-2-class), trenowany **od zera** na AMD Radeon RX 7900 XTX (ROCm/WSL2). Model **bazowy (completion)** — kontynuuje tekst, **nie jest chatbotem** (nie odpowiada na pytania; daj mu początek zdania).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tako080614/evex-1,22,0,mit,,,false,ある Discord サーバーの過去ログ **だけ** をゼロから学習した 5.87M パラメータの言語モデル。 既存モデルからの継続学習ではなく、tokenizer も含めて全部そのログから作った。 **このモデルにとって世界はそのログだけで、一般知識は一切持っていない。**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Asilarkness/MetaCog-V2-300M,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"MetaCog-V2 is a 301,268,512-parameter dialogue language model trained from scratch with Meta V2 explicit recurrent state: four levels, eight memory slots per level, learned read/write/erase, confidence and routing. The released inference export contains the SFT checkpoint at step 1526 (500,039,680 tokens).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tako080614/evex-3.5,22,0,mit,,,false,ある Discord サーバーの過去ログを主材料に、tokenizer からゼロで作った **18.9M パラメータ**の言語モデル。事前学習済みの重みは1つも使っていない。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
omurberaisik/NoTokenLM-Gen-3.5,22,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"**A 9-million-parameter, byte-level, tokenizer-free language model. No subword vocabulary, no BPE — just raw UTF-8 bytes in, raw UTF-8 bytes out.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
narendraalluri/slm-125m-base,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 125.8M-parameter Llama-style causal LM **pretrained from random weights** on a legal-first corpus. No distillation, no fine-tuning from an existing checkpoint: the tokenizer, the corpus and the weights were all built from scratch.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sajalregmi4/arkios-1b-chat,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **1.04B-parameter bilingual English–Nepali chat model**, instruction-tuned from [arkios-1b-base](https://huggingface.co/sajalregmi4/arkios-1b-base). Its distinguishing feature: **tool use is conditional on a declared tool manifest**, the same contract used by larger production models, rather than a fixed built-in tool the model calls regardless of context.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Ilides/cortex-v0.9-0.1b-mlx,22,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Versión MLX (Apple Silicon, Metal) de [Ilides/cortex-v0.9-0.1b](https://huggingface.co/Ilides/cortex-v0.9-0.1b)** — GPT conversacional de 126M parámetros entrenado desde cero y afinado con SFT multilingüe ES/EN.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Manovishaal/MaVi-0.1-65M,22,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"**MaVi** is a small language model that turns a plain-English game idea into a playable 2D game. It was trained from scratch, together with its own game engine: the model writes **GSL**, a compact game-specification language (see `GSL.md`), and the engine plays it, validates it and exports it to Godot 4 and Ren'Py. It can also draw pixel-art sprites in **PXL**, a small drawing language, and edit existing games and levels.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
CycleCoreTechnologies/maaza-nlm-orchestrator-9.6m,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,**95% tool accuracy (in-distribution) · 35ms latency · 9.60M parameters**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Simon-Liu/gemma-4-e2b-kubectl-mcp-server-mcp-sft-it,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,MCP tool-calling 的 **完整微調模型（full fine-tune）**，由 **Agent Tools Fine-Tuning Platform** 以 「Teacher 反向生成資料 → 品質過濾 → SFT」流程訓練而成。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
TheBloke/Mistral-11B-CC-Air-RP-AWQ,21,5,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"<!-- header start --> <!-- 200823 --> <div style=""width: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto""> </div> <div style=""display: flex; justify-content: space-between; width: 100%;""> <div style=""display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start;""> <p style=""margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0em;""><a href=""https://discord.gg/theblokeai"">Chat & support: TheBloke's Discord server</a></p> </div> <div style=""display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end;""> <p style=""margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0em;""><a href=""https://www.patreon.com/TheBlokeAI"">Want to contribute? TheBloke's Patreon page</a></p> </div> </div> <div style=""text-align:center; margin-top: 0em; margin-bottom: 0em""><p style=""margin-top: 0.25em; margin-bottom: 0em;"">TheBloke's LLM work is generously s",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mudler/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0-Q5_0-GGUF,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0`](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
