3dsabh/Mistral-7B-v0.1-Q2_K-GGUF,21,1,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1`](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
