fbaldassarri/sapienzanlp_Minerva-350M-base-v1.0-autoround-int4-gs64-sym,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Quantized version of [sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0) using torch.float32 for quantization tuning. - 4 bits (INT4) - group size = 64 - Symmetrical Quantization - Method WoQ (AutoRound format),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-q8-mlx,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-q8-mlx](https://huggingface.co/alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-q8-mlx) was converted to MLX format from [OpenLLM-France/Lucie-7B](https://huggingface.co/OpenLLM-France/Lucie-7B) using mlx-lm version **0.21.4**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RaphaelMourad/Mistral-DNA-v1-17M-cow-5races,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-DNA-v1-17M-cow-5races Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA sequence model with 138M parameters. It is derived from Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 10kb DNA sequences from 5 cow race genome assemblies.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Instruct-W4A16,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Dicta-LM 3.0 is a powerful open-weight collection of LLMs, trained on extensive corpora of Hebrew and English texts. The models are available for download and for unlimited use. The models set a new SOTA for their weight-class for Hebrew, both as base models and chat models.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
VRDate/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Thinking-W4A16-Q4_K_M-GGUF,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Thinking-W4A16`](https://huggingface.co/dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Thinking-W4A16) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Thinking-W4A16) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
