puigde/modern-transformer-mha-370M-15B-slimpajama,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,> This model is for research purposes only and is not intended for production use.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-1e21-3.4Bparams-46.3Btokens-seed42,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 3.4B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 1 × 10²¹ FLOPs on 46.3B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
