marin-community/delphi-2e20-5.3Bparams-5.3Btokens,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 5.3B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 2 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 5.3B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-3e20-4.3Bparams-11Btokens,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 4.3B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 11B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SlitherCode/tiny-edu-166m,21,0,mit,,,false,A 166M parameter transformer pretrained from scratch on 4B tokens of [FineWeb-Edu](https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-edu).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
livingworld/olmo3-190m-zh-full,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,为零基础 AI 大模型研发训练营（llm001）L04 Full 模型（190M 参数，20 步测试训练）。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ftajwar/d24-climbmix-100b,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **0.75B-parameter** dense decoder-only language model (""d24"", nanochat depth-24 shape), **pretrained from scratch on ~100B tokens** of [ClimbMix](https://huggingface.co/datasets/karpathy/climbmix-400b-shuffle).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jonam-ai/slm-125m-base,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 125M-parameter Llama-architecture small language model pretrained from scratch on a legal/financial corpus. This is a **base (pretrained) model** — it is not instruction- or chat-tuned.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
