MultiBertGunjanPatrick/multiberts-seed-4-300k,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Seed 4 intermediate checkpoint 300k MultiBERTs (pretrained BERT) model on English language using a masked language modeling (MLM) objective. It was introduced in [this paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.16163.pdf) and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/google-research/language/tree/master/language/multiberts). This is an intermediate checkpoint. The final checkpoint can be found at [multiberts-seed-4](https://hf.co/multberts-seed-4). This model is uncased: it does not make a difference between english and English.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
flax-community/wav2vec2-german,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The base model pretrained on 16kHz sampled speech audio. When using the model make sure that your speech input is also sampled at 16Khz. Note that this model should be fine-tuned on a downstream task, like Automatic Speech Recognition. Check out [this blog](https://huggingface.co/blog/fine-tune-wav2vec2-english) for more information.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
stefan-it/electra-base-gc4-64k-300000-cased-discriminator,21,0,mit,,,false,"This repository presents a colossal (and biased) language model for German trained on the recently released [""German colossal, clean Common Crawl corpus""](https://german-nlp-group.github.io/projects/gc4-corpus.html) (GC4), with a total dataset size of ~844GB.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
stefan-it/electra-base-gc4-64k-500000-cased-discriminator,21,0,mit,,,false,"This repository presents a colossal (and biased) language model for German trained on the recently released [""German colossal, clean Common Crawl corpus""](https://german-nlp-group.github.io/projects/gc4-corpus.html) (GC4), with a total dataset size of ~844GB.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
approach0/colbert-cocomae-600,21,0,mit,,,false,This [repository](https://github.com/approach0/azbert) is a boilerplate to push a mask-filling model to the HuggingFace Model Hub.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
NM-development/LaBSE-en-ru-ce-prototype,21,2,mit,,,false,The model uses only sign **ӏ** for explosive consonants (small cyrillic palochka letter)!,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
facebook/hiera-large-224-mae-hf,21,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"**Hiera** is a _hierarchical_ vision transformer that is fast, powerful, and, above all, _simple_. It was introduced in the paper [Hiera: A Hierarchical Vision Transformer without the Bells-and-Whistles](https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.00989/) and outperforms the state-of-the-art across a wide array of image and video tasks _while being much faster_.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fav-kky/wav2vec2-base-cs-de-100k,21,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,This is a bilingual Wav2Vec 2.0 base model pre-trained from 100 thousand hours of speech (50 thousand hours of Czech and 50 thousand hours of German). It has been released along with a paper **A Comparative Analysis of Bilingual and Trilingual Wav2Vec Models for Automatic Speech Recognition in Multilingual Oral History Archives** accepted to INTERSPEECH2024 conference.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
thoddnn/colqwen2-v1.0-mlx-8bit,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [thoddnn/colqwen2-v1.0-mlx-8bit](https://huggingface.co/thoddnn/colqwen2-v1.0-mlx-8bit) was converted to MLX format from [vidore/colqwen2-v1.0-hf](https://huggingface.co/vidore/colqwen2-v1.0-hf) using mlx-lm version **0.0.3**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
atrost/climbmix-stairformer-353m-1p2b-h100-vllm,21,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,vLLM Transformers-backend packaging of `atrost/climbmix-stairformer-353m-1p2b-h100`.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nazdef/gpt2medium-en-it-nanochat-gpt2preln-decay13500-step14250,21,0,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"This repository publishes the requested **ordinary checkpoint release** for `step_14250`, the current **best scalar decayed checkpoint** found in the medium GPT2PreLN `13.5k` decay family.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
techsword/wav2vec2-base-mandarin-magicdata,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Fairseq wav2vec2-base pretraining checkpoint (checkpoint_best, ~85000 updates), converted to HuggingFace format with the official transformers converter and verified (weight-level spot check + forward-pass comparison against the fairseq model; see conversion log). Pretrained on MAGICDATA (Mandarin Chinese).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
onnx-community/wav2vec2-large-xlsr-53-ONNX,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This is an ONNX version of [facebook/wav2vec2-large-xlsr-53](https://huggingface.co/facebook/wav2vec2-large-xlsr-53). It was automatically converted and uploaded using [this Hugging Face Space](https://huggingface.co/spaces/onnx-community/convert-to-onnx).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/sdlc-slm-1m,21,0,mit,,,false,A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~33.9M parameters) trained from scratch on a comprehensive Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC) knowledge base. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/cloud-architect-slm-1m,21,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~1018.2M params, ~1.02B) trained from scratch for the **Cloud Architect** role. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/qa-engineer-slm-1m,21,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~1008.9M params, ~1.01B) trained from scratch for the **QA Engineer** role. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/network-engineer-slm-1m,21,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~1019.5M params, ~1.02B) trained from scratch for the **Network Engineer** role. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/cloud-architect-slm-5m,21,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~1009.0M params, ~1.01B) trained from scratch for the **Cloud Architect** role. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ramankrishna10/npc-nano-0.5b-sft,21,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Instruction-tuned 0.5B parameter language model from the [Bottensor](https://bottensor.xyz) NPC family. SFT-warmed from [npc-nano-0.5b-base](https://huggingface.co/ramankrishna10/npc-nano-0.5b-base), itself pretrained from scratch on 8.93B tokens.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SamSec007/phishbyte,21,6,mit,,,false,"A from-scratch PyTorch model for **email phishing detection** — no pretrained language model, no transformer, no fine-tuning.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
grichard99/statpredict-lite,21,1,apache-2.0,,,false,A small (~33M parameter) GPT trained **from scratch** to read an athlete's previous statistical seasons and generate a predicted next season as **structured JSON**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mkd-minju/korean-1m-cpu-llm,21,0,mit,,,false,"일반적인 대형 언어모델과 다릅니다. 목표는 ""좋은 챗봇""이 아니라, **약 100만 개 파라미터짜리 트랜스포머를 처음부터(from scratch) 설계·학습·CPU 추론까지 실제로 실행해서 파이프라인 자체가 동작하는지 실측으로 증명**하는 것이었습니다. 이 규모에서는 문법적으로 맞는 한글을 이어 쓰는 정도가 현실적인 한계이며, 사실 지식이나 대화 능력은 기대할 수 없습니다.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Mieaz/gpt22m-chat,21,0,mit,,,false,"A **23.1M-parameter GPT** trained from scratch on **600M tokens** (2 epochs) on free cloud GPU (Tesla P100, 16GB). Built to be small, honest, and *completely documented* — every number below is verified from the training logs.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tako080614/evex-5.2,21,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,ある Discord サーバーのログだけから**ゼロから**学習した日本語の会話モデル。 既存の重みからの派生ではなく、tokenizer も含めて全部このサーバーのために作ってある。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
navthings/airgpt-hour,21,1,mit,,,false,"an 8M param model trained from scratch in one hour on a macbook air (m5, 16gb, no fan) with [airgpt](https://github.com/navthings/airgpt).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kerzgrr/Couplet-base,21,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div align=""center"">",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ucrelnlp/PyMUSAS-Neural-Multilingual-Small-BEM,20,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,A fine tuned 140 Million (140M) parameter Multilingual ModernBERT architecture semantic tagger. The tagger outputs semantic tags at the token level from the [USAS tagset](https://ucrel.lancs.ac.uk/usas/usas_guide.pdf).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Simon-Liu/gemma-4-e2b-kubectl-mcp-server-mcp-sft-v2-it,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,MCP tool-calling 的 **完整微調模型（full fine-tune）**，由 **Agent Tools Fine-Tuning Platform** 以 「Teacher 反向生成資料 → 品質過濾 → SFT」流程訓練而成。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Undi95/Mistral-11B-CC-Air-RP,20,8,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,CollectiveCognition-v1.1-Mistral-7B and airoboros-mistral2.2-7b glued together and finetuned with qlora of Pippa and LimaRPv3 dataset.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
timpal0l/Mistral-7B-v0.1-flashback-v2-GGUF,20,3,mit,,,false,"Mistral-7B-v0.1-flashback-v2 is a continuation of the pretraining process for the base Mistral-7B-v0.1 model, utilizing 2 251 233 forum threads from the Swedish website https://www.flashback.org/. Which is rougly 40GB of text. It is a full finetune for one epoch.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dicta-il/dictalm2.0-AWQ,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The DictaLM-2.0 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters trained to specialize in Hebrew text.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dicta-il/dictalm2.0-GPTQ,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The DictaLM-2.0 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters trained to specialize in Hebrew text.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RaphaelMourad/Mistral-Codon-v1-16M,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-Codon-v1-16M Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA sequence model with 16M parameters. It is derived from Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 24M coding DNA sequences (3000bp) from many different species (vertebrates, plants, bacteria, viruses, ...).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
yashagra/Mistral-7B-v0.1-Q4_K_M-GGUF,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1`](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
bkoo/wikisql-4bit-1k,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [bkoo/wikisql-4bit-1k](https://huggingface.co/bkoo/wikisql-4bit-1k) was converted to MLX format from [mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) using mlx-lm version **0.18.2**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ssmits/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct-embed-base,20,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"Qwen2.5 is a language model series including decoder language models of different model sizes. For each size, we release the base language model and the aligned chat model. It is based on the Transformer architecture with SwiGLU activation, attention QKV bias, group query attention, etc. Additionally, we have an improved tokenizer adaptive to multiple natural languages and codes.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-mlx,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-mlx](https://huggingface.co/alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-mlx) was converted to MLX format from [OpenLLM-France/Lucie-7B](https://huggingface.co/OpenLLM-France/Lucie-7B) using mlx-lm version **0.21.4**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-Instruct-v1.1-q8-mlx,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-Instruct-v1.1-q8-mlx](https://huggingface.co/alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-Instruct-v1.1-q8-mlx) was converted to MLX format from [OpenLLM-France/Lucie-7B-Instruct-v1.1](https://huggingface.co/OpenLLM-France/Lucie-7B-Instruct-v1.1) using mlx-lm version **0.21.4**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
puigde/modern-transformer-gqa-370M-15B-slimpajama,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,> This model is for research purposes only and is not intended for production use.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-2e19-1.9Bparams-1.5Btokens,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 1.9B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 2 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 1.5B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-2e20-1.4Bparams-21.1Btokens,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 1.4B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 2 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 21.1B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
