marin-community/delphi-3e19-669Mparams-7.8Btokens,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 669M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 7.8B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
