JupiterZhu/T2MLR_982M_lstart9_lend24_10B_FineWebEdu,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**T2MLR** (Transformer with Temporal Middle-Layer Recurrence) applies a recurrent connection across a contiguous band of middle layers, carrying a recurrent state between token positions. This checkpoint is a 982M model pretrained **from scratch** on FineWeb-Edu for **~10B tokens**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/healthcare-slm-1m,20,0,mit,,,false,A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~33.9M params) trained from scratch on Healthcare domain data. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nishantup/nanogpt-slm-instruct,20,1,mit,,,false,"Instruction fine-tuned Small Language Model, trained from scratch -> pretrained on 133 classic english fiction books -> SFT on Alpaca-format instructions.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/business-analyst-slm-5m,20,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~1005.4M params, ~1.01B) trained from scratch for the **Business Analyst** role. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
