Ghostgim/ghost-small-gen,20,0,mit,,,false,"A small (~45M parameter) decoder-only language model **trained entirely from scratch** in PyTorch, no pretrained weights and no fine-tuning. It is the first generalist checkpoint in the [GhostLM](https://github.com/joemunene-by/GhostLM) project: a model that broadened from a cybersecurity-only corpus into a small generalist while keeping cybersecurity as its deepest specialty.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Itaking/itakura_v4-model,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,LLM学習の勉強用に開発したモデルです。会話にはなりません。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
timothywong731/tim-360m-base-GGUF,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"GGUF quantizations of [TIM-360M-base](https://huggingface.co/timothywong731/tim-360m-base) for [llama.cpp](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp) and downstream runtimes (Ollama, LM Studio, llamafile). This is the **base** model — a from-scratch 361.8M-parameter decoder-only transformer. It is **not** instruction-tuned; for chat use [tim-360m-instruct](https://huggingface.co/timothywong731/tim-360m-instruct).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Aashw1n/openwebtext-103M,20,1,mit,,,false,"A 102.7M parameter decoder-only transformer trained from scratch on an OpenWebText sample, with a custom byte-level BPE tokenizer. No `transformers`, no pretrained components — every layer written from primitives.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AZERDSQ/G1-nano-base,20,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 60M-parameter GPT trained completely from scratch on a single 8GB-RAM NVIDIA Jetson device, without cloud infrastructure or multi-GPU setups. Base pretrained checkpoint with a native 2048-token context for raw text completion.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
aamirabbas858/silbe-small,20,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"*Silbe* is German for **syllable**, which is roughly what a tokenizer produces: language cut into pieces small enough for a machine to count.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tako080614/evex-4.1,20,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,ある Discord サーバーのログだけから**ゼロから**学習した日本語の会話モデル。 既存の重みからの派生ではなく、tokenizer も含めて全部このサーバーのために作ってある。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
