RaphaelMourad/Mistral-Chem-v1-134M,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-Chem-v1-134M Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative chemical molecule model with 134M parameters. It is derived from Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for molecules: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 10M molecule SMILES strings from the PubChem database.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
chgk13/Qwen2-0.5B-openvino-8bit,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model is a quantized version of [`Qwen/Qwen2-0.5B`](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-0.5B) and is converted to the OpenVINO format. This model was obtained via the [nncf-quantization](https://huggingface.co/spaces/echarlaix/nncf-quantization) space with [optimum-intel](https://github.com/huggingface/optimum-intel).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fbaldassarri/sapienzanlp_Minerva-350M-base-v1.0-autogptq-int4-gs128-asym,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Quantized version of [sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0) using torch.float32 for quantization tuning. - 4 bits (INT4) - group size = 128 - Asymmetrical Quantization - Method AutoGPTQ,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-q3-mlx,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-q3-mlx](https://huggingface.co/alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-q3-mlx) was converted to MLX format from [OpenLLM-France/Lucie-7B](https://huggingface.co/OpenLLM-France/Lucie-7B) using mlx-lm version **0.21.4**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fbaldassarri/sapienzanlp_Minerva-350M-base-v1.0-autogptq-int8-gs128-asym,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Quantized version of [sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0) using torch.float32 for quantization tuning. - 8 bits (INT8) - group size = 128 - Asymmetrical Quantization - Method AutoGPTQ,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
shoshana-levitt/Mistral-7B-v0.1,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
en3rypt/Mistral-7B-v0.1-4bit,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model [en3rypt/Mistral-7B-v0.1-4bit](https://huggingface.co/en3rypt/Mistral-7B-v0.1-4bit) was converted to MLX format from [mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) using mlx-lm version **0.28.3**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
salmannyu/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Nemotron-Math-52B-Mid-Train-8,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This model is a **mid-trained** version of [Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B) on the [NVIDIA Nemotron-CC-Math-v1](https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/Nemotron-CC-Math-v1) dataset (52B tokens, 4plus subset).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-1e21-3.4Bparams-46.3Btokens-seed62746,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 3.4B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 1 × 10²¹ FLOPs on 46.3B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-2e19-210Mparams-18.2Btokens,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 210M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 2 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 18.2B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-2e19-273Mparams-13.4Btokens,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 273M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 2 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 13.4B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-3e20-1.9Bparams-24.7Btokens,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 1.9B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 24.7B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-3e20-3.4Bparams-13.9Btokens,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 3.4B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 13.9B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-3e20-6.7Bparams-7Btokens,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 6.7B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 7B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-9e18-669Mparams-2.3Btokens,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 669M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 9 × 10¹⁸ FLOPs on 2.3B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-9e19-5.3Bparams-2.6Btokens,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 5.3B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 9 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 2.6B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-9e19-9.7Bparams-1.4Btokens,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 9.7B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 9 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 1.4B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mkd-hossain/keural-14.8b-stage2-vllm,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Keural is a **14.83B parameter bilingual Korean-English Mixture-of-Experts language model** trained from scratch on Korean and English text. This repository contains the **Stage 2 annealing checkpoint** (120,000 steps total) in HuggingFace Mixtral-compatible safetensors format, ready to serve with vLLM or Transformers.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Suyash11/pile-30m-base,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 29M-parameter decoder-only Transformer trained from scratch on a ~30M-token subset of The Pile. Built end-to-end on an Apple M2 MacBook Air (8GB unified memory) using PyTorch MPS — no CUDA, no pretrained weights.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
rylyshkvar/crubin-base,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
chrimerss/flood-foundation-prithvi-300m,19,0,mit,,,false,This model is a Prithvi-300M fine-tuned for flood risk segmentation from Digital Elevation Models (DEM) and precipitation data.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
perturblab/scfoundation-rde,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This is the **RDE (Reaction-Diffusion Embedding)** model from scFoundation. It provides specialized embeddings optimized for specific downstream tasks.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
eugenehp/ST-EEGFormer,19,2,mit,,,false,"Pre-converted [safetensors](https://github.com/huggingface/safetensors) weights for the [ST-EEGFormer](https://github.com/LiuyinYang1101/STEEGFormer) EEG foundation model, ready for use with **[steegformer-rs](https://github.com/eugenehp/steegformer-rs)** (pure-Rust inference on [Burn 0.20](https://burn.dev)) or any framework that supports safetensors.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
bioinfoihb/FishNALM-8_pretrain,19,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,`FishNALM-8_pretrain` is a fish-specific foundation DNA language model in the FishNALM family. It was pretrained on fish genome sequences with masked language modeling (MLM) and is intended for genomic sequence representation learning and downstream transfer to fish genomics tasks.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
luoxd96/ELF,19,0,gpl-3.0,,,false,**ELF** (Ensemble Learning of Foundation models) is a slide-level pathology encoder from the Li Lab at Stanford. It aggregates tile embeddings from five public foundation models into a unified whole-slide representation.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
num1notsvn/wicara-56m-base,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**W**eight-efficient **I**ndonesian **C**onversational **A**rchitecture, **R**esearch **A**rtifact",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Alvenir/wav2vec2-base-da,19,6,apache-2.0,,,false,"This wav2vec2-base model has been pretrained on ~1300 hours of danish speech data. The pretraining data consists of podcasts and audiobooks and is unfortunately not public available. However, we were allowed to distribute the pretrained model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MultiBertGunjanPatrick/multiberts-seed-14,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Seed 14 MultiBERTs (pretrained BERT) model on English language using a masked language modeling (MLM) objective. It was introduced in [this paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.16163.pdf) and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/google-research/language/tree/master/language/multiberts). This model is uncased: it does not make a difference between english and English.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MultiBertGunjanPatrick/multiberts-seed-2-60k,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Seed 2 intermediate checkpoint 60k MultiBERTs (pretrained BERT) model on English language using a masked language modeling (MLM) objective. It was introduced in [this paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.16163.pdf) and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/google-research/language/tree/master/language/multiberts). This is an intermediate checkpoint. The final checkpoint can be found at [multiberts-seed-2](https://hf.co/multberts-seed-2). This model is uncased: it does not make a difference between english and English.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MultiBertGunjanPatrick/multiberts-seed-8,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Seed 0 MultiBERTs (pretrained BERT) model on English language using a masked language modeling (MLM) objective. It was introduced in [this paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.16163.pdf) and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/google-research/language/tree/master/language/multiberts). This model is uncased: it does not make a difference between english and English.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
facebook/wav2vec2-base-sv-voxpopuli-v2,19,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,[Facebook's Wav2Vec2](https://ai.facebook.com/blog/wav2vec-20-learning-the-structure-of-speech-from-raw-audio/) base model pretrained only in **sv** on **16.3k** unlabeled datat of the [VoxPopuli corpus](https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.00390).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
facebook/wav2vec2-large-west_germanic-voxpopuli-v2,19,1,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,[Facebook's Wav2Vec2](https://ai.facebook.com/blog/wav2vec-20-learning-the-structure-of-speech-from-raw-audio/) large model pretrained only in **west_germanic** on **66.3** unlabeled datat of the [VoxPopuli corpus](https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.00390).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jonfd/electra-base-igc-is,19,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,"This model was pretrained on the [Icelandic Gigaword Corpus](http://igc.arnastofnun.is/), which contains approximately 1.69B tokens, using default settings. The model uses a WordPiece tokenizer with a vocabulary size of 32,105.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
stefan-it/electra-base-gc4-64k-700000-cased-discriminator,19,0,mit,,,false,"This repository presents a colossal (and biased) language model for German trained on the recently released [""German colossal, clean Common Crawl corpus""](https://german-nlp-group.github.io/projects/gc4-corpus.html) (GC4), with a total dataset size of ~844GB.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
toastynews/electra-hongkongese-large-discriminator,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,ELECTRA trained exclusively with data from Hong Kong. A signaficant amount of Hongkongese/Cantonese/Yue is included in the training data.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
xyma/PROP-wiki,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**PROP**, **P**re-training with **R**epresentative w**O**rds **P**rediction, is a new pre-training method tailored for ad-hoc retrieval. PROP is inspired by the classical statistical language model for IR, specifically the query likelihood model, which assumes that the query is generated as the piece of text representative of the “ideal” document. Based on this idea, we construct the representative words prediction (ROP) task for pre-training. The full paper can be found [here](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2010.10137.pdf).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Den4ikAI/rubert-tiny-squad,19,0,mit,,,false,обученный rubert от cointegrated/rubert-tiny2.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SzegedAI/hubertusz-small-wiki,19,1,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was trained from scratch on the Wikipedia subset of Hungarian Webcorpus 2.0 with MLM and SOP tasks.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SzegedAI/hubertusz-medium-wiki-seq128,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Fully trained model with the second phase of training is available here: [SzegedAI/hubert-medium-wiki](https://huggingface.co/SzegedAI/hubert-medium-wiki),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
chtan/ponet-base-uncased,19,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"> This is a code repository for ***[PoNet: Pooling Network for Efficient Token Mixing in Long Sequences](https://arxiv.org/abs/2110.02442)*** by Chao-Hong Tan, Qian Chen, Wen Wang, Qinglin Zhang, Siqi Zheng, Zhen-Hua Ling.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
facebook/hiera-base-plus-224-mae-hf,19,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"**Hiera** is a _hierarchical_ vision transformer that is fast, powerful, and, above all, _simple_. It was introduced in the paper [Hiera: A Hierarchical Vision Transformer without the Bells-and-Whistles](https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.00989/) and outperforms the state-of-the-art across a wide array of image and video tasks _while being much faster_.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
GetmanY1/wav2vec2-base-sami-cont-pt-22k,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The base model pre-trained on 16kHz sampled speech audio with **Continued Pre-Training (CPT)**. [wav2vec2-base-fi-voxpopuli-v2](https://huggingface.co/facebook/wav2vec2-base-fi-voxpopuli-v2) was used as a base model for continued pre-training. When using the model make sure that your speech input is also sampled at 16Khz.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
thoddnn/colqwen2-v1.0-hf,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> [!IMPORTANT] > This version of ColQwen2 should be loaded with the `transformers 🤗` release, not with `colpali-engine`. > It was converted using the `convert_colqwen2_weights_to_hf.py` script > from the [`vidore/colqwen2-v1.0-merged`](https://huggingface.co/vidore/colqwen2-v1.0-merged) checkpoint.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
moritzknaust/openvla-7b,19,0,mit,,,false,"OpenVLA 7B (`openvla-7b`) is an open vision-language-action model trained on 970K robot manipulation episodes from the [Open X-Embodiment](https://robotics-transformer-x.github.io/) dataset. The model takes language instructions and camera images as input and generates robot actions. It supports controlling multiple robots out-of-the-box, and can be quickly adapted for new robot domains via (parameter-efficient) fine-tuning.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
iamtatsuki05/Llama-JP-0.5B-PT-stage2,19,0,mit,,,false,English / [Japanese](README_JA.md),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AdaMLLab/XLM-RoBERTa-Arabic-Quality-Classifier,19,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"<p align=""center""> <a href=""https://huggingface.co/collections/AdaMLLab/mixminmatch""> </a> </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
VadimHursevich/rubert-tiny-sts-onnx,19,0,mit,,,false,"Быстрая модель BERT для расчетов компактных эмбеддингов предложений на русском языке. Модель основана на [cointegrated/rubert-tiny2](https://huggingface.co/cointegrated/rubert-tiny2) - имеет аналогичные размеры контекста (2048), ембеддинга (312) и быстродействие.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
rijuludar/slm-124M-llama32k-fwedu,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 124-million parameter causal language model trained from scratch on the FineWeb-Edu dataset. The model utilizes a Llama-style architecture and a custom 32,000-token vocabulary.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
oddadmix/Emhotob-25M-v2,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Emhotob** is a family of small Arabic language models pretrained **from scratch** on Arabic web text. This is the **25M** rung of the ladder (~25.27M parameters), part of a scaling series ranging from 500K to 25M parameters that all share the same tokenizer, context length, and training recipe. This is the **v2** run: trained from scratch on ~5B tokens per model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
yuyangalin/ImageWAM-FLUX.2-4B-InternData-A1-EE,19,0,mit,,,false,"This repository contains the **ImageWAM FLUX.2 4B checkpoint pretrained from InternData-A1** from **ImageWAM: Do World Action Models Really Need Video Generation, or Just Image Editing?**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
check-ai-labs/leo-storyteller-chat-1B,19,0,mit,,,false,"A 1.4B parameter Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) chat model, fine-tuned on multi-turn conversations from [ShareGPT](https://huggingface.co/datasets/anon8231489123/ShareGPT_Vicuna_unfiltered). Built on top of [check-ai-labs/leo-storyteller-base-1B](https://huggingface.co/check-ai-labs/leo-storyteller-base-1B), a base model pre-trained from scratch on [TinyStories](https://huggingface.co/datasets/roneneldan/TinyStories).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/finance-slm-1m,19,0,mit,,,false,A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~33.9M params) trained from scratch on Finance domain data. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/database-admin-slm-1m,19,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~1007.5M params, ~1.01B) trained from scratch for the **Database Admin** role. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nishantup/nanogpt-slm-classifier,19,0,mit,,,false,Binary spam classifier fine-tuned from the nanoGPT pretrained SLM.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/healthcare-slm-5m,19,0,mit,,,false,A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~33.9M params) trained from scratch on Healthcare domain data. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
farpluto/zubenelgenubi-124m,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A **124M-parameter** GPT-2 trained **from scratch** on with **knowledge distillation** from [SmolLM-135M-Instruct](https://huggingface.co/HuggingFaceTB/SmolLM-135M-Instruct).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Ethangou/attention-residuals-100M-block,19,0,mit,,,false,"This is the 100M Block Attention Residuals checkpoint for the attention-residuals-reproduction project. It uses a Qwen3-style decoder-only Transformer with block-level Attention Residuals, trained from scratch on Chinese data.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Ethangou/attention-residuals-100M-full,19,0,mit,,,false,"This is the 100M Full Attention Residuals checkpoint for the attention-residuals-reproduction project. It uses a Qwen3-style decoder-only Transformer with fine-grained Full Attention Residuals, trained from scratch on Chinese data.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
muteptr/gpt2-muon-124m,19,0,mit,,,false,"A faithful **GPT-2 (124M)** trained from scratch on **10B tokens of FineWeb-Edu**, using a **Muon-split optimizer + warmup-stable-decay (WSD)** recipe instead of the usual AdamW + cosine. The architecture is byte-identical to OpenAI GPT-2 small — only the training recipe differs.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
rahulreddyhanu/slm-125m-legal-financial,19,1,apache-2.0,,,false,A 125.8M-parameter Llama-architecture language model pretrained **from scratch** on a legal- and financial-domain corpus. Not fine-tuned from any existing base model — tokenizer and weights are both trained from zero.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ppanja/slm-125m-base,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,125M-parameter causal language model trained from scratch on a legal/financial corpus.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ajaxdavis/alpha-60m-base,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Alpha 60M Base is a 57,688,576-parameter causal language model trained from scratch with [Alpha](https://github.com/thomasdavis/alpha2), a TypeScript tensor/autograd stack and hand-written Vulkan compute backend. Every training step ran through Alpha and Helios on an RTX 3090; PyTorch and Transformers were used only after training to verify and package the result.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Mieaz/gpt15m-chat,19,0,mit,,,false,"12.4M-param GPT-2-style model (6 layers, 384 hidden, 6 heads, tied embeddings, vocab 4095). Trained for 1 epoch on 300M tokens: 200M TinyStories + 100M ultrachat dialogues. **Final held-out validation loss: 1.75** (TinyStories-valid).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tako080614/evex-3,19,0,mit,,,false,ある Discord サーバーの過去ログ **94万件だけ**で、tokenizer からゼロで作った **15.74M パラメータ**の言語モデル。事前学習済みの重みは1つも使っていない。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Fallovski/smallm-wolof,19,0,mit,,,false,"A **16.5M-parameter sparse Mixture-of-Experts language model trained from scratch on Wolof**, a Senegalese language with very limited digital resources. This is a research/proof-of-concept project, not a production model — see [Limitations](#limitations) before using it for anything beyond experimentation.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
navyam-ai/navya-1a,19,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Navya** is an India-first financial foundation model family, trained **from scratch** on an India-first corpus (finance + English + Hindi/Hinglish and other Indian languages), custom 64k tokenizer.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
LoneStriker/Mistral-11B-CC-Air-5.0bpw-h6-exl2,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,CollectiveCognition-v1.1-Mistral-7B and airoboros-mistral2.2-7b glued together.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
WendyHoang/roleplay-model-v2,18,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,CollectiveCognition-v1.1-Mistral-7B and airoboros-mistral2.2-7b glued together and finetuned with qlora of Pippa and LimaRPv3 dataset.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
beratcmn/Mistral-7B-v0.1-int8,18,1,apache-2.0,,,false,This is a 8 bit integer quantized version of Mistral 7B. Quantization done with BitsAndBytes. Original Model Card is below.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tensorblock/typhoon-7b-GGUF,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div style=""width: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto""> </div>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ssmits/Qwen2.5-7B-embed-base,18,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"Qwen2.5 is a language model series including decoder language models of different model sizes. For each size, we release the base language model and the aligned chat model. It is based on the Transformer architecture with SwiGLU activation, attention QKV bias, group query attention, etc. Additionally, we have an improved tokenizer adaptive to multiple natural languages and codes.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mradermacher/Claire-Mistral-7B-0.1-i1-GGUF,18,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,<!-- ### quantize_version: 2 --> <!-- ### output_tensor_quantised: 1 --> <!-- ### convert_type: hf --> <!-- ### vocab_type: --> <!-- ### tags: nicoboss --> weighted/imatrix quants of https://huggingface.co/OpenLLM-France/Claire-Mistral-7B-0.1,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fbaldassarri/sapienzanlp_Minerva-7B-base-v1.0-autoround-int4-gs128-sym,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Quantized version of [sapienzanlp/Minerva-7B-base-v1.0](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-7B-base-v1.0) using torch.float32 for quantization tuning. - 4 bits (INT4) - group size = 128 - Symmetrical Quantization - Method WoQ (AutoRound format),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-Instruct-v1.1-q3-mlx,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-Instruct-v1.1-q3-mlx](https://huggingface.co/alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-Instruct-v1.1-q3-mlx) was converted to MLX format from [OpenLLM-France/Lucie-7B-Instruct-v1.1](https://huggingface.co/OpenLLM-France/Lucie-7B-Instruct-v1.1) using mlx-lm version **0.21.4**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Mostafa8Mehrabi/qwen3-50m-c4-final-test-version,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Pretrained Qwen3-50M model on C4 dataset from scratch using FP16 precision.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RebuttalAgent/RebuttalAgent,18,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"An open 8-billion-parameter LLM that **models a reviewer’s mindset (Theory of Mind)** before writing, producing highly persuasive academic rebuttals.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
0arch-io/kisoku-3b-base,18,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 3B parameter language model trained **entirely from scratch** on Google Cloud TPUs using [MaxText](https://github.com/AI-Hypercomputer/maxtext) (JAX), supported by [Google's TPU Research Cloud (TRC)](https://sites.research.google/trc/).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
pvlabs/Chytrej2-Mini,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A fully custom pretrained language model built from scratch on the LLaMA architecture trained on 2B tokens of the [FineWeb Edu](https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-edu) dataset.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-3e19-1.9Bparams-2.5Btokens,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 1.9B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 2.5B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
