ryze-ai/flash-archer-150M-1.0,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Flash-Archer-150M is a compact Llama-compatible causal language model trained from scratch on roughly 975M tokens from FineWeb-Edu.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
