facebook/wav2vec2-base-en-voxpopuli-v2,18,1,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,[Facebook's Wav2Vec2](https://ai.facebook.com/blog/wav2vec-20-learning-the-structure-of-speech-from-raw-audio/) base model pretrained only in **en** on **24.1k** unlabeled datat of the [VoxPopuli corpus](https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.00390).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
facebook/wav2vec2-large-el-voxpopuli-v2,18,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,[Facebook's Wav2Vec2](https://ai.facebook.com/blog/wav2vec-20-learning-the-structure-of-speech-from-raw-audio/) large model pretrained only in **el** on **17.7** unlabeled datat of the [VoxPopuli corpus](https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.00390).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
seiya/oubiobert-base-uncased,18,3,apache-2.0,,,false,"Bidirectional Encoder Representations from Transformers for Biomedical Text Mining by Osaka University (ouBioBERT) is a language model based on the BERT-Base (Devlin, et al., 2019) architecture. We pre-trained ouBioBERT on PubMed abstracts from the PubMed baseline (ftp://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/baseline) via our method.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
stefan-it/electra-base-gc4-64k-400000-cased-discriminator,18,0,mit,,,false,"This repository presents a colossal (and biased) language model for German trained on the recently released [""German colossal, clean Common Crawl corpus""](https://german-nlp-group.github.io/projects/gc4-corpus.html) (GC4), with a total dataset size of ~844GB.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
xyma/PROP-marco-step400k,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**PROP**, **P**re-training with **R**epresentative w**O**rds **P**rediction, is a new pre-training method tailored for ad-hoc retrieval. PROP is inspired by the classical statistical language model for IR, specifically the query likelihood model, which assumes that the query is generated as the piece of text representative of the “ideal” document. Based on this idea, we construct the representative words prediction (ROP) task for pre-training. The full paper can be found [here](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2010.10137.pdf).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
bongsoo/bert-base-kor-v1,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"- Bert-base 한국어 scratch 모델 - [ai_hub 웹데이터 기반 한국어 말뭉치 데이터](https://aihub.or.kr/aihubdata/data/view.do?currMenu=115&topMenu=100&aihubDataSe=realm&dataSetSn=624) (약 52M Text) 말뭉치로 NSP, MLM 훈련시킨 모델 - vocab: 30,022개 (BertTokenizer)",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
