stellaathena/qwen3-0.6b-sweep-ot1.0-psn32,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 751M-parameter Qwen3-0.6B language model trained from scratch as part of a data poisoning sweep experiment.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nazdef/gpt2medium-en-it-nanochat-gpt2preln-decay13500-step14200,18,0,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,This repository publishes the requested **ordinary checkpoint release** for `step_14200` from the original medium GPT2PreLN `13.5k` decay-only tail.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
oddadmix/Emhotob-10M,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Emhotob** is a family of small Arabic language models pretrained **from scratch** on Arabic web text. This is the **10M** rung of the ladder (~10.95M parameters), part of a scaling series ranging from 500K to 25M parameters that all share the same tokenizer, context length, and training recipe.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AETHORIA-AI/TR-HASH-MOE-500M-20B,18,1,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"Research pretraining artifact for a 492.1M-parameter decoder-only language model with grouped-query attention, a shared dense MLP path, and deterministic token-ID hashed residual experts.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
JupiterZhu/T2MLR_135M_lstart13_lend18_50B_FineWebEdu,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**T2MLR** (Transformer with Temporal Middle-Layer Recurrence) applies a recurrent connection across a contiguous band of middle layers, carrying a recurrent state between token positions. This checkpoint is a 135M model pretrained **from scratch** on FineWeb-Edu for **~51.5B tokens**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jasonacox/nanochat-560M-sft,18,0,mit,,,false,Supervised fine-tuned model with safety training and high-quality conversation data. Optimized for better response quality and safety.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/marketing-manager-slm-1m,18,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~989.0M params, ~0.99B) trained from scratch for the **Marketing Manager** role. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/finance-slm-5m,18,0,mit,,,false,A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~33.9M params) trained from scratch on Finance domain data. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/network-engineer-slm-5m,18,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~1019.5M params, ~1.02B) trained from scratch for the **Network Engineer** role. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
shivnathtathe/T4NT-0.5B,18,2,apache-2.0,,,false,**Tanh 4-bit Neural Transformer** — a 535M parameter language model trained entirely from scratch with 4-bit quantization-aware training (QAT) using symmetric quantization and tanh soft weight clipping.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
romizone/slm-bahasa-id,18,0,mit,,,false,"<div align=""center"">",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SykoSLM/SykoLLM-V5.9-Mini,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**SykoLLM-V5.9-Mini, sıfırdan (from scratch)** eğitilmiş, Türkçe ve İngilizce destekli, kod anlama kapasitesine sahip **SykoLLM** ailesinin **küçük** bir dil modelidir. **Phi-3 mimarisi** temel alınarak özel BPE tokenizer ile geliştirilmiştir.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
FiShota/hinomoto-1b-continued-pt-v1,18,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,HinoMoto-1B v1 Phase 2 Full に **継続事前学習 (corpus 95% + bench 5%)** を 1500 step 適用した派生.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
samueljayasingh/slimGPT,18,0,mit,,,false,"**slimGPT** is a 124-million-parameter autoregressive language model built from scratch using a clean, modular PyTorch codebase. It follows the GPT-2 small architecture and was trained entirely on consumer-accessible hardware, demonstrating that capable language model training is achievable without large-scale infrastructure.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Skyl4r-Ai/Skylar-980M-Cobol-Base,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> 🔬 **Published as a transparent research for the Skylar framework, not as a general-purpose or SOTA model.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
applegrew/support-125M-slm-sft,18,0,mit,,,false,"A **125M parameter Llama-style language model** trained from scratch on ~2.6B tokens of IT support data, then instruction-tuned on ~17K examples including **RAFT (Retrieval-Augmented Fine-Tuning)** data.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mbsdeepak/scribe,18,1,mit,,,false,"A **~30M-parameter small language model built from scratch in PyTorch** and trained on [TinyStories](https://huggingface.co/datasets/roneneldan/TinyStories). It's a decoder-only GPT — hand-written multi-head causal attention, pre-LayerNorm blocks, GELU MLP, tied LM head — with no `transformers`/`nanoGPT` modelling code. The architecture is deliberately **GPT-2-compatible**, so these weights load directly into [`ember`](https://github.com/mbsdeepak/ember), a from-scratch LLM inference server.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
BrCamp/bee-350m-pt-base-15b,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Este e' o gemeo experimental de [BrCamp/bee-350m-pt-base](https://huggingface.co/BrCamp/bee-350m-pt-base).** Mesma arquitetura, mesmo corpus, mesmo tokenizador, mesma forma de schedule — **a unica coisa que difere e' o total de tokens**: 15,00B aqui contra 21,75B no principal.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mukherjee78/abc-voice-slm-asr,18,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A speech recognizer implemented from first principles — a Zipformer-style encoder and a stateless RNN-Transducer predictor/joiner, hand-written in PyTorch (only the RNN-Transducer loss itself uses an established library call, `torchaudio.functional.rnnt_loss` — see the source repository for exactly why). Pretrained from scratch on English (LibriSpeech), then fine-tuned onto Bengali and Hindi via cross-lingual vocabulary extension.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
syedasumayya1/forgegpt-12m,18,0,mit,,,false,"A 12.2M-parameter GPT-style model built from scratch in PyTorch (own BPE tokenizer, RoPE, RMSNorm, SwiGLU, KV-cache) and trained on TinyStories for 5,000 steps on a free Colab T4.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
0xOracle/mistral-7b-fraud-test-finetuned,17,2,mit,,,false,license: mit tags: - code - 'mistral ' - pretrained - Inference Endpoints - text-generation-inference language: - en library_name: transformers pipeline_tag: text-generation,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
lucyknada/Mistral-7B-v0.1-exl2-5bpw,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
issafuad/mistral-7b-base,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
