niels-stig-hansen/wikisql-4bit-1k,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [niels-stig-hansen/wikisql-4bit-1k](https://huggingface.co/niels-stig-hansen/wikisql-4bit-1k) was converted to MLX format from [mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) using mlx-lm version **0.21.1**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-q6-mlx,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-q6-mlx](https://huggingface.co/alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-q6-mlx) was converted to MLX format from [OpenLLM-France/Lucie-7B](https://huggingface.co/OpenLLM-France/Lucie-7B) using mlx-lm version **0.21.4**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fbaldassarri/sapienzanlp_Minerva-7B-base-v1.0-autogptq-int8-gs128-sym,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Quantized version of [sapienzanlp/Minerva-7B-base-v1.0](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-7B-base-v1.0) using torch.float32 for quantization tuning. - 8 bits (INT8) - group size = 128 - Symmetrical Quantization - Method AutoGPTQ,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
JulianKrgd/julian-600m-10b,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 600M parameter decoder-only language model trained from scratch using JAX/Flax on Google Cloud TPUs.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-2e19-358Mparams-9.5Btokens,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 358M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 2 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 9.5B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-2e20-8.1Bparams-3.5Btokens,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 8.1B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 2 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 3.5B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-3e19-2.5Bparams-1.9Btokens,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 2.5B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 1.9B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-3e20-8.1Bparams-5.8Btokens,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 8.1B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 5.8B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
