facebook/wav2vec2-base-et-voxpopuli-v2,17,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,[Facebook's Wav2Vec2](https://ai.facebook.com/blog/wav2vec-20-learning-the-structure-of-speech-from-raw-audio/) base model pretrained only in **et** on **10.6k** unlabeled datat of the [VoxPopuli corpus](https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.00390).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
facebook/wav2vec2-base-nl-voxpopuli-v2,17,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,[Facebook's Wav2Vec2](https://ai.facebook.com/blog/wav2vec-20-learning-the-structure-of-speech-from-raw-audio/) base model pretrained only in **nl** on **19.0k** unlabeled datat of the [VoxPopuli corpus](https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.00390).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
facebook/wav2vec2-base-nl-voxpopuli,17,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,[Facebook's Wav2Vec2](https://ai.facebook.com/blog/wav2vec-20-learning-the-structure-of-speech-from-raw-audio/) base model pretrained on the nl unlabeled subset of [VoxPopuli corpus](https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.00390).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
facebook/wav2vec2-base-pt-voxpopuli-v2,17,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,[Facebook's Wav2Vec2](https://ai.facebook.com/blog/wav2vec-20-learning-the-structure-of-speech-from-raw-audio/) base model pretrained only in **pt** on **17.5k** unlabeled datat of the [VoxPopuli corpus](https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.00390).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
flax-community/bigband,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"BigBird, is a sparse-attention based transformer which extends Transformer based models, such as BERT to much longer sequences. Moreover, BigBird comes along with a theoretical understanding of the capabilities of a complete transformer that the sparse model can handle.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Intel/bert-base-uncased-sparse-80-1x4-block-pruneofa,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model is was created using Prune OFA method described in [Prune Once for All: Sparse Pre-Trained Language Models](https://arxiv.org/abs/2111.05754) presented in ENLSP NeurIPS Workshop 2021.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
approach0/colbert-bertnsp-220,17,0,mit,,,false,This [repository](https://github.com/approach0/azbert) is a boilerplate to push a mask-filling model to the HuggingFace Model Hub.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
approach0/dpr-math-aware-albert-220,17,0,mit,,,false,This [repository](https://github.com/approach0/azbert) is a boilerplate to push a mask-filling model to the HuggingFace Model Hub.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
hmteams/teams-tokenizer,17,0,mit,,,false,,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
gerturax/gerturax-1,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This repository hosts the GERTuraX-1 model:,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fav-kky/wav2vec2-base-cs-50k,17,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,This is a monolingual Czech Wav2Vec 2.0 base model pre-trained from 50 thousand hours of Czech speech. It has been released along with a paper **A Comparative Analysis of Bilingual and Trilingual Wav2Vec Models for Automatic Speech Recognition in Multilingual Oral History Archives** accepted to INTERSPEECH2024 conference.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fav-kky/wav2vec2-base-cs-en-100k,17,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,This is a bilingual Wav2Vec 2.0 base model pre-trained from 100 thousand hours of speech (50 thousand hours of Czech and 50 thousand hours of English). It has been released along with a paper **A Comparative Analysis of Bilingual and Trilingual Wav2Vec Models for Automatic Speech Recognition in Multilingual Oral History Archives** accepted to INTERSPEECH2024 conference.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
GetmanY1/wav2vec2-large-sami-cont-pt-22k,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The large model pre-trained on 16kHz sampled speech audio with **Continued Pre-Training (CPT)**. [wav2vec2-large-uralic-voxpopuli-v2](https://huggingface.co/facebook/wav2vec2-large-uralic-voxpopuli-v2) was used as a base model for continued pre-training. When using the model make sure that your speech input is also sampled at 16Khz.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tech9-ai/colpali-v1.3-hf,17,0,gemma,,,false,"> [!IMPORTANT] > This version of ColPali should be loaded with the `transformers 🤗` release, not with `colpali-engine`. > It was converted using the [`convert_colpali_weights_to_hf.py` script](https://github.com/tonywu71/transformers/blob/21c1309637aee97ca4fb8eb3b31830913a0f99a5/src/transformers/models/colpali/convert_colpali_weights_to_hf.py) > from the [`vidore/colpali-v1.3-merged`](https://huggingface.co/vidore/colpali-v1.3-merged) checkpoint.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ihlab/FEMI,17,19,cc-by-nc-nd-4.0,,,false,"FEMI is a foundation model for embryology, trained on time-lapse images of embryos. It leverages the Vision Transformer (ViT) architecture with Masked Autoencoder (MAE) pretraining to learn rich representations from embryonic images. The model is available in both PyTorch and TensorFlow implementations and can be fine-tuned for various downstream tasks in in vitro fertilization (IVF) research.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
amsterdamNLP/Wav2Vec2-NL,17,1,openrail,,,false,"A Dutch Wav2Vec2-base model, pre-trained on 831 hours of exclusively Dutch speech.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
yinchenghust/openvla_base,17,0,mit,,,false,"OpenVLA 7B (`openvla-7b`) is an open vision-language-action model trained on 970K robot manipulation episodes from the [Open X-Embodiment](https://robotics-transformer-x.github.io/) dataset. The model takes language instructions and camera images as input and generates robot actions. It supports controlling multiple robots out-of-the-box, and can be quickly adapted for new robot domains via (parameter-efficient) fine-tuning.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
JeasLee/openvla-0.5b-prismatic,17,0,mit,,,false,**OpenVLA 0.5B** is a compact 0.5B-parameter model trained following the settings of the original [OpenVLA](https://huggingface.co/openvla/openvla-7b). It is initialized from a smaller Prismatic [VLM](https://huggingface.co/Stanford-ILIAD/prism-qwen25-extra-dinosiglip-224px-0_5b) checkpoint—**Qwen2.5 0.5B**—from [MiniVLA](https://ai.stanford.edu/blog/minivla/).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Xv-yn/smollm3-500m,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A base pretrained causal language model (~500M parameters) trained from scratch on ~19.8B tokens of mixed web and reference text.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AdaMLLab/mmBERT-Hindi-Quality-Classifier,17,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"<p align=""center""> <a href=""https://huggingface.co/collections/AdaMLLab/mixminmatch""> </a> </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
OpenTransformer/AGILLM-3-large-v2,17,5,apache-2.0,,,false,"Continuation of [AGILLM-3-Large](https://huggingface.co/OpenTransformer/AGILLM-3-large) training, restarted from a known-good checkpoint after a critical tokenizer bug was discovered.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
DuoNeural/Axon-352M,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,**DuoNeural Research | 2026-07-05 | Archon**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cooler8/yejin-korean-3b-v1-sft,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,> **yejin-korean-3b-v1**은 한국어 고품질 코퍼스및 AI Hub Datas 로 100% From-Scratch 사전학습 및 8x H200 GPU Full SFT를 적용한 한국어 파운데이션 모델입니다.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
yanr000/openvla-7b,17,0,mit,,,false,"OpenVLA 7B (`openvla-7b`) is an open vision-language-action model trained on 970K robot manipulation episodes from the [Open X-Embodiment](https://robotics-transformer-x.github.io/) dataset. The model takes language instructions and camera images as input and generates robot actions. It supports controlling multiple robots out-of-the-box, and can be quickly adapted for new robot domains via (parameter-efficient) fine-tuning.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AarambhAI/gemma-like-multimodal-speech-vision-text,17,0,mit,,,false,"This is a **multimodal model trained from scratch** on text, speech, and vision data. It supports **any-to-any pipelines** (e.g., text-to-text, speech-to-text, vision-to-text).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jasonacox/nanochat-560M-midtrain,17,0,mit,,,false,Midtrained model fine-tuned for conversational interactions. Trained on SmolTalk dataset with special tokens for multi-turn conversations.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/system-admin-slm-1m,17,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~1016.6M params, ~1.02B) trained from scratch for the **System Admin** role. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/cybersecurity-slm-5m,17,0,mit,,,false,A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~33.9M params) trained from scratch on Cybersecurity domain data. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/retail-slm-5m,17,0,mit,,,false,A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~33.9M params) trained from scratch on Retail domain data. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/software-engineer-slm-5m,17,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~989.9M params, ~0.99B) trained from scratch for the **Software Engineer** role. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SykoSLM/SykoLLM-V5.4,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**SykoLLM**, modern dil modeli tasarım prensiplerinden (RoPE, RMSNorm, SwiGLU, GQA) ilham alınarak sıfırdan yazılmış özel bir mimariyle oluşturulmuş 233M parametreli bir nedensel dil modelidir. Türkçe, İngilizce ve kod içeren çok dilli bir veri karışımıyla eğitilmiştir.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
FiShota/hinomoto-100m-v7,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,> 個人 GPU + アイディア + 実装速度で、世界水準の研究所と同じ土俵に踏み込む実験,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
raulgdp/tinyllama-acredita-cna-col-150M,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Primer modelo de lenguaje de **arquitectura propia** entrenado desde cero en documentación oficial de acreditación universitaria colombiana.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
korkmazumut/orkhon-bumin,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,4M arithmetic/chat smoke model proving the full Orkhon pipeline.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Rohanify/PyBlissa-Coder-50M,17,0,mit,,,false,"A 50M-parameter Python code generation model trained from scratch on a single RTX 5080. Built as part of the **PRIME** lineup of small, locally-runnable AI systems.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Gentraxyz/RecursiveComplete,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A small GPT-2-style language model (~18.3M parameters) trained **completely from scratch by an AI**, end to end — the architecture, training code, tokenizer, data prep, and training run were all written and executed by an AI agent with no pre-existing weights or fine-tuning from another model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nkthebass/TinyBrainBot-demo-216.5m,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **216.5M-parameter** conversational language model **trained from scratch** on a custom decoder-only architecture. This is an early **proof-of-concept / demo** checkpoint: the goal is to show that a small model with a proper subword tokenizer can hold coherent, on-topic chat — not to compete with production models.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
oddadmix/Emhotob-50M-GRPO-Arabic-Final,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **~51.8M-parameter** Arabic **tool-calling / function-calling** model, tuned with **GRPO** (Group Relative Policy Optimization) reinforcement learning on top of a distilled SFT checkpoint. It is a proof-of-concept for **agentic Arabic behavior at tiny scale** — deciding *when to call a tool* vs. *when to decline*, entirely from a model small enough to run on a CPU.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
delcenjo/char-transformer-shakespeare,17,0,mit,,,false,"A small decoder-only transformer (GPT-style), trained from scratch at the character level on the Tiny Shakespeare dataset. It was built to make the mechanics of self-attention, causal masking and positional embeddings visible, by implementing them by hand instead of using `torch.nn.Transformer`.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
glassbox/gpt-alpha-bg-restorer,17,0,mit,,,false,"Two small character-level GPTs that turn **shlyokavitsa**, Bulgarian typed on a Latin keyboard, back into Cyrillic. Trained from scratch, no pretrained initialization. Both run offline on a CPU, and both ship as WebAssembly, so the text never leaves the device.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mickey5k/slm-125m-base,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **125M-parameter, Llama-style, decoder-only language model**, pretrained **completely from scratch** (fresh weights, fresh 16K byte-level BPE tokenizer) on a domain-specific corpus of US case law, SEC filings, and general web text.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
lattice-research/lattice-mini,17,0,mit,,,false,A 42M-parameter GPT-2-style decoder-only language model trained **from scratch** by [Lattice](https://lattice-site-lime.vercel.app). No pretrained weights were used.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
BytesTalk/Muse-525M,17,0,mit,,,false,"A from-scratch roleplay and companion language model by **BytesTalk**. Not a fine-tune of anything — every weight was trained from random initialization, starting from a tokenizer built for this model and a corpus assembled for it.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
navyam-ai/navya-0,17,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Navya** is an India-first financial foundation model family, trained **from scratch** on an India-first corpus (finance + English + Hindi/Hinglish and other Indian languages), custom 64k tokenizer.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Yibeltal1/amharic-skipgram-baseline,17,0,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"A small Skip-gram word embedding model for **Amharic (አማርኛ)**, implemented **from scratch in pure Python** (lists, loops, `math`, `random`; no NumPy, no autograd, no pretrained vectors) as part of a university/internship assignment.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
srswti/bodega-solomon-9b,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Bodega-Solomon-9B brings multimodal understanding to the Bodega ecosystem. Built on advanced vision-language architecture, this model processes images, screenshots, documents, and text in a unified understanding framework. It runs entirely on your hardware as part of Bodega OS, ensuring your visual data never leaves your machine.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
lschaffer/qwen2_5_1_5b-filesystem,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,> ⚠️ **This model is trained for the filesystem MCP server.** > It is optimised for structured MCP tool-call generation and is not intended > to be a general-purpose assistant.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
LoneStriker/Mistral-11B-CC-Air-RP-8.0bpw-h6-exl2,16,1,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,CollectiveCognition-v1.1-Mistral-7B and airoboros-mistral2.2-7b glued together and finetuned with qlora of Pippa and LimaRPv3 dataset.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
LoneStriker/Mistral-11B-CC-Air-4.0bpw-h6-exl2,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,CollectiveCognition-v1.1-Mistral-7B and airoboros-mistral2.2-7b glued together.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
LoneStriker/Mistral-11B-CC-Air-6.0bpw-h6-exl2,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,CollectiveCognition-v1.1-Mistral-7B and airoboros-mistral2.2-7b glued together.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jacobolopez/Mistral-7B-v0.1-sharded,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MaziyarPanahi/typhoon-7b-Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,typhoon-7b-Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1 is a merge of the following models: * [mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1) * [scb10x/typhoon-7b](https://huggingface.co/scb10x/typhoon-7b),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MaziyarPanahi/Mistral-7B-v0.1-sharded-Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Mistral-7B-v0.1-sharded-Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1 is a merge of the following models: * [mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1) * [alexsherstinsky/Mistral-7B-v0.1-sharded](https://huggingface.co/alexsherstinsky/Mistral-7B-v0.1-sharded),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nikniksen/fine_mistral,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
winglian/mistral-denseformer-7b-pretrained,16,3,apache-2.0,,,false,This is a DenseFormer implementation of Mistral-7B-v0.1. The details about DenseFormer are in the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.02622).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MaziyarPanahi/Mistral-7B-v0.2,16,2,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2 Large Language Model (LLM) was fine-tuned on top of Mistral-7B-v0.2.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mudler/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0-Q8_0-GGUF,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0`](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
n0w0f/MatText-zmatrix-2m,16,0,mit,,,false,Model Pretrained using Masked Language Modelling on 2 million crystal structures in one of the **MatText** Representation,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RaphaelMourad/Mistral-Peptide-v1-15M,16,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-Peptide-v1-15M Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative peptide molecule model with 15.2M parameters. It is derived from Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for protein: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 863499 peptide strings.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kaetemi/Qwen2-7B-Q8_0-GGUF,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`Qwen/Qwen2-7B`](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-7B) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-7B) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fbaldassarri/sapienzanlp_Minerva-1B-base-v1.0-autoround-int4-gs128-asym,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Quantized version of [sapienzanlp/Minerva-1B-base-v1.0](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-1B-base-v1.0) using torch.float32 for quantization tuning. - 4 bits (INT4) - group size = 128 - Asymmetrical Quantization - Method WoQ (AutoRound format),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
