alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-Instruct-v1.1-q4-mlx,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-Instruct-v1.1-q4-mlx](https://huggingface.co/alexgusevski/Lucie-7B-Instruct-v1.1-q4-mlx) was converted to MLX format from [OpenLLM-France/Lucie-7B-Instruct-v1.1](https://huggingface.co/OpenLLM-France/Lucie-7B-Instruct-v1.1) using mlx-lm version **0.21.4**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RaphaelMourad/ModernBERT-Codon-v1-34M,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The ModerBert-Codon-v1-34M Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA sequence model with 34M parameters. It is derived from ModernBERT model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 24M coding DNA sequences (3000bp) from many different species (vertebrates, plants, bacteria, viruses, ...).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
bymurphywang/wikisql-4bit-1k,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model [murphy1021/wikisql-4bit-1k](https://huggingface.co/murphy1021/wikisql-4bit-1k) was converted to MLX format from [mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) using mlx-lm version **0.22.1**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Base-FP8,16,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"Dicta-LM 3.0 is a powerful open-weight collection of LLMs, trained on extensive corpora of Hebrew and English texts. The models are available for download and for unlimited use. The models set a new SOTA for their weight-class for Hebrew, both as base models and chat models.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Thinking-FP8,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Dicta-LM 3.0 is a powerful open-weight collection of LLMs, trained on extensive corpora of Hebrew and English texts. The models are available for download and for unlimited use. The models set a new SOTA for their weight-class for Hebrew, both as base models and chat models.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-2e19-2.5Bparams-1.1Btokens,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 2.5B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 2 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 1.1B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-2e20-9.7Bparams-2.9Btokens,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 9.7B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 2 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 2.9B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-3e19-3.4Bparams-1.4Btokens,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 3.4B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 1.4B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-3e20-11.8Bparams-4Btokens,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 11.8B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 4B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-3e20-5.3Bparams-8.8Btokens,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 5.3B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 3 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 8.8B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
