thoddnn/colqwen2-v1.0-mlx,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [thoddnn/colqwen2-v1.0-mlx](https://huggingface.co/thoddnn/colqwen2-v1.0-mlx) was converted to MLX format from [vidore/colqwen2-v1.0-hf](https://huggingface.co/vidore/colqwen2-v1.0-hf) using mlx-lm version **0.0.3**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
