AlexWortega/moe-200m-qwen3-step160000-5B-20260522-2256,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Mid-training snapshot of the in-flight `moe-200m-qwen3-100b` pretrain run, captured at **step 159 999 ≈ 5.24 B tokens consumed** (5.2 % of the 100 B-token budget, +74 % more training than the [step 70 000 / 2.4 B snapshot](https://huggingface.co/AlexWortega/moe-200m-qwen3-step70000-2B-20260520-1912)). Trained autonomously by the on 2× Tesla V100-SXM2 32 GB.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
The-CoLab/llama3-7b-en-anchored-ar,16,0,llama3,,,false,"LLaMA-3 7B pretrained on English-Arabic bilingual data with anchored training, 134k steps.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nazdef/gpt2medium-en-it-nanochat-gpt2preln-decay13500-step14500,16,0,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"This repository publishes the requested **ordinary checkpoint release** for `step_14500`, the current **best behavior-only candidate** inside the replayed medium GPT2PreLN `13.5k` decay family.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
oddadmix/Emhotob-1M-v2,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Emhotob** is a family of small Arabic language models pretrained **from scratch** on Arabic web text. This is the **1M** rung of the ladder (~1.07M parameters), part of a scaling series ranging from 500K to 25M parameters that all share the same tokenizer, context length, and training recipe. This is the **v2** run: trained from scratch on ~5B tokens per model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
laion/open-sci-ref-1.7b-nemotron-hq-mv_reasoning-100B-4096-longsft_16k,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,16k long-context extension of `laion/open-sci-ref-v0.02-1.7b-nemotron-hq-mv_reasoning-100B-4096`. Final train loss **0.8250** (vs 0.9778 for the no-reasoning cell).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
NNEngine/TinyWay-1.0.0,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**TinyWay 1.0.0** is a **52.94M parameter GPT-style causal language model** trained **from scratch** on the **TinyStories** dataset. The model is designed for **lightweight story generation, research, and educational exploration** of decoder-only Transformer architectures.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/education-slm-1m,16,0,mit,,,false,A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~33.9M params) trained from scratch on Education domain data. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/retail-slm-1m,16,0,mit,,,false,A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~33.9M params) trained from scratch on Retail domain data. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/data-scientist-slm-5m,16,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~989.7M params, ~0.99B) trained from scratch for the **Data Scientist** role. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/legal-slm-5m,16,0,mit,,,false,A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~33.9M params) trained from scratch on Legal domain data. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Ethangou/attention-residuals-0.6B-block,16,0,mit,,,false,"This is the 0.6B Block Attention Residuals checkpoint for the attention-residuals-reproduction project. It uses a Qwen3-style decoder-only Transformer with block-level Attention Residuals, trained from scratch on Chinese data.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
hranjan043/himbot-gpt-level2,16,0,mit,,,false,A GPT-style language model trained **from scratch** using PyTorch on WikiText-103.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
redredredredredred/slm-from-scratch-77m,16,1,mit,,,false,"A 77M parameter GPT-style language model written and trained from scratch in PyTorch on a single RTX 5070 Ti. No HuggingFace `transformers` model classes were used. Every component (attention, MLP, blocks, embeddings, the training loop) was hand-coded as part of a learning project to understand the full LLM training pipeline.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ThanhNguyen111/yu-gi-oh-llm,16,1,mit,,,false,A **decoder-only Transformer** trained **from scratch** in pure PyTorch to generate fictional Yu-Gi-Oh! card text.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sterlixlol/serblo-125m-instruct,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This is the finished version of [Serblo-125M](https://huggingface.co/sterlixlol/serblo-125m) that is fine-tuned to actually chat. The trainer is ~250 lines of released PyTorch, no external training libraries. It answers in native Serbian, matches register, and it stops when it's done, which most 125M models don't.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
beardymcgee/cascamini-gpt2-210m-edu-3b-v2,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,CascaMini-GPT2-210M-Edu-AdamW-3B-V2 is a GPT-2-style causal language model trained from scratch as part of the CascaMini learning-through-building project.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sverma8873/slm-125m-base,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 125.8M-parameter LLaMA-architecture decoder-only language model **pretrained from scratch** on a legal/financial-heavy corpus (~2.0B tokens: ~40% US case-law, ~40% SEC filings, ~20% educational web text).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
zyoralabs/AQ-academic-ai,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,**AQ (Academic Quotient) — India's Concept-First Academic AI. v1 now live.** *Raising the Academic Quotient of every student.*,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
applegrew/support-125M-slm-base,16,1,mit,,,false,A **125M parameter Llama-style language model** trained from scratch on ~2.6B tokens of curated IT support and technical data. This is the **base (pretrained)** model — it completes text but does not follow instructions.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sarathi-balakrishnan/tiny-sql-gpt,16,0,mit,,,false,"> **The goal:** build a language model from scratch, end to end, small enough to understand every > part of it, and in doing so understand how the large ones actually work.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
alpharomercoma/slm-pipeline-151m,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 151M-parameter language model trained **from scratch** through every stage of the modern pipeline — pre-training → mid-training → SFT → DPO → RLVR/GRPO — on **one H100 in 20 hours 20 minutes**. Every stage is plain PyTorch: no TRL, no `Trainer`, every loss written out.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SMLBuilder/cobol-jeeves-sml,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> ⚠️ **PROTOTYPE / research artifact — read the Honesty section before citing any > number.** This is a *method demonstration*, not a working COBOL author and not a > generalization result. It was adversarially reviewed (Claude, Codex, GLM) and the > framing below is the corrected, honest version after that review.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
navyam-ai/navya-1b,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Navya** is an India-first financial foundation model family, trained **from scratch** on an India-first corpus (finance + English + Hindi/Hinglish and other Indian languages), custom 64k tokenizer.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
navyam-ai/navya-1b-sft-v9,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Navya** is an India-first financial foundation model family, trained **from scratch** on an India-first corpus (finance + English + Hindi/Hinglish and other Indian languages), custom 64k tokenizer.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
360ZhiNao/360Zhinao2-7B-Chat-360K-Int4,16,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div align=""center""> <h1> 360Zhinao2 (360智脑) </h1> </div> <div align=""center""> 🤗 <a href=""https://huggingface.co/qihoo360"">HuggingFace</a>&nbsp&nbsp | &nbsp&nbsp 🤖 <a href=""https://modelscope.cn/organization/360zhinao"">ModelScope</a>&nbsp&nbsp ｜ &nbsp&nbsp 💬 <a href=""./assets/WeChat.png"">WeChat (微信)</a>&nbsp&nbsp ｜ &nbsp&nbsp <a href=""https://github.com/Qihoo360/360zhiano2"">GitHub</a>&nbsp&nbsp </div> <br> <p align=""center""> Feel free to visit 360Zhinao's official website<a href=""https://ai.360.com""> https://ai.360.com</a> for more experience. </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
lschaffer/qwen2_5_1_5b-git,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,> ⚠️ **This model is trained for the git MCP server.** > It is optimised for structured MCP tool-call generation and is not intended > to be a general-purpose assistant.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sreenathvemula/christian-qwen3-32b-lora-r32,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A fine-tuned **Qwen3-32B** that answers Bible-study questions from within historic Nicene-Chalcedonian Protestant orthodoxy, and **looks up Scripture, commentary, lexicons and the confessions before it answers** rather than reciting from memory.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
LoneStriker/Mistral-11B-CC-Air-RP-3.0bpw-h6-exl2,15,1,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,CollectiveCognition-v1.1-Mistral-7B and airoboros-mistral2.2-7b glued together and finetuned with qlora of Pippa and LimaRPv3 dataset.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
timpal0l/Mistral-7B-v0.1-flashback,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Mistral-7B-v0.1-flashback model is a continuation of the pretraining process for the base Mistral-7B-v0.1 model, utilizing around 40GB of forum threads from the Swedish website flashback.org. The training was done with the QLoRa method, training about 88 million parameters in a single epoch.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dfurman/Mistral-7B-v0.1-fork,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
vinayakpevekar/mistral_sharded,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This is the sharded version of Mistral-7B-v0.1 so you can use it when you have limited CPU memory,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
lucyknada/Mistral-7B-v0.1-exl2-3bpw,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
asya-ai/Mistral-7B-v0.1-AWQ,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,- Model creator: [Mistral AI](https://huggingface.co/mistralai) - Original model: [Mistral 7B v0.1](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
