RaphaelMourad/Mistral-Chem-v1-15M,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-Chem-v1-15M Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative chemical molecule model with 1.9M parameters x 8 experts = 15.2M parameters. It is derived from Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for molecules: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 10M molecule SMILES strings from the PubChem database.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
n0w0f/MatText-cifp1-2m,15,0,mit,,,false,Model Pretrained using Masked Language Modelling on 2 million crystal structures in one of the **MatText** Representation,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
n0w0f/MatText-slices-2m,15,0,mit,,,false,Model Pretrained using Masked Language Modelling on 2 million crystal structures in one of the **MatText** Representation,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
n0w0f/MatText-composition-2m,15,1,mit,,,false,Model Pretrained using Masked Language Modelling on 2 million crystal structures in one of the **MatText** Representation,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
macadeliccc/Qwen2-7B-AWQ,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Qwen2 is the new series of Qwen large language models. For Qwen2, we release a number of base language models and instruction-tuned language models ranging from 0.5 to 72 billion parameters, including a Mixture-of-Experts model. This repo contains the 7B Qwen2 base language model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fbaldassarri/sapienzanlp_Minerva-7B-instruct-v1.0-autoround-int4-gs128-asym,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Quantized version of [sapienzanlp/Minerva-7B-instruct-v1.0](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-7B-instruct-v1.0) using torch.float32 for quantization tuning. - 4 bits (INT4) - group size = 128 - Asymmetrical Quantization - Method WoQ (AutoRound format),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fbaldassarri/sapienzanlp_Minerva-7B-instruct-v1.0-autogptq-int4-gs128-sym,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Quantized version of [sapienzanlp/Minerva-7B-instruct-v1.0](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-7B-instruct-v1.0) using torch.float32 for quantization tuning. - 4 bits (INT4) - group size = 128 - Symmetrical Quantization - Method AutoGPTQ,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fbaldassarri/sapienzanlp_Minerva-350M-base-v1.0-autoawq-int4-gs64-asym,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Quantized version of [sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0) using torch.float32 for quantization tuning. - 4 bits (INT4) - group size = 128 - Asymmetrical Quantization - Method AutoAWQ,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Brianpuze/Qwen2-0.5B-Q4_K_M-GGUF,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Absolutely tremendous! This repo features **GGUF quantized** versions of [Qwen/Qwen2-0.5B](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-0.5B) — made possible using the *very powerful* `llama.cpp`. Believe me, it's fast, it's smart, it's winning. Only the best quantization. You’ll love it. Just plug it in, hit the command line, and boom — you're running world-class AI, folks: ```bash llama-cli --hf-repo Brianpuze/Qwen2-0.5B-Q4_K_M-GGUF --hf-file qwen2-0.5b-q4_k_m.gguf -p ""AI First, but also..."" ``` This beautiful Hugging Face Space was brought to you by the **amazing team at [Antigma Labs](https://antigma.ai)**. Great people. Big vision. Doing things that matter — and doing them right. Total winners.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
DuMarek/Qwen2-7B-openvino,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to OpenVINO from [`Qwen/Qwen2-7B`](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-7B) using [optimum-intel](https://github.com/huggingface/optimum-intel) via the [export](https://huggingface.co/spaces/echarlaix/openvino-export) space.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Ferropulsepvt/model2,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model [Ferropulsepvt/model2](https://huggingface.co/Ferropulsepvt/model2) was converted to MLX format from [mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) using mlx-lm version **0.24.1**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
stellali0115/Mistral-7B-v0.1-Q4_K_M-GGUF,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1`](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Saiteja23/smollm2-135m-fineweb-edu2.7BT,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This is a 135M parameter language model based on the SmolLM2 architecture, trained on FineWeb-edu data.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mii-llm/zagreus-0.4B-por,15,2,apache-2.0,,,false,**Zagreus-0.4B-por** is a bilingual English/Portuguese foundational Small Language Model (SLM) trained **from scratch** by the [mii-llm](https://mii-llm.ai) community (*Made in Italy – Large Language Model*) on the [Seeweb](https://www.seeweb.it) HPC infrastructure.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
alexandersdata/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Thinking-mlx-8Bit,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [ssdataanalysis/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Thinking-mlx-8Bit](https://huggingface.co/ssdataanalysis/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Thinking-mlx-8Bit) was converted to MLX format from [dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Thinking](https://huggingface.co/dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Thinking) using mlx-lm version **0.29.1**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SandLogicTechnologies/Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1-GGUF,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 is a pretrained large language model developed by Mistral AI that uses a sparse Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) architecture to deliver strong performance while maintaining efficient inference.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-1e22-9.7Bparams-160Btokens-seed42,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 9.7B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 1 × 10²² FLOPs on 160B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-2e20-2.5Bparams-11.2Btokens,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 2.5B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 2 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 11.2B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-2e20-447Mparams-73.4Btokens,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 447M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 2 × 10²⁰ FLOPs on 73.4B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-9e18-273Mparams-6.7Btokens,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 273M-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 9 × 10¹⁸ FLOPs on 6.7B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
marin-community/delphi-9e19-3.4Bparams-4.2Btokens,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 3.4B-parameter base model from the **Delphi** scaling suite. Trained at 9 × 10¹⁹ FLOPs on 4.2B tokens with the Delphi recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
