bayartsogt/wav2vec2-base-mn-pretrain-42h,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Authors: Alexei Baevski, Henry Zhou, Abdelrahman Mohamed, Michael Auli",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Siddharth63/medul2-base,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,**PubMedUL2** and **MedUL2** are a family of **domain-specific UL2/T5-style encoder–decoder language models** pretrained on large-scale biomedical and medical corpora using the **UL2 (Mixture-of-Denoisers)** objective.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
claudios/cubert-20210711-Python-1024,15,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"This model is the unofficial HuggingFace version of ""[CuBERT](https://github.com/google-research/google-research/tree/master/cubert)"". In particular, this version comes from [gs://cubert/20210711_Python/pre_trained_model_epochs_2__length_1024](https://console.cloud.google.com/storage/browser/cubert/20210711_Python/pre_trained_model_epochs_2__length_1024). It was trained 2021-07-11 for 2 epochs with a 1024 token context window on the Python BigQuery dataset. I manually converted the Tensorflow checkpoint to PyTorch and have uploaded it here. The [tokenizer](https://github.com/google-research/google-research/blob/master/cubert/python_tokenizer.py) has not been converted yet. All credit goes to Aditya Kanade, Petros Maniatis, Gogul Balakrishnan, and Kensen Shi.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
facebook/hiera-small-224-mae-hf,15,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"**Hiera** is a _hierarchical_ vision transformer that is fast, powerful, and, above all, _simple_. It was introduced in the paper [Hiera: A Hierarchical Vision Transformer without the Bells-and-Whistles](https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.00989/) and outperforms the state-of-the-art across a wide array of image and video tasks _while being much faster_.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
GetmanY1/wav2vec2-large-fi-lp-cont-pt,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The large model pre-trained on 16kHz sampled speech audio with [facebook/wav2vec2-large-uralic-voxpopuli-v2](https://huggingface.co/facebook/wav2vec2-large-uralic-voxpopuli-v2) used as a foundation model for continued pre-training. When using the model make sure that your speech input is also sampled at 16Khz.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
EleutherAI/deep-ignorance-e2e-extra-weak-filter,15,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"We explore an intuitive yet understudied question: Can we prevent LLMs from learning unsafe technical capabilities (such as CBRN) by filtering out enough of the relevant pretraining data before we begin training a model? Research into this question resulted in the **Deep Ignorance Suite**. In our experimental setup, we find that filtering pretraining data prevents undesirable knowledge, doesn't sacrifice general performance, and results in models that are resistant to tampering.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
EleutherAI/deep-ignorance-pretraining-stage-extra-weak-filter,15,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"We explore an intuitive yet understudied question: Can we prevent LLMs from learning unsafe technical capabilities (such as CBRN) by filtering out enough of the relevant pretraining data before we begin training a model? Research into this question resulted in the **Deep Ignorance Suite**. In our experimental setup, we find that filtering pretraining data prevents undesirable knowledge, doesn't sacrifice general performance, and results in models that are resistant to tampering.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kavinrajkrupsurge/minivla-vq-bridge-prismatic,15,0,mit,,,false,"<b>This checkpoint is in a format that is compatible with the training script from the original [Prismatic VLMs project codebase](https://github.com/TRI-ML/prismatic-vlms), which the OpenVLA team built on top of to develop the OpenVLA model.</b>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
stellaathena/qwen3-0.6b-sweep-ot0.25-psn32,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A 751M-parameter Qwen3-0.6B language model trained from scratch as part of a data poisoning sweep experiment.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
stellaathena/qwen3-0.6b-sweep-ot4.0-psn100,15,1,apache-2.0,,,false,A 751M-parameter Qwen3-0.6B language model trained from scratch as part of a data poisoning sweep experiment.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
atrost/climbmix-matformer-353m-1p2b-h100-m-vllm,15,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,Native `LlamaForCausalLM` conversion of `atrost/climbmix-matformer-353m-1p2b-h100-m`.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
onnx-community/mms-300m-ONNX,15,2,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,This is an ONNX version of [facebook/mms-300m](https://huggingface.co/facebook/mms-300m). It was automatically converted and uploaded using [this Hugging Face Space](https://huggingface.co/spaces/onnx-community/convert-to-onnx).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
oddadmix/Emhotob-25M,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Emhotob** is a family of small Arabic language models pretrained **from scratch** on Arabic web text. This is the **25M** rung of the ladder (~25.27M parameters), part of a scaling series ranging from 500K to 25M parameters that all share the same tokenizer, context length, and training recipe.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
laion/open-sci-ref-1.7b-nemotron-hq-100B-4096-longsft_16k,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,16k long-context extension of `laion/open-sci-ref-v0.02-1.7b-nemotron-hq-100B-4096`. Final train loss **0.9778**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
JupiterZhu/T2MLR_135M_lstart13_lend18_10B_FineWebEdu,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**T2MLR** (Transformer with Temporal Middle-Layer Recurrence) applies a recurrent connection across a contiguous band of middle layers, carrying a recurrent state between token positions. This checkpoint is a 135M model pretrained **from scratch** on FineWeb-Edu for **~10B tokens**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
The-CoLab/llama3-7b-en-ru-v4,15,0,llama3,,,false,"LLaMA-3 7B pretrained on English-Russian bilingual data, 133,600 total steps (v4 run). Uses a shared 65k English-Russian tokenizer (`65k_en1.0_ru1.0`).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
a-yakovenko/FreeFlow-M-pretrain,15,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,"**Cross-view pretraining · 89,615,040 parameters**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
itarutomy/llm_workshop_hands_on_gpt-model,15,0,mit,,,false,本モデルはチュートリアル「[Let's develop LLMs from scratch](https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1g-KjfRWoR4OehKr8FY5MSuFO2etCUf1L)」から学習した小型GPTモデルです。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jasonacox/nanochat-560M-pretrain,15,0,mit,,,false,Base pretrained model on FineWeb-EDU dataset. This model has learned basic language patterns but hasn't been trained for conversation.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
yashshinde0080/zeronet-1-28M,15,1,mit,,,false,"A **28 million parameter** decoder-only causal Transformer language model **built entirely from scratch** — no pretrained weights, no fine-tuned checkpoints, no API wrappers.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/legal-slm-1m,15,0,mit,,,false,A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~33.9M params) trained from scratch on Legal domain data. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SykoSLM/SykoLLM-V4.8-Beta,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> **⚠️ Uyarı / Disclaimer:** Bu model şu anda aktif bir **test ve araştırma aşamasındadır**. Temel amacı, yeni nesil **Phi-3** mimarisinin yeteneklerini sıfırdan eğitilmiş (trained from scratch) bir yapıyla küçük ölçekte test etmektir. Üretime (production) hazır bir model değildir; halüsinasyon görebilir, mantıksal hatalar yapabilir veya beklenmedik yanıtlar verebilir.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/hr-manager-slm-1m,15,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~989.3M params, ~0.99B) trained from scratch for the **HR Manager** role. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/database-admin-slm-5m,15,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~1007.5M params, ~1.01B) trained from scratch for the **Database Admin** role. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/education-slm-5m,15,0,mit,,,false,A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~33.9M params) trained from scratch on Education domain data. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/hr-manager-slm-5m,15,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~989.3M params, ~0.99B) trained from scratch for the **HR Manager** role. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
FiShota/hinomoto-100m-v4,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,> 個人 GPU + アイディア + 実装速度で、世界水準の研究所と同じ土俵に踏み込む実験,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Ethangou/attention-residuals-0.6B-full,15,0,mit,,,false,"This is the 0.6B Full Attention Residuals checkpoint for the attention-residuals-reproduction project. It uses a Qwen3-style decoder-only Transformer with full Attention Residuals, trained from scratch on Chinese data.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
vukrosic/nano-g2p,15,1,mit,,,false,"Spells out how a word is pronounced — `though` → `DH OW`, `tough` → `T AH F`, `through` → `TH R UW`, `cough` → `K AA F`. English spelling is famously **not phonetic** (`though`/`tough`/`through`/`cough`/`rough`/`bough` — six different sounds from `-ough`), so no rule does this; pronunciation lives only in a learned lexicon. A **~1M-parameter (1,016,960) byte-level transformer** that learns grapheme→phoneme patterns and generalises to words it never saw.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
emrevrg/Norovox-Alpha,15,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"Norovox Alpha, random-init ile eğitilmiş özgün `NorovoxAlphaCore` mimarisine ve kendi 32k BPE tokenizer'ına sahip deneysel bir Türkçe yapay zekâ çekirdeğidir. Qwen/Llama sınıfı veya başka bir modelin ağırlık kopyası değildir. Güncel kanonik SFT checkpoint'i **151.641.856 parametre** ve **step 67.740** düzeyindedir.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sahuabinash/slm-125m-base,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 125.8M-parameter LLaMA-architecture causal language model, pretrained from scratch on a legal/financial/general-web corpus.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
weights-and-wires/audio8-tts-from-scratch,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **DualAR text-to-speech language model trained from scratch** on 440 clips (72.6 minutes) of LibriSpeech `clean/train.100`, 4 speaker(s).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
christianrss/chris-gpt-2-124m-GGUF,15,0,mit,,,false,"GGUF export of **Chris-GPT-2 124M**, a GPT-2-style causal language model trained from scratch on approximately **10 billion tokens from FineWeb-Edu**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Magurofg/pocket-lm-269m-executor,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Pré-treino **do zero** (286M efetivos, 12h de H100, 7,0 bi de tokens) com a fase de decay dominada por **ações de celular** (intenção + campos estruturados). Nome interno `full-executor-v1`.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MenteEAI/mentee-embed-v3,15,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"**A 41M-parameter trilingual text embedding model trained entirely from scratch — no pretrained backbone, no BERT, no RoBERTa. Random initialization only.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ryze-ai/flash-archer-150M-2.0,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A clean, decoder-only transformer language model trained **from scratch** on **FineWeb-Edu** — 150M parameters, ~2.1B tokens, on a single Tesla T4 in ~7 hours. Built as a self-contained, reproducible pretraining project: custom byte-level BPE tokenizer, streaming data pipeline, cosine LR schedule with warmup, and a hand-written PyTorch training loop.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
navyam-ai/navya-1c,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Navya** is an India-first financial foundation model family, trained **from scratch** on an India-first corpus (finance + English + Hindi/Hinglish and other Indian languages), custom 64k tokenizer.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
hiianish/mini-gpt2_decoder,15,0,mit,,,false,"A small GPT-style decoder-only transformer, trained from scratch.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
strifero/elroy-350m-chat,15,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"elroy-350m-chat is a 361M-parameter Llama-style decoder trained from scratch on about 20B tokens of educational Python and English by Strife Technologies, as a fully documented teaching project. Every line of the tokenizer, model, training loop and fine-tuning code is in the repository, with a chapter explaining it:",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mach-kernel/ecu-pilot-mlx-q4,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model [mach-kernel/ecu-pilot-mlx-q4](https://huggingface.co/mach-kernel/ecu-pilot-mlx-q4) was converted to MLX format from [mach-kernel/ecu-pilot-fp16](https://huggingface.co/mach-kernel/ecu-pilot-fp16) using mlx-lm version **0.31.1**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mach-kernel/ecu-pilot-mlx-q4-mix34-g32,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model [mach-kernel/ecu-pilot-mlx-q4-mix34-g32](https://huggingface.co/mach-kernel/ecu-pilot-mlx-q4-mix34-g32) was converted to MLX format from [mach-kernel/ecu-pilot-fp16](https://huggingface.co/mach-kernel/ecu-pilot-fp16) using mlx-lm version **0.31.1**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
bugrayildirim/story-to-music-analyzer,14,0,mit,,,false,"`google/mt5-small`'un Türkçe metinleri **Suno** ve **Udio** için müzik parametrelerine çeviren fine-tuned versiyonu. [Story-to-Music MCP](https://github.com/sbugrayy/story-to-music) projesinin ""Analyzer"" bileşeni.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ajesujoba/AfriHuBERT-large,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This is a 300M+ parameter multilingual self-supervised speech encoder based on the English HuBERT-L model, facebook/hubert-large-ll60k. We performed continued pretraining through multilingual adaptive finetuning (MAFT) on over 10,000 hours of African language data aggregated from various sources.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Undi95/Mistral-11B-RP-v1,14,1,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"This is Mistral, but in 11B, and finetuned with qlora of Pippa and LimaRPv3 dataset.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
LoneStriker/Mistral-11B-CC-Air-RP-4.0bpw-h6-exl2,14,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,CollectiveCognition-v1.1-Mistral-7B and airoboros-mistral2.2-7b glued together and finetuned with qlora of Pippa and LimaRPv3 dataset.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
