RiversHaveWings/Mistral-7B-v0.1-safetensors,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
joaovitor2763/mistral-sdr-model,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
pblair-basis/Mistral-7B-v0.1,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**NOTE**: This is a fork of [Mistral-7B-v0.1](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) intended to have a non-null pad token. This has been done in order to facilitate usage of this model with off-the-shelf PEFT tuners, such as what is offered by Google Cloud Vertex AI.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
