RaphaelMourad/Mistral-Chem-v1-417M,14,3,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-Chem-v1-417M Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative chemical molecule model with 417M parameters. It is derived from Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for molecules: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 10M molecule SMILES strings from the PubChem database.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
