JupiterZhu/T2MLR_362M_lstart9_lend24_50B_FineWebEdu,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**T2MLR** (Transformer with Temporal Middle-Layer Recurrence) applies a recurrent connection across a contiguous band of middle layers, carrying a recurrent state between token positions. This checkpoint is a 362M model pretrained **from scratch** on FineWeb-Edu for **~51.5B tokens**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
