jasonacox/jason-nanochat-560M-midtrain,14,0,mit,,,false,Midtrained model fine-tuned for conversational interactions. Trained on SmolTalk dataset with special tokens for multi-turn conversations. Added identity conditioning with persona data from jasonacox.com blog posts.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
hranjan043/simbot-gpt-level1,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"SimBot GPT is a **from-scratch GPT-style language model** implemented in **PyTorch**. This project is focused on **learning LLM internals**, not on instruction tuning or production use.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/uiux-designer-slm-1m,14,1,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~989.3M params, ~0.99B) trained from scratch for the **UI/UX Designer** role. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/customer-support-slm-1m,14,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~989.0M params, ~0.99B) trained from scratch for the **Customer Support** role. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AbstractPhil/geolip-vit-base-x3,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This wasn't meant to be seen by others, but it's too damn messy so there you go. I can't keep rewriting the same explanations over and over to justify the empirical data here.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
shreyask/fineweb-gpt-scratch,14,0,mit,,,false,"A GPT-style language model trained completely from scratch as a learning exercise. Every component was written from scratch: BPE tokenizer, transformer architecture, and training loop.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
way2hemanthkumar/indian-slm-hindi-30m,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A LLaMA-style decoder-only language model trained from scratch on Hindi text.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MonumentalSystems/wire-2m-multidomain,14,0,mit,,,false,WireNative 2M — multi-domain training (philosophy + code + science),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
saiteja718/gpt-2,14,0,mit,,,false,"A GPT-2–style causal language model built and trained **entirely from scratch** in PyTorch — no pre-trained weights, no HuggingFace Trainer. Every component (multi-head attention with KV-cache, transformer blocks, weight-tying) was implemented by hand.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Sqersters/vuaf-1-femto,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> ⚠️ **Experimental research checkpoint — under active development.** > This model is a small from-scratch architecture exploration. Outputs > may be incoherent, biased, or wrong. Do **not** use it for anything > serious. Treat every release as a snapshot of work in progress.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jokernifty/Krix1-0.2b,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A ~122M-parameter (≈0.2B) **Llama-style decoder, pretrained from scratch** on Hindi text. Every weight was trained from random initialization — this is not a fine-tune of an existing model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
danelcsb/localagent-tiny-30m-byte,14,0,mit,,,false,"A **28M-parameter, pretrained-from-scratch, byte-level** agent for tool dispatch. Selection is **generable** (no fixed-N classifier): a 5-way **route head** gates modality, a **dense two-tower selector** scores *any* tool by its description embedding, and a **pointer head** copies argument values from the prompt. 50-tool surface. Trained on a corrected, paraphrase-rich + referent- conditioned dataset ([danelcsb/localagent-dispatch-data](https://huggingface.co/datasets/danelcsb/localagent-dispatch-data)).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Rohanify/PyBlissa-Coder-40M-GGUF,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"PyBlissa-Coder-40M is the second model from the PyBlissa-Coder family that mainly supports python coding. Despite its small footprint, 40M parameters, trained on 272M tokens, PyBlissa has achieved an amazing score of 14.6% on the HumanEval dataset; and 4.4% on MBPP dataset (both being benchmark datasets). While scoring such a good number, it's imperfections are also something to be aware of. This model can sometimes generate wrong, inefficient, or broken codes. Though its mostly temperature-dependent.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tonibirat/neBrahma-base-58m,14,0,mit,,,false,A 58M-parameter Nepali decoder-only language model trained **from scratch** on 1.16B tokens of Nepali text. This is the P3 base model for the neBrahma FYP project - a unified Nepali text+audio system targeting ASR and TTS.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
helloadhavan/llara2-100M-base,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,license: apache-2.0 datasets: - wikimedia/structured-wikipedia - helloadhavan/github_issues - helloadhavan/python-docstrings language: - en tags: - from-scratch - gpt2,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Batman55072/NanoChat-28M-V1,14,0,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"A ~27.8M parameter GPT-style decoder-only transformer, trained fully from scratch, that generates simulated live-stream chat comments -- both regular fast-paced ""hype chat"" and rarer, longer ""superchat""-style paid messages/questions. Built to run fast on CPU, as a lightweight audience-simulation layer for AI VTuber / livestream projects.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
shreyash-pandey-katni/phoenix-350m-base,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **350M-parameter decoder-only language model trained from scratch** on **~10B tokens** of [FineWeb-Edu](https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-edu), on a single consumer GPU (RTX 3080 Ti, 12 GB). Released as a **base model** (no instruction tuning).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
pranay-aggarwal/mcq-scratch-lstm-transformer,14,0,mit,,,false,A custom multiple-choice QA model built from scratch (no pretrained backbone) for the Smart MCQ Solver Challenge on Kaggle.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
pngwn/memcap-m-near-capacity,14,0,mit,,,false,"Part of a tiny-scale reproduction of **[How much do language models memorize?](https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.24832)** (Morris et al., ICML 2026 honorable mention): GPT-style models trained from scratch on uniformly random token sequences, where generalization is impossible and every bit of loss reduction is memorization.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Atharva1232/Qwen3-0.6B-GRPO-GSM8K,14,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"A Qwen3-0.6B base model that learned to solve grade-school math word problems — **without ever being shown a single worked solution.** Trained with GRPO (Group Relative Policy Optimization) written from scratch in ~150 lines of plain PyTorch, no TRL, on one free Kaggle T4 in 3.2 hours.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
qihoo360/360Zhinao2-7B-Chat-4K-Int4,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div align=""center""> <h1> 360Zhinao2 (360智脑) </h1> </div> <div align=""center""> 🤗 <a href=""https://huggingface.co/qihoo360"">HuggingFace</a>&nbsp&nbsp | &nbsp&nbsp 🤖 <a href=""https://modelscope.cn/organization/360zhinao"">ModelScope</a>&nbsp&nbsp ｜ &nbsp&nbsp 💬 <a href=""./assets/WeChat.png"">WeChat (微信)</a>&nbsp&nbsp ｜ &nbsp&nbsp <a href=""https://github.com/Qihoo360/360zhiano2"">GitHub</a>&nbsp&nbsp </div> <br> <p align=""center""> Feel free to visit 360Zhinao's official website<a href=""https://ai.360.com""> https://ai.360.com</a> for more experience. </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
360ZhiNao/360Zhinao2-7B-Chat-4K,14,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div align=""center""> <h1> 360Zhinao2 (360智脑) </h1> </div> <div align=""center""> 🤗 <a href=""https://huggingface.co/qihoo360"">HuggingFace</a>&nbsp&nbsp | &nbsp&nbsp 🤖 <a href=""https://modelscope.cn/organization/360zhinao"">ModelScope</a>&nbsp&nbsp ｜ &nbsp&nbsp 💬 <a href=""./assets/WeChat.png"">WeChat (微信)</a>&nbsp&nbsp ｜ &nbsp&nbsp <a href=""https://github.com/Qihoo360/360zhiano2"">GitHub</a>&nbsp&nbsp </div> <br> <p align=""center""> Feel free to visit 360Zhinao's official website<a href=""https://ai.360.com""> https://ai.360.com</a> for more experience. </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
santoshdahal/Mistral-7B-v0.1,13,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ExAi/Claire-Mistral-7B-v0.1.3-exl2-3.0,13,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,**Claire-Mistral-7B-0.1 is a 7B parameter causal decoder-only model built by [LINAGORA](https://labs.linagora.com/) and [OpenLLM-France](https://github.com/OpenLLM-France)** **adapted from [Mistral-7B](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) on French conversational data.**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jesusoctavioas/wikisql-4bit-1k,13,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to MLX format from [`mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1`]() using mlx-lm version **0.6.0**. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
n0w0f/MatText-cifsymmetrized-2m,13,0,mit,,,false,Model Pretrained using Masked Language Modelling on 2 million crystal structures in one of the **MatText** Representation,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
n0w0f/MatText-crystal-txt-llm-2m,13,0,mit,,,false,Model Pretrained using Masked Language Modelling on 2 million crystal structures in one of the **MatText** Representation,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RaphaelMourad/Mistral-Codon-v1-117M,13,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-Codon-v1-117M Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA sequence model with 117M parameters. It is derived from Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 24M coding DNA sequences (3000bp) from many different species (vertebrates, plants, bacteria, viruses, ...).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ash-riple/Qwen2-0.5B-Q4_0-GGUF,13,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`Qwen/Qwen2-0.5B`](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-0.5B) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-0.5B) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
