fav-kky/wav2vec2-base-de-50k,13,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,This is a monolingual German Wav2Vec 2.0 base model pre-trained from 50 thousand hours of German speech. It has been released along with a paper **A Comparative Analysis of Bilingual and Trilingual Wav2Vec Models for Automatic Speech Recognition in Multilingual Oral History Archives** accepted to INTERSPEECH2024 conference.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
