nazdef/gpt2medium-en-it-nanochat-gpt2preln-decay13500-step14700,13,0,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"This repository publishes the requested **ordinary checkpoint release** for `step_14700`, the current **best practical / release-style candidate** inside the replayed medium GPT2PreLN `13.5k` decay family.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
whilework/rubert-tiny2,13,0,mit,,,false,This is an updated version of [cointegrated/rubert-tiny](https://huggingface.co/cointegrated/rubert-tiny): a small Russian BERT-based encoder with high-quality sentence embeddings. This [post in Russian](https://habr.com/ru/post/669674/) gives more details.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
oddadmix/Emhotob-1M,13,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Emhotob** is a family of small Arabic language models pretrained **from scratch** on Arabic web text. This is the **1M** rung of the ladder (~1.07M parameters), part of a scaling series ranging from 500K to 25M parameters that all share the same tokenizer, context length, and training recipe.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
oddadmix/Emhotob-500K-v2,13,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Emhotob** is a family of small Arabic language models pretrained **from scratch** on Arabic web text. This is the **500K** rung of the ladder (~518K parameters), part of a scaling series ranging from 500K to 25M parameters that all share the same tokenizer, context length, and training recipe. This is the **v2** run: trained from scratch on ~5B tokens per model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
oddadmix/Emhotob-10M-v2,13,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Emhotob** is a family of small Arabic language models pretrained **from scratch** on Arabic web text. This is the **10M** rung of the ladder (~10.95M parameters), part of a scaling series ranging from 500K to 25M parameters that all share the same tokenizer, context length, and training recipe. This is the **v2** run: trained from scratch on ~5B tokens per model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
joey00072/ohara-moe-base-d12,13,0,mit,,,false,"The **pretrained mixture-of-experts base model** from a nanochat-style run with [ohara](https://github.com/joey00072/ohara). 332M total parameters, 85M active per token, trained from scratch on 1.48B tokens of ClimbMix on 2xA100-80GB in 2.35 hours.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
