Morton-Li/QiDeBERTa-base,12,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Model Name**: `QiDeBERTa-base` **Language**: Chinese **Architecture**: DeBERTa V3 (modified) **Author**: Morton Li **License**: Apache-2.0 **Tags**: `deberta`, `mlm`, `chinese`, `language-modeling`, `robustness`, `general-purpose`, `pretraining`, `masked-language-modeling`",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tt1225/openvla-7b-devel,12,0,mit,,,false,"OpenVLA 7B (`openvla-7b`) is an open vision-language-action model trained on 970K robot manipulation episodes from the [Open X-Embodiment](https://robotics-transformer-x.github.io/) dataset. The model takes language instructions and camera images as input and generates robot actions. It supports controlling multiple robots out-of-the-box, and can be quickly adapted for new robot domains via (parameter-efficient) fine-tuning.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
rocky1410/haipai-micro,12,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Haipai-micro** is a ""Micro-LLM"" designed to test the limits of parameter efficiency. Despite having only **55 Million parameters** (roughly 1/2 the size of GPT-2 Small), it achieves surprising performance on common sense and reasoning benchmarks by utilizing a high-density dataset mix.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
