11-47/FrontD.11m,12,0,mit,,,false,FrontD.11m is an approximately 11-million-parameter decoder-only language model trained completely from scratch.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cooler8/yejin-korean-3b-v1-base,12,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> **yejin-korean-3b-v1**은 8x NVIDIA H200 (1,128GB VRAM) 환경에서 한국어 고품질 코퍼스(172GB+ 및 AI Hub)로 100% From-Scratch 사전학습 및 8x H200 GPU Full SFT를 적용한 한국어 파운데이션 모델입니다.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Finisha-LLM/Limy-basique,12,1,mit,,,false,"`Limy-basique` est un modèle de classification de texte conçu pour différencier les questions sur les capitales de celles sur les animaux. Entraîné sur le jeu de données `Clem27sey/Nacid`, ce modèle a été entièrement construit **`from scratch`** par Clemylia. Il est idéal pour les tâches de classification binaire et peut être utilisé en tant que base pour des projets similaires.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
likhonsheikh/Sheikh-ABF,12,0,mit,,,false,"**Sheikh-ABF** is a state-of-the-art, **decoder-only Transformer language model for Bangla NLP**, developed entirely **from scratch**. This project emphasizes a **Bangla-first approach**, focusing on the unique linguistic and cultural aspects of the Bengali language. The name 'Sheikh' explicitly refers to its origin as a model developed in **Bangladesh**, aiming to provide a foundational LLM for the region.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
surazbhandari/miniembed,12,2,mit,,,false,"**MiniEmbed** is an ultra-compact text embedding model (Bi-Encoder) built entirely from scratch in PyTorch. No HuggingFace Transformers, no pre-trained weights -- just pure PyTorch.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Entity-27th/opus-1.5-Q4_K_M-GGUF,12,0,mit,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`opus-research/opus-1.5`](https://huggingface.co/opus-research/opus-1.5) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/opus-research/opus-1.5) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nishantup/nanogpt-slm-124m,12,0,mit,,,false,A small language model trained **from scratch** using a custom nanoGPT implementation. Pretrained on 133 classic English fiction novels from Project Gutenberg.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/financial-analyst-slm-5m,12,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~989.0M params, ~0.99B) trained from scratch for the **Financial Analyst** role. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/system-admin-slm-5m,12,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~1016.6M params, ~1.02B) trained from scratch for the **System Admin** role. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
