muteptr/skyai-modern-xs,12,0,mit,,,false,"A from-scratch modern decoder LM (~152M parameters) trained on 10B FineWeb-Edu tokens, built as the third rung of a controlled architecture comparison. Every layer, the optimizer, and the training harness are hand-written — nothing is imported from an existing model implementation.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
BuildITSystems/phishing-detector-encoder,12,0,mit,,,false,"> **No external pretrained weights were used.** The encoder, the tokenizer and every parameter in `model.safetensors` > were trained from random initialisation inside this project, in plain PyTorch, without the `transformers` > library. The only external inputs are the public email corpora listed below. > Initialisation of this checkpoint: `pretrained:/home/nathank/BITS/dev/Phishing Model/checkpoints/pretrain/large-24L/final`.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
