RaphaelMourad/Mistral-Peptide-v1-134M,11,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-Peptide-v1-134M Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative peptide molecule model with 134M parameters. It is derived from Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for protein: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 863499 peptide strings.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
