dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-1.7B-Thinking-W4A16,11,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Dicta-LM 3.0 is a powerful open-weight collection of LLMs, trained on extensive corpora of Hebrew and English texts. The models are available for download and for unlimited use. The models set a new SOTA for their weight-class for Hebrew, both as base models and chat models.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
VRDate/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Thinking-FP8-Q4_K_S-GGUF,11,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Thinking-FP8`](https://huggingface.co/dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Thinking-FP8) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Thinking-FP8) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
