shreyash-pandey-katni/phoenix-125m,11,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 125 M parameter decoder-only language model pretrained **from scratch** on an English corpus (~2 B tokens). Built with a LLaMA-style architecture (RoPE, SwiGLU, RMSNorm, pre-norm) and trained on a single NVIDIA RTX 3080 Ti.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
