alpharomercoma/vqwen-qformer-pretrain,11,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> **Foundation checkpoint — not a deployable chat model.** Only the Linear > projector has been trained. Use this as the starting point for stage-2 > instruction tuning. For ready-to-use TikTok sludge classifiers built on top of > this foundation, see: > - [`alpharomercoma/vqwen-qformer-tiktok-v2`](https://huggingface.co/alpharomercoma/vqwen-qformer-tiktok-v2) — current tri-modal model (vision + audio transcript), 99.04 % accuracy. > - [`alpharomercoma/vqwen-qformer-tiktok`](https://huggingface.co/alpharomercoma/vqwen-qformer-tiktok) — vision-only ablation baseline, 89.00 % accuracy.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
