AlexWortega/moe-200m-qwen3-step70000-2B-20260520-1912,11,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Intermediate checkpoint from the in-flight `moe-200m-qwen3-100b` pretrain run, captured at **step 70 000 ≈ 2.4 B tokens consumed** (2.4 % of the 100B-token budget). Trained autonomously by the [ml-intern Claude Code skill](https://github.com/AlexWortega/claude-ml-intern-skill) on 2× Tesla V100-SXM2 32 GB.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
