oddadmix/Emhotob-500K,11,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Emhotob** is a family of small Arabic language models pretrained **from scratch** on Arabic web text. This is the **500K** rung of the ladder (~518K parameters), part of a scaling series ranging from 500K to 25M parameters that all share the same tokenizer, context length, and training recipe.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
