JupiterZhu/T2MLR_362M_lstart9_lend24_10B_FineWebEdu,11,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**T2MLR** (Transformer with Temporal Middle-Layer Recurrence) applies a recurrent connection across a contiguous band of middle layers, carrying a recurrent state between token positions. This checkpoint is a 362M model pretrained **from scratch** on FineWeb-Edu for **~10B tokens**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
scottgeng00/qwen3-0.6b-dclm-20b,11,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 0.6B-parameter (595.8M, tied embeddings) model with the Qwen3-0.6B architecture and tokenizer, pretrained from random initialization on ~20.0B tokens of DCLM (the `dclm` source of the OLMo 2 Dolmino mix) with [lingua](https://github.com/facebookresearch/lingua). This is a research baseline, not an instruction-tuned model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
