sathishphdai/software-engineer-slm-1m,11,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~989.9M params, ~0.99B) trained from scratch for the **Software Engineer** role. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/product-manager-slm-1m,11,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~989.1M params, ~0.99B) trained from scratch for the **Product Manager** role. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
