vivekkopthsd/vivek0-ml,11,0,mit,,,false,"A 1.3MB transformer trained from scratch on the SRE Book then continue-trained on ML/stats/probability books (Think Bayes, Nielsen NN&DL, MML). Per-domain held-out: Think Bayes 6.16, Nielsen 7.62, MML 6.36, SRE 7.52 (no forgetting).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
