tekiny/Mistral-7B-v0.1-Q4_K_M-GGUF,10,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This model was converted to GGUF format from [`mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1`](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) for more details on the model. Install llama.cpp through brew. ```bash brew install ggerganov/ggerganov/llama.cpp ``` Invoke the llama.cpp server or the CLI. CLI: ```bash llama-cli --hf-repo tekiny/Mistral-7B-v0.1-Q4_K_M-GGUF --model mistral-7b-v0.1-q4_k_m.gguf -p ""The meaning to life and the universe is"" ``` Server: ```bash llama-server --hf-repo tekiny/Mistral-7B-v0.1-Q4_K_M-GGUF --model mistral-7b-v0.1-q4_k_m.gguf -c 2048 ``` Note: You can also use this checkpoint directly",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RaphaelMourad/Mistral-Peptide-v1-422M,10,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"The Mistral-Peptide-v1-422M Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative peptide molecule model with 422M parameters. It is derived from Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for protein: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 863499 peptide strings.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
bmac8282/Mistral-7B-v0.1-Q4_K_M-GGUF,10,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1`](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
