dragonSwing/viwav2vec2-base-3k,10,3,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"The base model is pre-trained on 16kHz sampled speech audio from Vietnamese speech corpus containing 3K hours of spontaneous, reading, and broadcasting speech. When using the model make sure that your speech input is also sampled at 16Khz. Note that this model should be fine-tuned on a downstream task, like Vietnamese Automatic Speech Recognition.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
