MihaBEST/rubert-tiny2,10,0,mit,,,false,This is an updated version of [cointegrated/rubert-tiny](https://huggingface.co/cointegrated/rubert-tiny): a small Russian BERT-based encoder with high-quality sentence embeddings. This [post in Russian](https://habr.com/ru/post/669674/) gives more details.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
weyj4/my-gpt2-163m,10,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"GPT-2 style autoregressive language model (163M parameters) trained from scratch on FineWeb. Built as a learning project following Raschka's *Build an LLM from Scratch*, with a custom Flash Attention implementation and mmap data pipeline.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
