ns20001/colqwen2-v1.0-hf,10,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> [!IMPORTANT] > This version of ColQwen2 should be loaded with the `transformers 🤗` release, not with `colpali-engine`. > It was converted using the `convert_colqwen2_weights_to_hf.py` script > from the [`vidore/colqwen2-v1.0-merged`](https://huggingface.co/vidore/colqwen2-v1.0-merged) checkpoint.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AlexWortega/ml-intern-moe100m-ufweb-en-step66035-10B-20260517-1222,10,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This is an **intermediate checkpoint** from a 100B-token continuation pretrain of the [`ml-intern-moe100m-ufweb-en-1B`](https://huggingface.co/AlexWortega/ml-intern-moe100m-ufweb-en-1B-20260515-0823) model. The full run is targeted at 100B tokens (12-day wall on 4× V100 SXM2); this snapshot is at step 66 035 (≈ 10.82 B tokens consumed total counting the 1B and 10B warm-start phases).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ciccio42/openvla-7b,10,0,mit,,,false,"OpenVLA 7B (`openvla-7b`) is an open vision-language-action model trained on 970K robot manipulation episodes from the [Open X-Embodiment](https://robotics-transformer-x.github.io/) dataset. The model takes language instructions and camera images as input and generates robot actions. It supports controlling multiple robots out-of-the-box, and can be quickly adapted for new robot domains via (parameter-efficient) fine-tuning.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
castorini/gaggle-nanochat-pretrained-climbmix-bidirectional-20260929,10,2,mit,,,false,"The bidirectional variant of [`castorini/gaggle-nanochat-pretrained-climbmix-20260924`](https://huggingface.co/castorini/gaggle-nanochat-pretrained-climbmix-20260924), described in the pre-training section of ([PDF](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.11922)). Our GPU budget did not allow a second pre-training run, so we obtained it by converting the causal model, following LLM2Vec: starting from the causal checkpoint at 245B tokens, we trained it on the remaining 42B tokens of the corpus with bidirectional attention and masked next-token prediction (MNTP). It is a base model; no instruction or embedding tuning has been applied.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
