BytesTalk/PersonaMini-1-big,10,0,mit,,,false,"A from-scratch roleplay language model by **BytesTalk**. Not a fine-tune of anything — every weight was trained from random initialization on a GPU (GeForce RTX 4090, 24 GB). This is the third and largest model in the PersonaMini-1 family, after the 28.8M **small** and the 63.2M **medium**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
