dalek-ai/baseline-v1-desc-hybrid-multilingual,9,0,mit,,,false,"Same hybrid pipeline as [`baseline-v1-desc-hybrid`](https://huggingface.co/dalek-ai/baseline-v1-desc-hybrid), but the encoder is `sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2` (117M params, 50+ languages). ~80 MB of centroids on disk. Built for agents that receive tasks in French or any of the 50+ languages supported by the encoder.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
