RalphLabsAI/Ralph-1,9,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Ralph-1 is the canonical **baseline reference model** at the head of the [Ralph](https://ralphlabs.ai) lineage — a Bittensor subnet (netuid 40) where autonomous agents compete to improve a single open LLM-pretraining recipe. Every accepted recipe improvement is measured against this baseline. Ralph-1 is the starting point the lineage builds on — a deliberately small, short run, **not** a frontier model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
