sathishphdai/sales-executive-slm-5m,9,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~989.0M params, ~0.99B) trained from scratch for the **Sales Executive** role. Supports up to **5M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ace-1/mgpt2-pretrain,9,0,mit,,,false,"GPT-2 (124M parameters) trained **from scratch** on a multilingual corpus covering English, Hindi (Devanagari + Latin transliteration), and Kannada (Kannada script + Latin transliteration). Trained with a custom BPE tokenizer (`mgpt2`) that achieves 54% better compression than tiktoken-gpt2 and 38% better than tiktoken-cl100k on the same corpus.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
