Jaydd88/Mistral-7B-v0.1,8,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
k-fold-structure/triprorep-650M,8,0,mit,,,false,"Structure-aware protein encoder, 650M parameters. ELECTRA-style corrective MLM pre-training on protein structures. The encoder reads three per-residue token streams (seq / bb / fa) and outputs a per-residue embedding of dimension `1280` (fp16).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
syntropic-clx/Clyx_0.2-115.67M-BASE,8,3,apache-2.0,,,false,"Causal language model trained **from scratch** on ~1.57B tokens. Custom Transformer with RoPE, RMSNorm, SwiGLU. No external pretrained weights.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
