Rzoro/erebus-tiny,8,0,mit,,,false,**Erebus Tiny** is a decoder-only causal language model (~19M parameters) trained from scratch as part of the [Erebus](https://github.com/m-np/erebus) foundation-model project.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Rzoro/erebus-small,8,0,mit,,,false,**Erebus-Small** is a decoder-only causal language model (~152M parameters) trained from scratch as part of the [Erebus](https://github.com/m-np/erebus) foundation-model project.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
simonykq/nvidia-transaction-decoder-fm,8,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Pretrained checkpoint from the [NVIDIA Build Your Own Transaction Foundation Model](https://github.com/NVIDIA-AI-Blueprints/transaction-foundation-model) developer example, as described in the [NVIDIA Technical Blog](https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/build-your-own-transaction-foundation-model-for-financial-intelligence/).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Sejibeji/tso-foundation-v17,8,0,mit,,,false,"**Time is geometry.** The Time-Series Operator (TSO) is a foundation model that learns the *shape* of dynamical systems instead of token-chunking numbers. Pretraining uses four self-supervised pretexts — reconstruction, Koopman-linear dynamics, scale covariance (a renormalization leg), and the arrow of time — on 40 series across 8 domains (electricity grids, meteorology, ECG, finance, epidemiology, economics, solar physics, chaotic systems). Transfer to a never-seen series is a **closed-form Koopman fit on the frozen latent**: zero gradient steps.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kaopanboonyuen/KAO-TerraMind-B,8,0,apache-2.0,,,false,> **From General-Purpose Geospatial Foundation Models to Thailand-Specific GeoAI.** 🇹🇭🛰️,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MultiBertGunjanPatrick/multiberts-seed-0-1000k,8,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Seed 0 intermediate checkpoint 1000k MultiBERTs (pretrained BERT) model on English language using a masked language modeling (MLM) objective. It was introduced in [this paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.16163.pdf) and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/google-research/language/tree/master/language/multiberts). This is an intermediate checkpoint. The final checkpoint can be found at [multiberts-seed-0](https://hf.co/multberts-seed-0). This model is uncased: it does not make a difference between english and English.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MultiBertGunjanPatrick/multiberts-seed-10,8,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Seed 0 MultiBERTs (pretrained BERT) model on English language using a masked language modeling (MLM) objective. It was introduced in [this paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.16163.pdf) and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/google-research/language/tree/master/language/multiberts). This model is uncased: it does not make a difference between english and English.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
