amDANIEL2024/gptmdogo-bible,8,0,mit,,,false,Custom-architecture GPT trained from scratch on a character-level tokenizer.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sifat-febo/banglish-ontor,8,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Your model answers a Banglish message — Bengali typed in Latin letters — without knowing anything about it. ontor is a perception layer: it reads the message first and hands your model what it found. The whole layer is 3.3 MB and it runs on a CPU in milliseconds.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
flbjcy/LM-from-scratch,8,0,mit,,,false,"A small Transformer language model, implemented entirely from scratch (no `torch.nn` layers beyond `Parameter` and containers) as part of Stanford's CS336 (Language Modeling from Scratch) assignment.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
pngwn/memcap-l-above-capacity,8,0,mit,,,false,"Part of a tiny-scale reproduction of **[How much do language models memorize?](https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.24832)** (Morris et al., ICML 2026 honorable mention): GPT-style models trained from scratch on uniformly random token sequences, where generalization is impossible and every bit of loss reduction is memorization.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
faiz4320/cnn-model,8,1,mit,,,false,Classroom prototype. NOT a medical device and NOT a validated pneumonia detector.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Manovishaal/MaVi-0.2-65M,8,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"**MaVi** is a small language model that turns a plain-English game idea into a playable 2D game. It was trained from scratch, together with its own game engine: the model writes **GSL**, a compact game-specification language (see `GSL.md`), and the engine plays it, validates it and exports it to Godot 4 and Ren'Py. It can also draw pixel-art sprites in **PXL**, a small drawing language, and edit existing games and levels.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
opena2a/nanomind-security-classifier,7,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"A fast, lightweight threat classifier purpose-built for AI agent security scanning. Classifies SKILL.md files, MCP server configurations, SOUL.md governance docs, and agent tool descriptions into 10 security categories in under 1ms.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dalek-ai/baseline-v1-desc-hybrid-next-v1,7,0,mit,,,false,"Same hybrid pipeline as [`baseline-v1-desc-hybrid`](https://huggingface.co/dalek-ai/baseline-v1-desc-hybrid), but the encoder has been fine-tuned on **8 386 next-tool prediction triplets** with contrastive (task, gold_description, hard_negative) triples. Hard negatives are sampled from the top-50 retrieval of the **previous** hybrid encoder, so each gradient step pushes the encoder past its own retrieval mistakes.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
beatsprom/agentic-tool-use-qwen-7b-lora,7,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Fine-tuned adapter using the **Agentic Tool-Use & Function Calling Suite (2026)**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
hkoldcat/wikisql-4bit-1k,7,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [hkoldcat/wikisql-4bit-1k](https://huggingface.co/hkoldcat/wikisql-4bit-1k) was converted to MLX format from [mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) using mlx-lm version **0.18.1**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
rizalhilman/wikisql-4bit-1k,7,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Model [rizalhilman/wikisql-4bit-1k](https://huggingface.co/rizalhilman/wikisql-4bit-1k) was converted to MLX format from [mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) using mlx-lm version **0.19.3**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fbaldassarri/sapienzanlp_Minerva-350M-base-v1.0-autoround-int8-gs128-sym,7,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Quantized version of [sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-350M-base-v1.0) using torch.float32 for quantization tuning. - 8 bits (INT8) - group size = 128 - Symmetrical Quantization - Method WoQ (AutoRound format),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fbaldassarri/sapienzanlp_Minerva-3B-base-v1.0-autoround-int8-gs128-sym,7,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Quantized version of [sapienzanlp/Minerva-3B-base-v1.0](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-3B-base-v1.0) using torch.float32 for quantization tuning. - 8 bits (INT8) - group size = 128 - Symmetrical Quantization - Method WoQ (AutoRound format),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fbaldassarri/sapienzanlp_Minerva-7B-instruct-v1.0-autoround-int8-gs128-sym,7,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Quantized version of [sapienzanlp/Minerva-7B-instruct-v1.0](https://huggingface.co/sapienzanlp/Minerva-7B-instruct-v1.0) using torch.float32 for quantization tuning. - 8 bits (INT8) - group size = 128 - Asymmetrical Quantization - Method WoQ (AutoRound format),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
rudransh0109/Mistral-7B-v0.1-bnb-4bit,7,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model is a quantized version of the original model [`mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1`](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Zaixi/RNAGenesis,7,10,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"RNAGenesis is a generalist RNA foundation model that integrates sequence representation, structural prediction, and de novo functional design within a single generative framework. Trained on diverse clustered non-coding RNAs, RNAGenesis leverages a BERT-style encoder, query-based latent compression, and a diffusion-guided decoder enhanced by inference-time alignment with gradient guidance and beam search strategies.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Enaoudir/base_model,7,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kostakoff/Mistral-7B-v0.1,7,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The Mistral-7B-v0.1 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative text model with 7 billion parameters. Mistral-7B-v0.1 outperforms Llama 2 13B on all benchmarks we tested.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
JonathanMiddleton/daisy-milli-base-v18b,7,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"DaisyCore transformer with 26 layers, 14 attention heads, and a model dimension of 1,792. Uses block-causal sliding window attention (window size 2,048) with standard attention implementation.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
