WakandaAI/Aura-2B,7,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 1.8B-parameter multilingual base LLM covering 37 African languages (plus English, French, Portuguese, Arabic for transfer). Trained from scratch with a Llama-3-style architecture (RMSNorm, RoPE, grouped-query attention, SwiGLU) on a temperature-balanced FineWeb2 mixture.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
