bioinfoihb/FishNALM-20_pretrain,7,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,`FishNALM-20_pretrain` is a fish-specific foundation DNA language model in the FishNALM family. It was pretrained on fish genome sequences with masked language modeling (MLM) and is intended for genomic sequence representation learning and downstream transfer to fish genomics tasks.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
bioinfoihb/FishNALM-20L_pretrain,7,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,`FishNALM-20L_pretrain` is a fish-specific foundation DNA language model in the FishNALM family. It was pretrained on fish genome sequences with masked language modeling (MLM) and is intended for genomic sequence representation learning and downstream transfer to fish genomics tasks.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
chifural/Mhondoro-Tokenizer-2k,7,0,mit,,,false,"`Mhondoro-Tokenizer-2k` is part of the **Mhondoro** family of open-source foundation models for financial time-series forecasting, released by [Louis Chifura](https://huggingface.co/chifural).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
