GPUburnout/GPUburnout-3B-75K-Chat-step3000,7,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 3.12 billion parameter chat model produced by supervised fine-tuning [GPUburnout/GPUburnout-3B-75K](https://huggingface.co/GPUburnout/GPUburnout-3B-75K) on SlimOrca-50K. This is the **step-3000 checkpoint**, which achieved the lowest validation loss during the SFT run.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
