jsantillana/vectrayx-1b,7,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"1.04-billion-parameter Spanish/LATAM cybersecurity decoder, trained from scratch. This is the **text-only** backbone (no vision encoder) — the ViTLM-language model inside [VectraYX-Vision-1B](https://huggingface.co/jsantillana/vectrayx-vision-1B), exported standalone for text-only use or as the base of a custom VLM.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kadalicious22/snapgate-surge-v2,7,0,mit,,,false,A bilingual language model (Indonesian + English) trained from scratch — no base model was used at any stage of training.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
vukrosic/nano-dates,7,0,mit,,,false,"Converts a natural date phrase (""next friday"", ""the 3rd of July 2025"") to an **ISO-8601** date. It is small enough to run on a CPU in milliseconds and was trained **entirely on code-generated data** — no scraping, no labelling, no distillation from a larger model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Sherwinroger002/Luna-0.1b-Instruct,7,2,mit,,,false,"This is a **124 Million parameter** language model trained from scratch. Structurally identical to the original OpenAI GPT-2 Small, this model represents a complete end-to-end LLM training pipeline built independently.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
