anonymneurips2027/PIT-4B-201412,6,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Point-In-Time (PIT) is a family of GPT-style language models trained on chronologically-ordered monthly snapshots of FineWeb. Each checkpoint captures the state of knowledge available up to a specific month, making them suitable for temporal reasoning and point-in-time analysis tasks.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
