FareedKhan/timesfm-from-scratch-70m,6,1,mit,,,false,"A from-scratch reimplementation of Google's **TimesFM** time-series foundation model, trained with a custom pretraining pipeline rebuilt from the paper (arXiv:2310.10688). This checkpoint is the **70M** (`small`) configuration.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Chtholly17/epifoundation-compass-dann,6,0,mit,,,false,"Transformer backbone for paired single-cell **ATAC + RNA** data, pretrained on [CompassDB](https://compass.compbio.duke.edu/) with a **domain-adversarial (DANN)** batch discriminator on the cell embedding.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Sejibeji/tso-foundation-v13,6,0,mit,,,false,"**Time is geometry.** The Time-Series Operator (TSO) is a foundation model that learns the *shape* of dynamical systems instead of token-chunking numbers. Pretraining uses four self-supervised pretexts — reconstruction, Koopman-linear dynamics, scale covariance (a renormalization leg), and the arrow of time — on 40 series across 8 domains (electricity grids, meteorology, ECG, finance, epidemiology, economics, solar physics, chaotic systems). Transfer to a never-seen series is a **closed-form Koopman fit on the frozen latent**: zero gradient steps.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MultiBertGunjanPatrick/multiberts-seed-13,6,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Seed 13 MultiBERTs (pretrained BERT) model on English language using a masked language modeling (MLM) objective. It was introduced in [this paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.16163.pdf) and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/google-research/language/tree/master/language/multiberts). This model is uncased: it does not make a difference between english and English.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MultiBertGunjanPatrick/multiberts-seed-3-1100k,6,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Seed 3 intermediate checkpoint 1100k MultiBERTs (pretrained BERT) model on English language using a masked language modeling (MLM) objective. It was introduced in [this paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.16163.pdf) and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/google-research/language/tree/master/language/multiberts). This is an intermediate checkpoint. The final checkpoint can be found at [multiberts-seed-3](https://hf.co/multberts-seed-3). This model is uncased: it does not make a difference between english and English.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MultiBertGunjanPatrick/multiberts-seed-3-2000k,6,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Seed 3 intermediate checkpoint 2000k MultiBERTs (pretrained BERT) model on English language using a masked language modeling (MLM) objective. It was introduced in [this paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.16163.pdf) and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/google-research/language/tree/master/language/multiberts). This is an intermediate checkpoint. The final checkpoint can be found at [multiberts-seed-3](https://hf.co/multberts-seed-3). This model is uncased: it does not make a difference between english and English.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MultiBertGunjanPatrick/multiberts-seed-3-500k,6,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Seed 3 intermediate checkpoint 500k MultiBERTs (pretrained BERT) model on English language using a masked language modeling (MLM) objective. It was introduced in [this paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.16163.pdf) and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/google-research/language/tree/master/language/multiberts). This is an intermediate checkpoint. The final checkpoint can be found at [multiberts-seed-3](https://hf.co/multberts-seed-3). This model is uncased: it does not make a difference between english and English.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MultiBertGunjanPatrick/multiberts-seed-9,6,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Seed 0 MultiBERTs (pretrained BERT) model on English language using a masked language modeling (MLM) objective. It was introduced in [this paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.16163.pdf) and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/google-research/language/tree/master/language/multiberts). This model is uncased: it does not make a difference between english and English.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
