AL-CEL/Llama-Primus-Reasoning-Q8_0-GGUF,6,0,mit,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`trendmicro-ailab/Llama-Primus-Reasoning`](https://huggingface.co/trendmicro-ailab/Llama-Primus-Reasoning) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/trendmicro-ailab/Llama-Primus-Reasoning) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
