The-CoLab/llama3-7b-en2-en1-codeswitching-134k,6,0,llama3,,,false,"LLaMA-3 7B pretrained on English bilingual data (en1 + en2) with code-switching, 134k steps. Uses the **en1 embedding matrix** (`--extract_vocab 0`) from the 2×vocabulary checkpoint. For the en2 embedding matrix version see [`The-CoLab/llama3-7b-en1-en2-codeswitching-134k`](https://huggingface.co/The-CoLab/llama3-7b-en1-en2-codeswitching-134k).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
