Nj-1111/gpt-152m-fineweb,6,0,mit,,,false,A 152 million parameter GPT-style decoder-only transformer trained completely from scratch using raw PyTorch. No pretrained weights were used at any point. Built as a learning project to understand every component of a modern language model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sathishphdai/supply-chain-manager-slm-1m,6,0,mit,,,false,"A **LLaMA-style transformer** (~989.2M params, ~0.99B) trained from scratch for the **Supply Chain Manager** role. Supports up to **1M token context** via RoPE with gradient checkpointing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
yashshinde0080/zeronet-3,6,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A minimal GPT language model trained from scratch using only Python's standard library (no PyTorch/TensorFlow).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kazama0453/chinese-poker-gpt,6,0,mit,,,false,一个从零开始训练的中文语言模型，具备基础的扑克策略问答能力。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
euswbnix/transformer-wmt14-enfr-big,6,0,mit,,,false,"A **from-scratch PyTorch implementation** of the Transformer (Vaswani et al., 2017), trained on **WMT14 English→French** without any pretrained weights. This is the strongest checkpoint from the parent project and the one worth sharing externally.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
euswbnix/transformer-wmt14-ende-big,6,0,mit,,,false,"A **from-scratch PyTorch implementation** of the Transformer (Vaswani et al., 2017), trained on **WMT14 English→French** without any pretrained weights. This is the strongest checkpoint from the parent project and the one worth sharing externally.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tingqli/guppylm-9M,6,0,mit,,,false,This is a refactor of [arman-bd/guppylm-9M](https://huggingface.co/arman-bd/guppylm-9M) to be compliant with [transformers's custom_model](https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/custom_models).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
gmmeyer/cicero,6,0,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"A 100M-parameter Latin language model, **trained from scratch** — no pretrained backbone, no English/Greek base. It generates Classical Latin in the browser or anywhere ONNX runs.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
geoppls/rwkv7-147m-vintage-english,6,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 147M parameter RWKV-7 language model trained from scratch on **6.55 billion tokens of historical English text** spanning 1473–1914: the full Text Creation Partnership (TCP) corpus of Early Modern English print, combined with 47,989 English-language books from Project Gutenberg.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
danelcsb/localagent-ultra-tiny-1m,6,0,mit,,,false,"A **from-scratch, byte-level** tool-calling agent model from [LocalAgent](https://github.com/sangbumchoi/localagent). Pure PyTorch, **0.98M params**, trained on CPU. It pairs a tiny decoder (GQA + RoPE + SwiGLU + depth-recurrence) with a **dual head** (tool-selection classifier + pointer/copy argument head) and **prompt-grounded constrained decoding** for reliable tool calls across 21 tools (general assistant, the Claude Code / Codex coding surface, and computer-use / productivity tools), including parallel two-call turns.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
DuoNeural/native-refusal-0pct-50m,6,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Part of the **Native Refusal Geometry** experiment series. DuoNeural 2026-06-07 | Archon, Jesse Caldwell, Aura",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
vukrosic/nano-case,6,0,mit,,,false,"Converts a messy identifier to a target case style — `snake`, `kebab`, `camel`, `pascal`, `const` — and, crucially, segments **boundary-destroyed** inputs (no separators, one global case: `sdkmodel`, `HTTPREQUESTHANDLER`) that a regular expression provably cannot split. A **~1M-parameter (1,016,960) byte-level transformer**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ankitw497/slm-125m-base,6,1,mit,,,false,A 125.8M-parameter LLaMA-architecture language model trained from scratch on a legal/financial/web data mix.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Brich627/SIL-v01,6,1,mit,,,false,"**This is an educational project, not a practical language model.** It is a from-scratch transformer built to learn the mechanics of language modeling end-to-end. It is not intended for any downstream or production use -- treat it as a worked example, not a tool.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
