worldboss/en-ee-from-scratch,6,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"From-scratch English → Ewe encoder–decoder (Pre-LN, 6×512, vocab 32000). This is **not** an NLLB / Transformers `AutoModelForSeq2SeqLM` checkpoint. Load `best.pt` with `translate.py` from the training repo.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
