tksluangrath/tool-concierge,5,0,gpl-3.0,,,false,"The Model Context Protocol (MCP) became a cross-vendor standard ""in a very short time span"" ([Anthropic, 2024](https://www.anthropic.com/news/model-context-protocol)). Models that hallucinate tool names or malform arguments turn these integrations into silent failures ([Patil et al., 2023](https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.15334)). Routing every tool-use decision through a frontier model is also costly at scale, and small open-weight models fine-tuned on curated function-calling data can match or beat larger ones ([Erdogan et al., 2024](https://arxiv.org/abs/2409.00608)). I fine-tuned [Qwen/Qwen3-8B-Base](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-8B-Base) with LoRA to generate a single MCP tool call, or an explicit `no_applicable_tool` abstention, from a plain-English request and a set of MCP tool defini",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MaxPrudhomme/Mistral-7B-v0.1-Q4_K_M-GGUF,5,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1`](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
VRDate/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Base-W4A16-Q4_K_S-GGUF,5,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Base-W4A16`](https://huggingface.co/dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Base-W4A16) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-24B-Base-W4A16) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
