davidyang05/DAARTH-7B-A1B,5,2,apache-2.0,,,false,A 7-billion parameter (1B active) hybrid Mamba + Mixture-of-Experts language model pretrained from scratch on 73.4B tokens of [NVIDIA ClimbMix](https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/ClimbMix) data.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
