jacmor64/ares-seed-1m,4,0,mit,,,false,This is a tiny proof-of-training checkpoint for Ares. It is **not** a capable chatbot. It proves the Ares pipeline can train a from-scratch decoder-only Transformer and generate from its own weights.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Probabilistr/slm-125m-finetuned,4,0,apache-2.0,,,false,SFT fine-tune of [Probabilistr/slm-125m-base](https://huggingface.co/Probabilistr/slm-125m-base) (a 125.8M-parameter from-scratch Llama-architecture model) on a synthetic instruction/response dataset for legal and financial documents.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jakequist/kanjiland-annotation,4,0,mit,,,false,"A from-scratch 52.3M Transformer that maps raw Japanese to the **full Kanjiland reading-comprehension format** — segmentation, furigana, glosses, word groupings, translation, and grammar labels (⟨T⟩/⟨W⟩/⟨S⟩/⟨G⟩), with **no MeCab at inference** (it learned segmentation itself). Part of [**Kanjiland**](https://github.com/jakequist/kanjiland).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Probabilistr/slm-125m-raft-finetuned,4,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"RAFT (Retrieval-Augmented Fine-Tuning) SFT of [Probabilistr/slm-125m-base](https://huggingface.co/Probabilistr/slm-125m-base) (a 125.8M-parameter from-scratch Llama-architecture model) -- unlike [Probabilistr/slm-125m-finetuned](https://huggingface.co/Probabilistr/slm-125m-finetuned) (single gold-passage SFT), this model is trained on 5 retrieved documents per example (80% include the oracle passage among distractors, the rest are all-distractor ""negative"" examples trained to answer ""Not stated in the context.""), so it learns to identify the right passage among retrieval noise and to refuse when none of the retrieved documents actually answer the question.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
vivekkopthsd/vivek1-muon,4,0,mit,,,false,A 1.3MB transformer trained from scratch on Google's Site Reliability Engineering book using the Muon optimizer (paper-exact per arXiv:2502.16982). Held-out perplexity 4.58 vs 7.32 for AdamW (-37%) and 12.09 bigram floor.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
