xThr45hx/EmbeddingGemma-300M-Tensor-G4-NPU,2,0,gemma,,,false,"> [!NOTE] > A quantized, repackaged variant of > [`google/embeddinggemma-300m`](https://huggingface.co/google/embeddinggemma-300m) that runs its > embeddings on the **Google Tensor G4 Edge TPU (""rio"") NPU** (Pixel 9 series), plus a complete > **on-device RAG** stack that runs entirely in **Termux** on the phone: a native bionic **engine runner**, > a numpy vector index, and an **MCP server** that exposes semantic search to any MCP client.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
