ImTamsi/qwen3.6-27b-code-reviewer,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> **This repository does not contain model weights.** > It documents how to serve [`Qwen/Qwen3.6-27B`](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.6-27B) for the > [AI Code Reviewer MCP](https://github.com/Tamsi/ai-code-reviewer-mcp) project: vLLM flags, > generation settings, prompts, and the JSON output contract. Download weights from the base model repo.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
