withgordon/acb-guard-qwen25-7b-graph,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"QLoRA fine-tune of [Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct) for AI agent payment session safety classification, using **graph-conditioned prompting** — a novel approach that injects 20-dimensional behavioral features alongside the session transcript for joint text + structural reasoning in a single forward pass.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
withgordon/acb-guard-session-graph-rf,0,0,mit,,,false,A RandomForest classifier trained on 20-dimensional session graph features extracted from AI agent MCP payment sessions. The first application of session graph feature extraction to MCP commerce call sequences.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
