v8karlo/v8-Qwen2-7B-Q5_K_M-GGUF,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This model was converted to GGUF format from [`Qwen/Qwen2-7B`](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-7B) using llama.cpp via the ggml.ai's [GGUF-my-repo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggml-org/gguf-my-repo) space. Refer to the [original model card](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2-7B) for more details on the model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
