stukenov/sozkz-llama-150m-200k-kk-base-v1,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **152.75M parameter** Llama-architecture language model pretrained **from scratch** on 3.11 billion tokens of Kazakh text. This is the first dense Kazakh-only model in the SozKZ family, trained with a custom 200K-vocab Kazakh tokenizer for high-quality Kazakh text generation.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
