ATLASBIOINFO/PlantDNA-FM,0,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,"**PlantDNA-FM** is a plant DNA foundation model pre-trained on the complete collection of plant genomes from **Ensembl Plants**, with a specific focus on **gene-body regions** — including promoters, exons, introns, and terminators. The model is designed to learn the regulatory grammar and coding/non-coding sequence structure underlying plant gene expression and evolution.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
