lvjiameng/FAMA-Astro,0,0,mit,,,false,"**FAMA** (**F**oundational **A**stronomical **M**asked **A**utoencoder) is a self-supervised, foundational image model based on the Masked Autoencoder (MAE) architecture, optimized for the unique properties of astronomical data. It is designed to overcome the challenge of heterogeneous, unlabelled image datasets accumulating from wide-field surveys like the DESI Legacy Imaging Surveys and the upcoming Chinese Space Station Telescope (CSST).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
