Vipplav/telugu-bpe-23k,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,A Byte-Pair Encoding (BPE) tokenizer trained on over **3.4 lakh cleaned Telugu text keys ** from the [AI4Bharat Sangraha dataset](https://huggingface.co/datasets/ai4bharat/sangraha) and other open sources. This tokenizer is ideal for **pretraining or fine-tuning Telugu language models**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
