ThisenEkanayake/HelaBERT,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"HelaBERT is a BERT-based masked language model pre-trained from scratch on a large Sinhala text corpus. With approximately **23.3 million parameters**, it is designed to produce contextual representations of Sinhala language text and can be used for downstream NLP tasks such as text classification, named entity recognition, semantic similarity, and information retrieval.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
