BlackwoodAI/blackwood-0.7b-bpe49152-tokenizer,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"A production-grade byte-level BPE tokenizer trained on a mixture of permissively-licensed English text, code (via FIM) and math, with 256 reserved special-token slots covering ChatML / chain-of-thought / tool-call / document-boundary primitives.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
