ducanhdinh/jepa_proof_vicreg_replace,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,BERT encoder pretrained from scratch với **VICReg + Lexical Substitution augmentation**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ducanhdinh/jepa_proof_barlow_twins,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,BERT encoder pretrained from scratch với **Barlow Twins**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ducanhdinh/jepa_proof_boyl,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,BERT encoder pretrained from scratch với **BYOL (Bootstrap Your Own Latent)**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
juliannunezb/crisp3b-v7-ckpts,0,0,mit,,,false,"Base language model. Same architecture and training recipe as [crisp3b-v8](https://huggingface.co/juliannunezb/crisp3b-v8-ckpts) (34 layers, d_model 2560, GQA 40/20, FlexAttention sliding window + global layers, ReLU², value residual, Muon + AdamW, FP8 forward), with the GPT-2 BPE tokenizer (vocab 50,257, padded to 50,304) instead of the v8 tokenizer. Trained on [Crisp-165B](https://huggingface.co/datasets/juliannunezb/crisp-165b) with loader-side source reweighting (target mix: FineWeb-Edu 32%, DCLM 20%, code 13%, FineMath 9%, Dolmino 8%, peS2o 8%, Cosmopedia 4%, PG19 3%, Wikipedia 3%).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cjfb75/slm-pt100m,0,0,mit,,,false,"SLM **decoder-only estilo LLaMA**, treinado do zero em Português-BR para o trabalho de **Aprendizado Profundo II** (PUCRS — Escola Politécnica).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
adimunot/mathnano-pretrain-d16,0,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,"A ~200M-parameter transformer **pretrained from random initialization** on mathematical text, using Karpathy's [nanochat](https://github.com/karpathy/nanochat). The deep-learning artifact of the [MathNano](https://github.com/adimunot21/mathnano) project — trained on a single RTX 4090.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Paerle/Guido-1-0.5B-Base,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"A ~553M-parameter **math-focused base** language model (PiCOFormer, dense decoder-only), pre-trained **from scratch on ~77.6B tokens** of a math-dominant corpus. Tokenizer: **Mathstral-32k**. This is a **base model — not instruction-tuned, not aligned.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
gyung/gdn2-370m-fineweb-edu-100b,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,> A pure-recurrent linear-attention language model trained from scratch on FineWeb-Edu. > Architecture: **Gated DeltaNet 2 (GDN-2)** — the recurrence of Gated DeltaNet with two channel-wise gates.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
LLM-OS-Models/gdn2-370m-fineweb-edu-100b,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,> A pure-recurrent linear-attention language model trained from scratch on FineWeb-Edu. > Architecture: **Gated DeltaNet 2 (GDN-2)** — the recurrence of Gated DeltaNet with two channel-wise gates.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
LLM-OS-Models/dsc-370m-fineweb-edu-1b-v3,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"| | | | **Status** | 🟢 **v3 — causality leak fixed.** v1 had a routing leak; v3 patches `seg_query = last-pos-of-prev-chunk` + strict triu(diagonal=0) causal mask. CPU causality smoke test verifies future-perturbation invariance on all chunks. | | **Architecture** | DSC = GDN-2 + Dynamic Sparse Caching (chunk c=256, top-k=2 routing, multi-res descriptor [mean/max/softmax-attn]) | | **Parameters** | ~370 M (GDN-2 370M backbone + small router + combine_alpha) | | **Training data** | FineWeb-Edu sample/100BT (1 B-token slice) | | **Tokenizer** | TinyLlama v1.1 (vocab = 32 000) | | **Context length** | 4 096 (training) | | **Hardware** | 8 × NVIDIA H200 141 GB (FSDP) | | **Loss @ 1B** | 3.49 (vs vanilla GDN-2 1B = 3.51) | | **License** | Apache-2.0 | | **Trained by** | [LLM-OS-Models](https://",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
LLM-OS-Models/gdn2-370m-fineweb-edu-1b,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"| | | | **Architecture** | GatedDeltaNet-2 (Yang et al. 2025), 370M parameter variant | | **Parameters** | 370 M | | **Training data** | FineWeb-Edu sample/100BT (1 B-token slice) | | **Tokenizer** | TinyLlama v1.1 (vocab = 32 000) | | **Context length** | 4 096 (training) | | **Hardware** | 8 × NVIDIA H200 141 GB (FSDP) | | **Loss @ 1B** | 3.51 | | **License** | Apache-2.0 | | **Trained by** | [LLM-OS-Models](https://huggingface.co/LLM-OS-Models) · code at [gyunggyung/long-gdn](https://github.com/gyunggyung/long-gdn) |",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
LLM-OS-Models/gdn2-370m-fineweb-edu-5b,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"| | | | **Architecture** | GatedDeltaNet-2 (Yang et al. 2025), 370M parameter variant | | **Parameters** | 370 M | | **Training data** | FineWeb-Edu sample/100BT (5 B-token slice) | | **Tokenizer** | TinyLlama v1.1 (vocab = 32 000) | | **Context length** | 4 096 (training) | | **Hardware** | 8 × NVIDIA H200 141 GB (FSDP) | | **License** | Apache-2.0 | | **Trained by** | [LLM-OS-Models](https://huggingface.co/LLM-OS-Models) · code at [gyunggyung/long-gdn](https://github.com/gyunggyung/long-gdn) |",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
LLM-OS-Models/dsc-370m-fineweb-edu-1b-v4,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,| | | | **Status** | 🟢 **v4 1B sanity check — gate decision input.** Tests whether v4's architectural improvements (entropy bias + attention-pool descriptor) preserve v3's already-good 1B loss before escalating to 5B. | | **Architecture** | DSC = GDN-2 + Dynamic Sparse Caching + Idea 1 (learnable attention-pool `desc_attn_v`) + Idea 2 (`ent_bias_scale` entropy bias on routing logits) | | **Parameters** | ~370 M | | **Training data** | FineWeb-Edu sample/100BT (1 B-token slice) | | **Tokenizer** | TinyLlama v1.1 (vocab = 32 000) | | **Context length** | 4 096 (training) | | **Hardware** | 8 × NVIDIA H200 141 GB (FSDP) | | **Loss @ 1B** | see `docs/DSC_LIVE_STATUS_KO.md` | | **License** | Apache-2.0 | | **Trained by** | [LLM-OS-Models](https://huggingface.co/LLM-OS-Models) · code at [gyunggy,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
LLM-OS-Models/dsc-370m-fineweb-edu-5b-v3,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"| | | | **Status** | 🟢 **v3 — causality leak fixed.** v1 (commit-prior) had a routing leak; v3 patches `seg_query = last-pos-of-prev-chunk` + strict triu(diagonal=0) causal mask. CPU causality smoke test verifies future-perturbation invariance on all chunks. | | **Architecture** | DSC = GDN-2 + Dynamic Sparse Caching (chunk c=256, top-k=2 routing, multi-res descriptor [mean/max/softmax-attn]) | | **Parameters** | ~370 M (GDN-2 370M backbone + small router + combine_alpha) | | **Training data** | FineWeb-Edu sample/100BT (5 B-token slice) | | **Tokenizer** | TinyLlama v1.1 (vocab = 32 000) | | **Context length** | 4 096 (training) | | **Hardware** | 8 × NVIDIA H200 141 GB (FSDP) | | **Loss @ 5B** | see `docs/DSC_LIVE_STATUS_KO.md` for final trajectory | | **License** | Apache-2.0 | | **Trai",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
LLM-OS-Models/dsc-370m-fineweb-edu-5b-v4,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,| | | | **Status** | 🟢 **v4 5B — head-to-head contender against v3 5B.** Launched only if the v4 1B gate passes. Adds entropy bias + attention-pool descriptor on top of v3's leak-fixed foundation. | | **Architecture** | DSC = GDN-2 + Dynamic Sparse Caching + Idea 1 (attention-pool descriptor) + Idea 2 (entropy bias) | | **Parameters** | ~370 M | | **Training data** | FineWeb-Edu sample/100BT (5 B-token slice) | | **Tokenizer** | TinyLlama v1.1 (vocab = 32 000) | | **Context length** | 4 096 (training) | | **Hardware** | 8 × NVIDIA H200 141 GB (FSDP) | | **Loss @ 5B** | see `docs/DSC_LIVE_STATUS_KO.md` | | **License** | Apache-2.0 | | **Trained by** | [LLM-OS-Models](https://huggingface.co/LLM-OS-Models) · code at [gyunggyung/long-gdn](https://github.com/gyunggyung/long-gdn) |,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
juliannunezb/crisp3b-v8-ckpts,0,0,mit,,,false,"Base language model (no instruction tuning). 2.67B parameters, Llama-style architecture, custom 49k byte-level BPE tokenizer with **single-digit numbers**, trained on **6.67B tokens** of [crisp-v8](https://huggingface.co/datasets/juliannunezb/crisp-v8) — a corpus built for this run from Nemotron-CC-v2.1 (organic web + synthetic rephrasings + diverse-QA), FineWeb-Edu, FineMath-4plus, StarCoderData and peS2o — in **38.4 GPU-hours on a single NVIDIA B200 (≈$193 of GPU time)**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
LLM-OS-Models/gdn2-1.3B-fineweb-edu-100b,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,> A pure-recurrent linear-attention language model trained from scratch on FineWeb-Edu. > Architecture: **Gated DeltaNet-2 (GDN-2)** — decoupling erase and write gates in linear attention.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
wcamon/circus-0.2-stem-architecture,0,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,"**Wei Ciao Wu** (independent researcher), with Claude (Anthropic) as AI research assistant.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tucan9389/nanochat-jax,0,1,mit,,,false,"Model checkpoints for [**nanochat-jax**](https://github.com/tucan9389/nanochat-jax), a JAX/Flax port of Andrej Karpathy's [nanochat](https://github.com/karpathy/nanochat) that reproduces the reference recipes on **spot TPU** (e.g. v6e-8) instead of 8×H100, matching the reference model *quality*.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Lambent/influence-taste-56m,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 56M-parameter predictor that scores web documents by their predicted **training influence** on 17 held-out text categories — not ""quality"" as a scalar, but a 17-dimensional taste vector. Trained to predict gradient-alignment influence labels: for each document, the cosine between its training gradient and the mean held-out gradient of each category, measured at a mid-training reference checkpoint.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
pre-to-post-olmo/Math-Models,0,0,mit,,,false,"Checkpoints from a **pretraining → post-training** study on a **1B-parameter OLMo-2** model trained on math. The repo bundles, for 15 pretraining anchors, the model at every stage of the pipeline:",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
capotej/WikipediaGutenberg-0.5B,0,1,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"A **from-scratch** GPT-2-style language model (nanoGPT), **530M params**, trained for **1 epoch** on a combination of **English Wikipedia** ([wikimedia/wikipedia](https://huggingface.co/datasets/wikimedia/wikipedia), 20231101.en) and **Project Gutenberg** ([common-pile/project_gutenberg_filtered](https://huggingface.co/datasets/common-pile/project_gutenberg_filtered)) — ~9.0B tokens, ~17 tokens/parameter (near the [Chinchilla](https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.15556) compute-optimal ratio).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Efekan35/axonlm-jepa,0,0,mit,,,false,"A 124M-parameter GPT-2-style language model exploring whether **JEPA-style self-supervised pretraining** (Joint-Embedding Predictive Architecture, LeCun 2022) produces more usable representations than standard next-token pretraining — tested through a neuroscience-grounded probing methodology.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
zzkai098/gpt2-124m-ckpt,0,0,mit,,,false,"A from-scratch reproduction of OpenAI's **GPT-2 (124M)** in PyTorch — architecture, distributed training, and evaluation all written by hand. Trained on **10B tokens of DCLM-baseline for 4 epochs** on 8×RTX 4090D (~13 h, ~$27).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ChrisMcCormick/decoderstack-d24,0,0,mit,,,false,"A 1.38B-parameter d24 model pre-trained from scratch with [**DecoderStack**](https://github.com/chrisjmccormick/stacks) — a single-file training stack with a handwritten forward/backward and a written-out optimizer: no autograd, no `torch.optim`, no `nn.Module`. bf16, varlen FlashAttention, 8xH100, 1h51m.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
inaciose/inacio-d16v1,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"`inacio-d16v1` is the first public base model of the **nanochatpt** project, an effort to train compact language models from scratch with **European Portuguese (PT-PT)** as the primary language while retaining English competence.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Impliedhomeland/midtrain-bridge-backbones,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Training-state checkpoints for the **C4-only reference runs** used in midtraining intro-timing experiments. In that setup a single C4-only trunk is trained, then *forked* at various points to introduce a new data mixture (code). `branch_A` is the control: the run that never sees code at all.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Impliedhomeland/midtrain-bridge-1B-cosine-backbone,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **C4-only 1B-parameter pretraining run to 60B tokens**, published with **all 17 intermediate checkpoints** along the trajectory. This is the `W=0` reference arm of a study on *when* to introduce a new data distribution (code) during pretraining; the checkpoints are the fork points from which code-mixed branches are launched.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Impliedhomeland/midtrain-bridge-1B-wsd-backbone,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **C4-only 1B-parameter pretraining run to 60B tokens under a Warmup-Stable-Decay schedule**, published with **13 checkpoints** along the trajectory. This is the `W=0` reference arm of a study on *when* to introduce a new data distribution (code) during pretraining; the checkpoints are the fork points from which code-mixed branches are launched.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
lilywchen/lucky-initialization-atlas-100m-v2-checkpoints,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Private, continuously synchronized model-only checkpoints for the prospectively frozen OLMo-3-ladder 100M initialization atlas. Every visible checkpoint was converted with the pinned `olmo_core.nn.hf.save_hf_model`, serialized with its pinned tokenizer, and SHA-256 manifested before upload.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
joey00072/ohara-chat-d12,0,0,mit,,,false,"A 124M-parameter chat model trained from scratch with [ohara](https://github.com/joey00072/ohara), replicating the nanochat pipeline end to end: pretraining on ClimbMix, then supervised finetuning into a chat model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
joey00072/ohara-base-d12,0,0,mit,,,false,"The **pretrained base model** from a nanochat-style run with [ohara](https://github.com/joey00072/ohara). 124M effective parameters, trained from scratch on 1.48B tokens of ClimbMix on 2xA100-80GB in about 3.3 hours.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
