Maouz0/child-12m,0,2,cc-by-nc-nd-4.0,,,false,"A 12.3M parameter decoder-only transformer trained **entirely from scratch** on TinyStories. No pretrained checkpoint, no distillation, no transfer learning. Every weight learned from random initialization.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Atharva2099/nano-gpt-mlx-0.6M,0,0,mit,,,false,A 3.5M parameter GPT-2 style decoder-only language model trained from scratch in pure MLX on Apple Silicon.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cliffo4567/nanochat-d20,0,0,mit,,,false,A 896 million parameter GPT-style language model trained from scratch on a single NVIDIA H200 GPU at the Anuradha and Vikas Sinha Department of Data Science housed in the College of Information at the University of North Texas.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
anirudhmarpally/TeLLaMA,0,0,mit,,,false,A **35.3 million parameter** decoder-only Transformer language model trained from scratch on Telugu text from the CC-100 corpus.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Ghostgim/GhostLM-v0.9-experimental,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"GhostLM is a multi-rung scale-ladder cybersecurity language model trained entirely from scratch in PyTorch. **v0.9 chat is the bench winner of the ghost-small (45-81M) line on every multiple-choice benchmark we evaluated.** It is also where the line saturates: at 81M parameters the model has the *register* of cybersec writing but not the *facts* in any retrievable form. The next rung is (~360M, SmolLM2-360M shape), gated on rented GPU compute.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
chaitanyaapex98/nanogpt-fineweb-edu,0,2,mit,,,false,A GPT-style language model trained from scratch with finance specialisation. Built using the [nanogpt](https://github.com/ChaitanyaPandit1998/nanogpt) pipeline.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
chaitanyaapex98/nanogpt-finance,0,1,mit,,,false,A GPT-style language model trained from scratch with finance specialisation. Built using the [nanogpt](https://github.com/ChaitanyaPandit1998/nanogpt) pipeline.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
brettleehari/microgpt,0,0,mit,,,false,"A **1.35M-parameter decoder-only transformer** trained from scratch on the [TinyStories](https://huggingface.co/datasets/roneneldan/TinyStories) dataset. The entire training run took roughly two hours on an Apple Silicon laptop. At ~50,000× smaller than GPT-3, it can still produce coherent simple children's stories.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mkd-hossain/keural-sft-checkpoints,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,This repository contains mid-training checkpoints from **Stage 3 (SFT — Supervised Fine-Tuning)** of the Keural 14.8B MoE language model.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fatihburakkaragoz/fuzuli-base,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,**Fatih Burak Karagöz** · CDLI,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RajGana/mini-vlm-scratch,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Vision Language Model built from scratch. Architecture: CLIP (frozen) + Projection Layer + Custom LLM decoder.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
DanielRegaladoCardoso/cronica-jax-5m,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **5.26M parameter decoder-only Transformer**, **hand-written in pure JAX** (no Flax, no Equinox), that learns the **data-to-text** task: take a structured football match `<STATS>` block and produce a Spanish-language crónica in one of 8 regional commentator styles.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
aashir-athar/mindeesai-base,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div align=""center"">",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jsantillana/vectrayx-base,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,VectraYX-Base is a 260M-parameter Spanish cybersecurity language model trained **from scratch** using the same three-phase curriculum and replay-buffer recipe as presented in the paper [VectraYX-Nano: A 42M-Parameter Spanish Cybersecurity Language Model with Curriculum Learning and Native Tool Use](https://huggingface.co/papers/2605.13989).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Najin06/tacha-gan-from-scratch,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Model ini adalah arsitektur **Generative Adversarial Network (GAN)**, lebih spesifiknya **DCGAN (Deep Convolutional GAN)**, yang dibangun **murni dari nol (from scratch)** menggunakan PyTorch tanpa mengambil atau melatih ulang (*fine-tuning*) model yang sudah jadi.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MR0b0t/cpp-to-python-transformer,0,0,mit,,,false,"Encoder-decoder transformer trained from scratch for C++ → Python code translation. Trained on XLCoST on a single GTX 1650 4 GB GPU. Best checkpoint at epoch 19, val_loss **2.0474**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MR0b0t/gpt2-124m-reproduction,0,0,mit,,,false,"Karpathy's *Let's reproduce GPT-2 (124M)* video, end to end. Trained on 10B tokens of FineWeb-Edu on 8× A100 SXM4 (Lambda), 19,073 steps, ~2.5 hours of training, $61.23 total.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
avneeshjadhav04/llm-from-scratch,0,1,mit,,,false,"A clean, **from-scratch implementation** of a 124M-parameter decoder-only Transformer in PyTorch. No `nn.Transformer`, no shortcuts — every layer (attention, FFN, LayerNorm, embeddings) is built manually. Trained on **FineWeb-Edu** with mixed precision, gradient accumulation, and automatic checkpoint resume.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
HassaanRaza-445/NanoCodeGPT,0,0,mit,,,false,"A GPT-style language model built **entirely from scratch** using PyTorch — no pretrained weights, no APIs, just math and gradient descent.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AbdulrahmanFA/saudi-trained-ai-model-8.3M,0,0,mit,,,false,"A small decoder-only language model trained entirely from scratch on a colloquial Saudi/Gulf Arabic corpus, then instruction-fine-tuned to converse in Saudi dialect. Built end-to-end: custom tokenizer, architecture, pretraining, evaluation, and instruction fine-tuning.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jlov7/nanoAWM,0,0,mit,,,false,"This repository hosts the trained world model from **nanoAWM**, a small, dependency-free lab for studying whether a learned *consequence model* helps a tool-using agent avoid irreversible, approval-violating, and state-corrupting actions. Code, full evidence, and the paper live in the GitHub repository: **https://github.com/jlov7/nanoAWM**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
TreeLeek/TCF-1,0,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,**Architecture:** Hybrid Transformer + Mamba SSM **Parameters:** 494.9M **Built by:** Tree-ForgedMind **Hardware:** Apple Mac Studio (128GB unified memory) **Framework:** MLX,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
chrisjpatty/deseretlm-200m,0,0,mit,,,false,A **209.7M-parameter chat model** trained from scratch on synthetic text written exclusively in the [**Deseret Alphabet**](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deseret_alphabet) — a 19th-century phonetic writing system for English. The model produces and consumes Deseret-only text; English is auto-translated at the input boundary.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Asilarknes/70m-adamwgrok,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"Маленькая (71M параметров) decoder-only языковая модель **русского языка**, обученная **с нуля** на одной Tesla V100 за ~6.7 часов нашим оптимайзером **GrokAdamW**. Поверх — инструктивное дообучение (SFT) и **RAG** (модель остаётся 70M, факты — во внешней базе знаний). Три чекпоинта: `lm_ckpt.pt` (база), `sft_ckpt.pt` (чат), `rag_ckpt.pt` (ответы из контекста).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Guspard-ew/BeanSLM-Instruct-278M,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,BeanSLM-Instruct-278M is a 278M parameter English fully tuned language model trained from scratch.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
atandra2000/sd-from-scratch-v1,0,1,mit,,,false,"A **Stable Diffusion 1.x-class** latent diffusion model **trained from scratch** on **2× RTX 5090 (Blackwell, 33.7 GB VRAM each)** under the [SD_Train.py](https://github.com/atandra2000/StableDiffusion/blob/main/SD_Train.py) pipeline.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
geeteshcodes/sllm,0,1,mit,,,false,"A GPT-style decoder-only transformer built and trained from scratch in PyTorch. Two model sizes are available (100M and 150M parameters), designed to fit on consumer GPUs as small as a 4 GB VRAM card (e.g. RTX 3050).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dancinlab/anima-clm-default-lane-rung0-byte-18m,0,0,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,**The first model ever trained on the anima DEFAULT-LANE unified corpus.** A byte-level (vocab256) ConsciousLMReconstructed transformer (≈18.13M params) trained FROM SCRATCH on — the unified 5-language corpus (en/fr/de/es/ko: ~40% wiki + ~40% persona/SNS + ~20% KOSMOS-grounded enrichment) that backs `lane default`. This is the default-lane LADDER rung-0 (`a_scale_honest_scope`).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
TilQazyna/Til-Core-0.5B,0,4,apache-2.0,,,false,Қазақ тілінің базалық моделі · Базовая модель казахского языка · Kazakh base language model,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sutharsan-311/tiny-dllm,0,0,mit,,,false,A Masked Diffusion Language Model built from scratch in PyTorch — for learning and robotics research.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
NAME0x0/hagi-stage0,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **113M-parameter** dense transformer trained **from scratch** on **1B tokens** of FineWeb-Edu. This is the **control baseline** for the HAGI research project — the reference point against which the project's novel mechanism, **Grade-Decomposed Recurrence (GDR)**, will be measured.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
IvmeLabs/Ivme-Conversate-v1-Base,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"**İvme** (Turkish: *acceleration*) is a series of stupidly small language models built to punch above their weight. This is the first release: a 22M parameter decoder-only base model trained from scratch on a dense, quality-filtered corpus.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cloaky/joey,0,1,mit,,,false,"Joey is a ~170M-parameter **masked / absorbing-state diffusion language model** (MDLM / LLaDA family), implemented from scratch in PyTorch. Instead of generating left-to-right like GPT, it generates by **iterative denoising**: starting from a fully `[MASK]`ed sequence and progressively unmasking, re-deciding low-confidence tokens along the way.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Omk07/CyberLLM-350M,0,1,mit,,,false,A 350M parameter cybersecurity language model built entirely from scratch.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
pulipakav-1/dravidian-gpt2-telugu,0,0,mit,,,false,"A GPT-2 language model trained from scratch on Telugu text as part of the Dravidian LM project. The model is trained on a curated mix of CC100, Wikipedia, and Samanantar corpora, using a custom SentencePiece BPE tokenizer.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
aethera-gp/kotodama-3b-base-final,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,A 3B parameter language model trained from scratch with Block Attention Residuals and NCA pre-pretraining.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Zayed024/tinystories-10m-jax,0,0,mit,,,false,"A ~14.5M-parameter (≈6.3M non-embedding) decoder-only transformer trained **from scratch in JAX / Flax NNX** on [TinyStories](https://huggingface.co/datasets/roneneldan/TinyStories), reproducing the setup of Eldan & Li (2023, [arXiv:2305.07759](https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.07759)).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
popboat1/gpt2-summarizer-models,0,0,mit,,,false,"This repository contains the model weights for a custom GPT-2 (124M) model trained entirely from scratch, then aligned using Supervised Fine-Tuning (SFT) and Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback (RLHF) with Proximal Policy Optimization (PPO).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
