Rohanify/Anime-Elite-V2,0,2,mit,,,false,**Built for mid-tier devices.** Runs on 2 GB VRAM. Trained on a single RTX 5080. No pretrained components anywhere in the stack.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
