jbomdev/AlterEgo_raw,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"This repository holds the **original** AlterEgo checkpoint, in the model's **own from-scratch architecture** - i.e. the model exactly as it was trained, before any format conversion.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Nurova/Kova,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div align=""center""> </div> <hr>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kavin-ravi/slm-synthetic,0,0,mit,,,false,"A ~538M-parameter decoder-only GPT trained from scratch on a mix of synthetic mini-textbooks, Wikipedia, PG19, and FineWeb-Edu. Custom architecture (per-head QK-norm) with a custom 50k BPE tokenizer — **this is not a 🤗 Transformers model**, so load it with the self-contained snippet below.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
williamyates/WillyGPT,0,2,mit,,,false,"A 1.68B-parameter chat model trained from scratch — pretraining, supervised finetuning (SFT), and GRPO reinforcement learning — on the [nanochat](https://github.com/karpathy/nanochat) recipe (MIT). Built & trained by William Yates on a single 8×H100 node.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
yusiwen/dl-from-scratch,0,0,mit,,,false,Implement mainstream deep learning models from scratch.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
vermarjun/chad,0,0,cc0-1.0,,,false,"A small from scratch Hinglish chat model, around 100M params. Built and trained end to end: a byte level BPE tokenizer, a Llama style decoder (RoPE, grouped query attention, SwiGLU, RMSNorm), pretrained on romanized Hinglish, then fine tuned to chat in a chill Gen Z voice.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ripkiiiii/ajnyana-1,0,0,mit,,,false,First Sundanese-only language model trained from scratch. Part of the [Deflated](https://deflated.xyz) Indonesian AI stack.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
anandkaman/kasturi-500m,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> **Status**: 🟢 **PRETRAINING IN PROGRESS** — launched **2026-06-29 07:03 UTC**. > ETA: ~2026-07-24 (3.5 weeks, 30B tokens, 57,220 optimizer steps). > Single 16 GB consumer GPU (NVIDIA RTX 5060 Ti).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
tao-hpu/gpt2-124m-fineweb-edu-10b,0,0,mit,,,false,"从零手搓复现的 **GPT-2 124M base 模型**权重,配套教学仓库 👉 **[github.com/tao-hpu/llm-from-scratch](https://github.com/tao-hpu/llm-from-scratch)**(逐行中文讲解,从字符级 bigram 一路搭到复现 GPT-2)。",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/ag-agent-harness,0,0,mit,,,false,"> A reusable harness: a tool registry, a tool-using agent loop, a task suite, and a scorer.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/ag-behavior-cloning,0,0,mit,,,false,> A policy trained by supervised imitation of expert demonstrations; 100% rollout success.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/ag-reinforce-gridworld,0,0,mit,,,false,> A policy-gradient agent with a value baseline + entropy bonus that solves the Gymnasium CartPole-v1 benchmark (greedy return near the 500 maximum).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/a-motion-diffusion,0,0,mit,,,false,"> A denoising-diffusion model that generates motion trajectories — the MDM recipe, trained from scratch, sampled from EMA weights.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/a-pose-heatmap,0,0,mit,,,false,"> A fully-convolutional net that predicts per-joint heatmaps, decoded to coordinates by soft-argmax. Best-checkpoint by PCK.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/a-rotation-6d,0,0,mit,,,false,> Shows the continuous 6D rotation representation is far easier for a network to regress than Euler angles.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/a-smplify-fit,0,0,mit,,,false,> An articulated body fit to 2D keypoints by reprojection optimization with a pose prior — the SMPLify recipe.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/b-deepsdf-shape,0,0,mit,,,false,> An MLP signed-distance field with an eikonal regularizer; the surface is its zero level set (marching cubes).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/b-gaussian-splatting-2d,0,12,mit,,,false,> Reconstructs a real photograph with anisotropic 2D Gaussians (with densification) — the 2D analogue of 3D Gaussian Splatting.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/b-hashgrid-instngp,0,0,mit,,,false,> A multiresolution hash-grid feature encoding + tiny MLP that fits a real photograph to high PSNR — the trick that made NeRF ~1000× faster.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/b-icp-registration,0,0,mit,,,false,> Recovers a rigid transform between two point clouds with Iterative Closest Point (nearest-neighbour + Kabsch).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/b-mae-pretrain,0,0,mit,,,false,> Masks half the image patches and reconstructs them on real handwritten digits — the MAE / VideoMAE pretraining objective; reports held-out reconstruction error.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/c-action-anticipation-lstm,0,0,mit,,,false,"> An LSTM that anticipates the next action from a sequence, well above chance. Best-checkpoint by top-1.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/c-simclr-pretrain,0,0,mit,,,false,> Contrastive (NT-Xent) pretraining on real handwritten digits with a large batch; a few-shot linear probe on the frozen features beats a random encoder on held-out digits.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/d-semantic-mapping,0,0,mit,,,false,> Fuses noisy observations into an occupancy (log-odds) + semantic-label map that converges to ground truth.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/d-tsdf-fusion,0,0,mit,,,false,> Fuses multi-view depth into a truncated SDF volume and extracts a mesh with marching cubes.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/d-world-model,0,0,mit,,,false,"> Learns environment dynamics, then plans with the Cross-Entropy Method to reach a goal inside imagination.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
cy0307/lm-distillation,0,0,mit,,,false,"> On real handwritten digits, a small student trained on a teacher's soft predictions over all data nearly matches the teacher and beats one trained on only a few hard labels.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ripkiiiii/IDK-1-Instruct,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**IDK-1-Instruct** is an instruction-tuned version of IDK-1, a 106M parameter Indonesian small language model (SLM) trained from scratch.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Beltran12138/ming-vintage-scratch-30m,0,1,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,**A from-scratch char-level nanoGPT trained on a pre-1424 Classical Chinese corpus. The first non-English entry in the vintage LLM category.**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Babajaan/nanochat-ar,0,0,mit,,,false,This repository contains a small Arabic nanochat proof-of-competence checkpoint trained from scratch on King Abdulaziz University Aziz HPC.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Imsbee/ko-en-translator,0,3,apache-2.0,,,false,"PyTorch로 구현한 한국어↔영어 번역 모델입니다. 어텐션 대신 **minGRU 선형 순환(minRNN)**을 쓰는 인코더-디코더 seq2seq로, 학습은 병렬 스캔으로 병렬화되고 디코딩은 스텝당 O(1)·메모리 O(L)입니다. 여러 문장을 문맥 윈도우로 묶어 통째로 번역하는 **문서 모드**를 지원합니다 — 문장별 번역에서 흔들리는 용어·대명사·문체 일관성을 문맥으로 유지합니다.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RDTvlokip/Cadence-15M-fr,0,4,apache-2.0,,,false,"> ⚠️ **Preliminary results — 1 seed, variance not controlled.** Every number below is a single training run evaluated once (50 prompts × 200 tokens, fixed seed). Directions are consistent, magnitudes are not validated. Treat as a lab notebook, not a benchmark.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RDTvlokip/Focal-15M-fr,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"> ⚠️ **Preliminary results — 1 seed, variance not controlled.** Every number below is a single training run evaluated once (50 prompts × 200 tokens, fixed seed). Directions are consistent, magnitudes are not validated. Treat as a lab notebook, not a benchmark.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RDTvlokip/Nomade-15M-fr,0,3,apache-2.0,,,false,"> ⚠️ **Preliminary results — 1 seed, variance not controlled.** Every number below is a single training run evaluated once (50 prompts × 200 tokens, fixed seed). Directions are consistent, magnitudes are not validated. Treat as a lab notebook, not a benchmark.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Quazim0t0/SpikeWhale-SNN-216M,0,6,apache-2.0,,,false,"> **Model will be ungated for open download soon!** These models are undertrained, and are **NOT** meant to be finished. These are **Research Artifacts** only. >",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
federico-anastasi/nicu-20m,0,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"Nicu is a **20M-parameter language model trained from scratch** (no pretrained base) that plays a single character: a friendly guy from Catania, Sicily. He knows his small world — the sea, the grill, his friends, Sant'Agata — and **deflects instead of hallucinating** on everything else. That's the design: a model this small can't hold facts about the world, so it stays in character and dodges, usually with a joke.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Quazim0t0/neural-physics-engine,0,0,mit,,,false,"**A projective-dynamics (PD) engine in which the per-element *local* constraint projections are learned neural networks, while rotations and the *global* solve stay exactly analytic.** One tiny network, shared across every element and across constraint *types* via material tokens, sits inside an exact reduced global solve.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
federico-anastasi/nicu-5m,0,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"Nicu is a **5M-parameter language model trained from scratch** (no pretrained base) that plays a single character: a friendly guy from Catania, Sicily. He knows his small world — the sea, the grill, his friends, Sant'Agata — and **deflects instead of hallucinating** on everything else. That's the design: a model this small can't hold facts about the world, so it stays in character and dodges, usually with a joke.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
federico-anastasi/nicu-9m,0,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"Nicu is a **9M-parameter language model trained from scratch** (no pretrained base) that plays a single character: a friendly guy from Catania, Sicily. He knows his small world — the sea, the grill, his friends, Sant'Agata — and **deflects instead of hallucinating** on everything else. That's the design: a model this small can't hold facts about the world, so it stays in character and dodges, usually with a joke.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
noFFENSE/gpt2-355M-function-calling,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"GPT-2 medium (355M) **implemented from scratch in PyTorch** — the architecture, weight loading from OpenAI's original TensorFlow checkpoints, training loop, and evaluation harness are all hand-written (no `transformers`, no PEFT) — and fine-tuned for one epoch on the full dataset (112,960 dialogs, Kaggle T4, ~9.4 h).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Debarun12/tinytalk-124m,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,language: en license: mit library_name: pytorch tags: - text-generation - conversational - transformer - lora - from-scratch - pytorch pipeline_tag: text-generation,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
KRadim/nano-unet-diffusion-mnist,0,0,mit,,,false,"A tiny, from-scratch DDPM-style diffusion model trained on MNIST, built with **JAX** and **Flax NNX**. The model is an optimized conditional U-Net (`RealNanoUNet`) that predicts the clean image from a noisy input, conditioned on a sinusoidally embedded noise level.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
haykgrigorian/TimeCapsuleLLM-English-1800-1875-v3mini-eval1-500M,0,12,apache-2.0,,,false,"**v3 mini-eval** model, trained from scratch on a ~20GB (5B-token) sample of 1800–1875 English texts using a Llama-based Causal Language Model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
moche-ai/moche-tokenizer-ko-en-64k,0,0,mit,,,false,"<div align=""center"">",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sergeymanevitch/tiny-llm-27m,0,0,mit,,,false,"A complete modern LLM pipeline built by hand as a learning mission — every stage written from scratch in readable PyTorch (no HF Transformers, no external tokenizer), trained on free Colab T4 and a Mac CPU.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jessholbrook/deepsky-128px,0,0,cc-by-4.0,,,false,"A **from-scratch** denoising diffusion probabilistic model (DDPM) that unconditionally generates 128×128 deep-sky astronomical images — nebulae, galaxies, and star clusters. Every pixel is generated; nothing is retrieved or composited.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
JohnEnev/modern-llm-v2-base,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A ~315M-parameter decoder-only transformer, modernized from V1 and trained from scratch in raw PyTorch (no Hugging Face Trainer). This is the **base pretrained model** (EMA weights): fluent English completion, not instruction-tuned. It completes text; it does not follow instructions.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
JohnEnev/modern-llm-v2-sft,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The V2 base model after supervised fine-tuning. Follows simple instructions in the format it was trained on. See Part 3 of the series for the SFT setup.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
JohnEnev/modern-llm-v2-grpo,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,The V2 SFT model further trained with GRPO (Group Relative Policy Optimization). The reward optimized for a percentage-correct signal (see the checkpoint path). See Part 3 for the RL setup.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
disco-jack-basement/letterpress,0,1,mit,,,false,"The trained checkpoints of [letterpress](https://github.com/Novotarskyi/letterpress), a character-level GPT built from scratch in PyTorch (following Karpathy's ""Let's build GPT"" lecture) and trained on nested tiers of a public-domain book corpus. These are **base models**: they continue text in the style of the books they read, one character at a time - they are not chatbots and do not follow instructions.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
yasalma/TATlit,0,0,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,false,"TATlit is a 478M-parameter, from-scratch base language model for literary Tatar (ISO 639-3 `tat`), a Qypchaq Turkic language written in Cyrillic. It is trained without adapting any English- or Russian-dominant base, so that it produces native Tatar morphosyntax by default rather than acting as a translation layer over a dominant language. This is a base model, not instruction-tuned.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RaiRamones/indomla-512,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"An experimental Indonesian decoder-only language model trained **from scratch** on a single consumer GPU, including its tokenizer.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
puranikyashaswinsharma/reex-1,0,0,mit,,,false,"A ~116M parameter decoder-only transformer, pretrained and chat-tuned from scratch on free compute. This is my first from-scratch language model, trained, debugged, and released end-to-end as a learning project and a base for future mechanistic interpretability work.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Tgergerbhrc/ethonbrain-288m-block512,0,0,mit,,,false,ゼロから学習した小型日本語GPT系デコーダオンリーTransformer(288Mパラメータ)。 コードとトークナイザ・学習/推論パイプラインは GitHub で公開しています: **https://github.com/takuyaetwifo/ethonbrain-oss**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
4rah/Beneth-53M-v34,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Model bahasa 53 juta parameter, dilatih dari nol (from scratch) — bukan fine-tune dari model manapun.** Dibangun, dilatih, dan dihidupkan kembali sepenuhnya di Google Colab free tier oleh satu orang: Beny Pratama Putra (""Sang Arsitek"").",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kevinindustries/kevin-k2,0,2,mit,,,false,"A decoder-only transformer built entirely from scratch — every forward and backward pass derived and coded by hand, with no autograd, no PyTorch, no HuggingFace `transformers`. Implemented twice: once in NumPy, once in CUDA/C++ (this checkpoint is from the CUDA trainer).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
karthik-2905/model-a-scratch,0,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,"A **3.87M-parameter** decoder-only language model built **entirely from scratch in pure NumPy** — no PyTorch, no JAX, no autograd library. Custom reverse-mode autograd, tokenizer, training loop, KV-cache, and sampler are all hand-written. Optional CuPy backend swap (`ZYN_BACKEND=cuda`) for GPU training.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
an6308a/mini-transformer-tinystories,0,0,mit,,,false,"A decoder-only transformer built entirely from first principles in PyTorch, no pre-built attention layers, no HuggingFace Transformers library internals. Every component (multi-head self-attention, positional encoding, feedforward blocks, residual connections) is implemented from scratch and trained on the TinyStories dataset.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
kevinindustries/kevin-chat,0,0,mit,,,false,"A decoder-only transformer built entirely from scratch — every forward and backward pass derived and coded by hand, with no autograd, no PyTorch, no HuggingFace `transformers`. Implemented twice: once in NumPy, once in CUDA/C++ (this checkpoint is from the CUDA trainer).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
nursimakgul/turkce-bpe-tokenizer,0,0,mit,,,false,"Bu repo, sifirdan (from-scratch) yazdigim bir byte-level BPE (Byte-Pair Encoding) tokenizer'in ciktisini icerir. Egitim ve kod, Karpathy'nin [minbpe](https://github.com/karpathy/minbpe) reposundaki yaklasimi ve [HuggingFace LLM Course Chapter 6.5](https://huggingface.co/learn/llm-course/en/chapter6/5)'teki adim adim egitim algoritmasini temel aliyor.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jakequist/kanjiland-translation,0,0,mit,,,false,A **52.3M encoder-decoder Transformer built from scratch** in raw PyTorch (no HuggingFace `transformers` in the modeling path). Part of [**Kanjiland**](https://github.com/jakequist/kanjiland).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
IbrahimKhan7208/minillm-tinystories,0,0,mit,,,false,🚀 **[Try it live in a Space](https://huggingface.co/spaces/IbrahimKhan7208/minillm-tinystories-demo)**,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AakashakaAkku/vibe-check-sst2,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Vibe Check** is a compact (~2M parameter) Transformer text classifier that predicts whether a sentence is **Positive** or **Negative**. It was built **entirely from scratch** — my own word tokenizer and my own model architecture, trained from **random initialization** (no pretrained weights, no fine-tuning) on the public **Stanford Sentiment Treebank (SST-2)** dataset.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fractale-lm/Fractale-350M-base,0,6,mit,,,false,"<!-- Model card for Fractale-350M-base (phase-1 final, step 19600). Source of truth for claims: the paper (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21225721). The research log is an internal document and is not published. -->",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
plvictor/Theo-500M-Base,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"<p align=""center""> </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
plvictor/Theo-500M-Chat,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"<p align=""center""> </p>",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Sherwinroger002/Luna-0.1b-VL,0,0,mit,,,false,"This is a **124 Million parameter** Multimodal Vision-Language Model built from scratch. It extends the base text-only model by introducing a vision encoder and a learned projection layer, allowing it to perceive, understand, and reason about images.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AakashakaAkku/vibe-check-emotion,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"> 🔗 **Try the live app** — chat with Buddy & Wit and run a Vibe Check, nothing to install: > https://civilaakash.github.io/buddymini/",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sankath/LogSentry-LM,0,0,mit,,,false,"A small, from-scratch **GPT-style language model** trained on real server logs to (1) autoregressively complete log lines and (2) **detect anomalous log lines** by how ""surprised"" the model is by them (perplexity-based scoring).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
NeuralVerified/neural-physics-engine,0,0,mit,,,false,"**A projective-dynamics (PD) engine in which the per-element *local* constraint projections are learned neural networks, while rotations and the *global* solve stay exactly analytic.** One tiny network, shared across every element and across constraint *types* via material tokens, sits inside an exact reduced global solve.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
redredredredredred/slm-from-scratch-phase3-scaling,0,1,mit,,,false,"Three GPT-style language models, hand-written and trained from scratch in PyTorch on a single RTX 5070 Ti, produced by a controlled scaling-law experiment: same architecture family, varying only model size and tokens seen. No HuggingFace `transformers` model classes were used — every component (attention, MLP, blocks, embeddings, training loop) was hand-coded.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
UseItOrLoseIt/vae-vs-ddpm-celeba,0,0,mit,,,false,"Pretrained checkpoints for a from-scratch PyTorch **Variational Autoencoder (VAE)** and **Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Model (DDPM)**, both trained on 64×64 CelebA face crops as a head-to-head comparison of the two generative model families.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
TungChu/gpt2,0,0,mit,,,false,"Mô hình GPT-2 architecture (163M parameters) được **train từ đầu** (from scratch) bằng PyTorch thuần, trên dataset [TinyStories](https://huggingface.co/datasets/roneneldan/TinyStories). Đây là sản phẩm của dự án học tập [LEARN-LLM](https://github.com/Tung003/LEARN-LLM).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
itsraunak-work/axiomllm,0,0,mit,,,false,"A decoder-only transformer built from scratch in PyTorch around two design decisions: attention that caches a compressed latent instead of full-size keys and values, and a feed-forward layer that routes each token to a small subset of experts instead of running one dense MLP on every token. Full implementation and training code: [github.com/itsraunak-work/axiomllm](https://github.com/itsraunak-work/axiomllm).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
TyrkerS/handmadellm-30m,0,0,mit,,,false,"A **Llama-style decoder-only LLM built entirely from scratch** — own byte-level BPE tokenizer, RoPE + RMSNorm + grouped-query attention + SwiGLU, hand-written training loop. Trained on TinyStories on a single RTX 5070 Ti.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
TyrkerS/handmadellm-113m,0,0,mit,,,false,"A **Llama-style decoder-only LLM built entirely from scratch** — own byte-level BPE tokenizer, RoPE + RMSNorm + grouped-query attention + SwiGLU, hand-written training loop. Trained on TinyStories on a single RTX 5070 Ti.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
MixlyGames/PhiliaAuris-189M-Base,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"PhiliaAuris is a from-scratch speech-to-text audio encoder, developed as the STT branch of the Philia project by MixlyGames (OwlNestTeam).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
KRadim/conditional-medium-unet-tiny-imagenet,0,0,mit,,,false,"A class-conditional, from-scratch DDPM-style diffusion model trained on **Tiny ImageNet (64 X 64 X 3, 200 classes)**, built using **JAX** and **Flax NNX**. The model architecture (`ConditionalUNet`) predicts the clean image from a noisy input, conditioned simultaneously on a sinusoidally embedded continuous noise level and a class label embedding.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Abhisingh-18/SamanantarSetu-EN-HI,0,1,mit,,,false,"**""सेतु"" (Setu) = Bridge** — an English → Hindi neural machine translation model, built as a **Transformer trained completely from scratch** (no pretrained weights, no fine-tuning shortcuts) on the [AI4Bharat Samanantar](https://huggingface.co/datasets/ai4bharat/samanantar) parallel corpus.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
JohnEnev/modern-llm-v3-base,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 672M-parameter decoder-only transformer, built and trained from scratch in raw PyTorch (no Hugging Face Trainer). This is the **base (pretrained)** checkpoint.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
JohnEnev/modern-llm-v3-sft,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 672M-parameter decoder-only transformer, built and trained from scratch in raw PyTorch (no Hugging Face Trainer). This is the **SFT (instruction-tuned)** checkpoint.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
JohnEnev/modern-llm-v3-grpo,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A 672M-parameter decoder-only transformer, built and trained from scratch in raw PyTorch (no Hugging Face Trainer). This is the **GRPO (RL-trained)** checkpoint.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ARotting/snip-0.4m-story-lora,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,SNIP means **Small Neural Intelligence Prototype**. SNIP-0.4M is a deliberately tiny causal transformer designed to make the complete language-model lifecycle inspectable on ordinary hardware.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ARotting/snip-0.4m-grpo-logic,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,SNIP means **Small Neural Intelligence Prototype**. SNIP-0.4M is a deliberately tiny causal transformer designed to make the complete language-model lifecycle inspectable on ordinary hardware.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ARotting/snip-0.4m-logic-sft,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,SNIP means **Small Neural Intelligence Prototype**. SNIP-0.4M is a deliberately tiny causal transformer designed to make the complete language-model lifecycle inspectable on ordinary hardware.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ARotting/protocol-guardian,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,Protocol Guardian is a tiny BERT-compatible classifier trained from scratch to rank industrial-control commands as routine or hazardous. It uses SNIP's 512-token byte-level BPE vocabulary but does not inherit language-model weights.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Abhisingh-18/ShrutamMT-v1,0,1,mit,,,false,"**""श्रुतम्"" (Shrutam) = ""that which is heard""** — a multilingual **11 Indic languages → English** neural machine translation model, built as a **Transformer trained completely from scratch** (no pretrained weights, no fine-tuning shortcuts) on the [AI4Bharat Samanantar](https://huggingface.co/datasets/ai4bharat/samanantar) parallel corpus.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
bishnoiyash/SmolLM2-135M-reproduction,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A single-file PyTorch reimplementation of HuggingFaceTB/SmolLM2-135M, written from the architecture up and checked against the official Hugging Face weights.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
bishnoiyash/Qwen3-0.6B-reproduction,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A single-file PyTorch reimplementation of Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B-Base, written from a blank file and checked against the official Hugging Face weights.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
VijayShinde1996/VRS-Foundation-LLM,0,1,mit,,,false,"A ~28M-parameter, Qwen3-style decoder-only language model **trained entirely from scratch on a single 8 GB laptop GPU**, plus its fine-tuned variants. Small, fully open, and designed so you can actually understand and run every piece.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mikahniehaus/Tern,0,0,mit,,,false,"A GPT-2 small architecture language model, **trained entirely from random initialization** on a single consumer GPU (RTX 4070 SUPER, 12GB VRAM) — no pretrained weights anywhere in this checkpoint's lineage. This is the fine-tuned checkpoint (base pretraining + SFT), the one meant to actually be talked to.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
prplguyy/ru-en-transformer,0,1,mit,,,false,"A compact **encoder–decoder Transformer trained from scratch** (no pretrained weights) for Russian→English translation. Built as a learning project — the tokenizer, model, training loop, and beam-search decoding are all hand-written.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sur950/tinystories-slm,0,0,mit,,,false,"A ~12.4M-parameter decoder-only transformer, **written from scratch** — no `transformers`, no `tokenizers`, no `lightning`. Tokenizer, model, training loop, and sampler are all hand-written PyTorch. Full source, training logs, and design writeup: **[github.com/sur950/tinystories-slm](https://github.com/sur950/tinystories-slm)**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
fillay/LWT-80M,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"An 80M-parameter language model written from scratch in Rust and HIP — no PyTorch, no JAX, no ML framework of any kind. Every matrix multiply goes through hipBLAS; everything else is a hand-written GPU kernel. Trained on a single AMD Strix Halo APU (gfx1151, RDNA 3.5).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
hasyarshad/roman-urdu-translator,0,0,mit,,,false,"The trained weights for an 81M-parameter encoder–decoder transformer written from primitives in PyTorch — no `nn.Transformer`, no `AutoModel`, no training framework.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
amanm10000/chessllm,0,0,mit,,,false,"A decoder-only transformer trained from scratch on Lichess games written in SAN notation. It has never seen a board: no FEN, no piece list, no legal-move generator. It reads the text of a game and predicts the characters that come next. Everything it does with chess it inferred from move notation alone.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
amanm10000/minillm,0,0,mit,,,false,"A Llama-3-shaped decoder-only language model trained from scratch on FineWeb-Edu, on a single **RTX 4060 Laptop (8GB)**. No distillation, no pretrained weights, no fine-tuning off someone else's base model — tokenizer, data pipeline, architecture, and training loop are all in the repo.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
lattice-research/lattice-quark-1.5b,0,0,mit,,,false,"A 1.5B-parameter decoder-only language model **trained from scratch** by [Lattice](https://lattice-site-lime.vercel.app) — no pretrained weights used. Pretrained on consumer hardware (RTX 5090), then instruction-tuned.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dangeA/mpu-30m-base,0,1,mit,,,false,"**mpu-30m** is a 30.3M-parameter GPT-style language model trained from scratch on 400M tokens of [TinyStories](https://huggingface.co/datasets/roneneldan/TinyStories). It is the first model in the **mpu** series and the proof-of-concept run for an elastic, checkpoint-driven training platform that migrates a single training job across free and disposable GPU sessions (Colab/Kaggle) without losing progress.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
BallerKnowledge/koachie-312m,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Koachie is a 312M-parameter GPT-style language model built entirely from scratch by [Baller Knowledge](https://koachiefitai.co.uk) in Glasgow, Scotland — own tokenizer, own architecture implementation, own training loop. It is not a fine-tune of any existing model and no external model's weights were used at any point.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
akshay0689/nlemon-14,0,0,mit,,,false,"**nLemon-14-sft** · a 13.8M-parameter decoder-only transformer, pretrained from scratch and instruction-tuned, on one 4 GB laptop GPU. *""Born to speak, disciplined to behave.""*",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a1-c1,0,0,mit,,,false,base: sinusoidal + MHA + LayerNorm + subword,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a1-c2,0,0,mit,,,false,positional encoding: sinusoidal -> RoPE,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a1-c3,0,0,mit,,,false,"attention: MHA -> grouped-query (8 query heads, 2 KV groups)",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a1-c4,0,0,mit,,,false,normalization: LayerNorm -> RMSNorm,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a1-c5,0,0,mit,,,false,tokenization: subword -> token-free BLT (raw bytes + patches),yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sanhuo11/BeginVLA-12M,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"BeginVLA-12M is the project-owned model from [Begin with VLA](https://github.com/tlysanhuo/begin-with-vla). Its vision encoder, byte-level language encoder, multimodal fusion stack, and flow-matching action decoder are implemented in the repository and trained end to end from random initialization.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SBDO1/SBD_o1,0,1,mit,,,false,"A 355M parameter GPT-2 model, built from scratch in PyTorch following Sebastian Raschka's [Build a Large Language Model (From Scratch)](https://github.com/rasbt/LLMs-from-scratch), starting from OpenAI's pretrained GPT-4 medium weights and instruction fine-tuned on the [Stanford Alpaca dataset](https://github.com/tatsu-lab/stanford_alpaca) (52k instruction/response pairs).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Arihant25/anlp-a1-transformer-ablations,0,0,mit,,,false,"Encoder-decoder Transformers built **from scratch** in PyTorch (no `nn.Transformer`, no `nn.MultiheadAttention`, no fused SDPA), trained to decrypt binary cipher sequences into English plaintext, with a controlled five-configuration ablation study. The BPE tokenizer is also implemented from scratch, with no tokenizer library.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RDTvlokip/RDTChess,0,2,apache-2.0,,,false,"<style> /* width et border-collapse sont AUSSI en inline sur chaque table, et ce n'est pas une redondance: la feuille du site cible ses tables avec une specificite superieure a une simple classe, donc une largeur declaree ici seule se fait ecraser et la table se retracte sur son contenu en laissant un vide a droite. L'inline, lui, gagne toujours.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
RaiRamones/indomla-1024,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,**IndoMLA-1024** is an experimental Indonesian decoder-only causal language model trained **from scratch** using an **MLA-inspired low-rank key/value attention mechanism**.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
yadavkapil7155/nexa-smallgpt,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"A GPT-style autoregressive language model built entirely from scratch in PyTorch - no `AutoModelForCausalLM`, no `GPT2LMHeadModel`, no pretrained Transformer implementation. Every component (causal self-attention, grouped-query attention, transformer decoder blocks, training loop) is hand-written and independently verified.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ayushmaninbox/artificial-stupidity-tiny,0,1,mit,,,false,"Six character-level language models **built from scratch** — no GPT-2, no pretrained anything — that are identical in every respect except **how many bits each weight is allowed**. The smallest is **83 KB**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ayushmaninbox/artificial-stupidity-image,0,1,mit,,,false,"A text-to-image latent diffusion model trained **entirely from scratch** on a laptop. No Stable Diffusion, no CLIP, no pretrained weights of any kind.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
avi1o1/anlp-a1,0,0,mit,,,false,"This repo hosts the model checkpoints for a from-scratch (no `nn.Transformer` / `nn.MultiheadAttention`) sequence-to-sequence Transformer trained to decode a binary-cipher → plaintext mapping derived from the Brown corpus, across a 5-way architectural ablation (**C1–C5**).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
euclidstellar/tinystories-1bit-llm,0,1,mit,,,false,"An **11,159,360-parameter BitNet b1.58 language model built from scratch** — no `nn.Transformer`, no pretrained weights, no fine-tuning. Trained on a free Kaggle T4.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
OliverSundaram/MoE-Study,0,1,mit,,,false,"Two decoder-only language models trained **from scratch** under identical conditions, differing in exactly one thing: whether the feed-forward block is a **dense MLP** or a **sparse top-2-of-4 MoE**.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
aijadugar/qwen2.5-0.5b-sql-lora,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"This model is `Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct` fine-tuned on a small slice of `b-mc2/sql-create-context` using a **LoRA adapter implemented from scratch in plain PyTorch** (no `peft` library was used for training -- see the `LoRALinear` class in the training notebook), then merged back into the base weights.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
open-source-dimas/modelo-jogo-velha-zero,0,0,mit,,,false,"Este é um pequeno modelo causal treinado a partir de pesos aleatórios para responder a pedidos de geração de código web, com foco em um jogo simples da velha. Ele não usa Qwen, Llama, GPT ou qualquer peso pré-treinado. O tokenizer também foi treinado localmente.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
00x61/uyum-v3,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Türkçe için sıfırdan eğitilmiş bir dil modeli.** Hazır bir model ince ayarlanmadı — tokenizer, mimari, eğitim döngüsü ve değerlendirme seti baştan yazıldı.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
YMmim/faster-rcnn-voc-scratch,0,0,mit,,,false,"torchvision의 완성된 탐지기(`fasterrcnn_resnet50_fpn`)를 쓰지 않고, **Faster R-CNN의 핵심 구성요소를 밑바닥부터 직접 구현**하여 원리를 학습하기 위한 저장소입니다. 학습 + 평가(mAP) + 추론 전체 파이프라인을 포함합니다.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
YMmim/object-detection-scratch,0,0,mit,,,false,"객체탐지를 **밑바닥부터 직접 구현**(Faster R-CNN)하고, 이를 실무 표준인 **YOLO와 비교**하며 학습하는 교육용 저장소입니다. 2-stage 탐지기의 내부 원리를 손으로 구현해보고, 1-stage 탐지기(YOLO)와 결과·철학을 대조합니다.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AuthRan/AshuGPT-124M-base,0,0,mit,,,false,"The **base** checkpoint of [AshuGPT](https://github.com/AuthRan/AuthLLM) — a decoder-only transformer written from scratch in PyTorch, with no `transformers`, no `AutoModel`, and no `Trainer`.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
rasa04/tinylm-1m,0,0,mit,,,false,"Языковая модель на **1.22M параметров** (1.09M без эмбеддингов), обученная с нуля на одной RTX 5090. Младшая сестра [TinyLM-11M](https://huggingface.co/rasa04/tinylm-11m).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
jmarc1499/light,0,0,mit,,,false,Modelo entrenado con el proyecto [light](https://github.com/jmarc9901/light).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
adyoi/indigo.tf,0,0,mit,,,false,Versi **TensorFlow/Keras** dari proyek [Indigo](https://huggingface.co/adyoi/indigo) — model bahasa GPT kecil yang dibangun dari nol (tanpa library `transformers`).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
simak31/tinyzero-countdown-19m,0,0,mit,,,false,"A ~18.9M-parameter decoder-only transformer, pretrained from scratch and post-trained with GRPO (Group Relative Policy Optimization) to solve Countdown-style arithmetic puzzles: given a set of numbers and a target, find an equation using each number exactly once that reaches the target.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
NethranjaliSE/Pali_Sinhala_From_Scratch,0,0,mit,,,false,"An encoder–decoder Transformer implemented **from scratch** in PyTorch — no `nn.Transformer`, no pretrained weights — for Pāli → Sinhala translation. Both languages are written in Sinhala script in this corpus, so a single shared subword vocabulary is used and the embeddings are tied across the encoder, decoder and output projection.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ye476/mini-llm-132m,0,0,mit,,,false,"A 132M-parameter decoder-only transformer trained from scratch — tokenizer, data pipeline, model, and training loop all written by hand, with no `transformers` and no `tiktoken`. Source: [FengYe476/mini-LLM](https://github.com/FengYe476/mini-LLM).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
omurberaisik/NoTokenLM-MicroGen,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"<div align=""center"">",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
adimunot/transformer-from-scratch,0,0,mit,,,false,"Weights for [github.com/adimunot21/transformer-from-scratch](https://github.com/adimunot21/transformer-from-scratch), a decoder-only Transformer built from first principles in PyTorch — attention, multi-head projections, positional encoding, blocks and training loop written by hand, plus a BPE tokenizer also implemented from scratch.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
adimunot/diffusion-from-scratch,0,0,mit,,,false,"Weights for [github.com/adimunot21/diffusion-from-scratch](https://github.com/adimunot21/diffusion-from-scratch), a DDPM/DDIM implementation written from scratch in PyTorch — forward process, noise schedules, U-Net denoiser, samplers and classifier-free guidance, no diffusers dependency.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mohjkhan/anlp-a1-transformers,0,0,mit,,,false,"Custom encoder–decoder Transformer built from fundamental PyTorch ops (no `nn.Transformer` / `nn.MultiheadAttention`) for a repeating-XOR cipher → plaintext decryption task, plus an ablation over five configurations:",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Viv0605101/anlp-a1-transformer-blt-ablation,0,0,mit,,,false,"Encoder–decoder Transformers built from scratch in PyTorch (no `nn.Transformer`, no `nn.MultiheadAttention`) for the task of mapping **encrypted binary sequences to plaintext**, plus a controlled five-way architectural ablation.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
samvaran/2025801013_anlp_assignment1,0,0,mit,,,false,"Encoder–decoder transformers built from fundamental PyTorch operations (no `nn.Transformer`, no `nn.MultiheadAttention`) for ANLP Assignment 1.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
SparksLyse-Community/SparksLyse-336M-old,0,6,apache-2.0,,,false,Modèle de langage causal (decoder-only) entraîné from scratch.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a1-c5_fixed,0,0,mit,,,false,C5 variant: token-free BLT with fixed-width patches instead of entropy,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mdhvm/anlp-m26-a1-cipher-transformers,0,0,mit,,,false,"Checkpoints for **Advanced NLP Assignment 1** — An encoder–decoder Transformer, written from elementary PyTorch operations, is trained to recover plaintext from a repeating-key XOR cipher. Five configurations differ from the base model in exactly one component each — rotary positions, grouped-query attention, RMSNorm, and a token-free Byte Latent Transformer with entropy-based dynamic patching — and are compared at an identical step budget over three seeds.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
JBalwaySUS/anlp-a1-transformer-ablation,0,0,mit,,,false,"Encoder–decoder Transformers built from basic PyTorch operations (no `nn.Transformer` or `nn.MultiheadAttention`), trained to map encrypted binary sequences to plaintext. C2–C5 each change exactly one component from the C1 base.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
sahoosk/anlp-a1-transformer-blt-ablation,0,0,mit,,,false,"Five architectural configurations of an encoder–decoder Transformer built from scratch (no `nn.Transformer` / `nn.MultiheadAttention`), evaluated on a character-level decipherment task. Each of C2–C5 changes exactly one component from the C1 base so the effect of each change can be measured in isolation.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
skimo2022/anlp-a1-transformers,0,1,mit,,,false,"Encoder–decoder Transformers built from scratch in PyTorch (no `nn.Transformer`, no `nn.MultiheadAttention`) for the task of mapping **encrypted binary sequences to plaintext**, plus a controlled five-way architectural ablation.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
VenyaVel/anlp-a1-transformers-blt,0,0,mit,,,false,"Custom Encoder-Decoder Transformer checkpoints for a controlled 5-config architectural ablation study, trained from scratch (no `nn.Transformer` / `nn.MultiheadAttention`) on an encrypted-binary-to-plaintext sequence-to-sequence task. Task: IIIT-H Advanced NLP, Assignment 1.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
aadith-warrier/anlp-a1-cipher-transformer,0,1,mit,,,false,Encoder-decoder Transformers built from scratch (no `nn.Transformer` or `nn.MultiheadAttention`) that decrypt a position-periodic substitution cipher back to English. Five configurations differing from the C1 base by exactly one component each.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mgbao/envi-nmt-scratch-transformer,0,0,mit,,,false,"Đồ án môn học. **Toàn bộ kiến trúc do nhóm tự cài bằng PyTorch thuần** — không dùng `nn.Transformer`, `nn.MultiheadAttention`, `F.scaled_dot_product_attention`, `nn.LayerNorm` hay `nn.RMSNorm`.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Aleksander22/Koliber-v1.0-Base-copy,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,**Koliber v1.0 Base** is a compact Polish decoder-only causal language model developed by **OrisTeam** and trained from scratch.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
hardik300/LMA_mini_project,0,0,mit,,,false,"Ten checkpoints from five independently pretrained decoder-only Transformers, written from scratch in PyTorch (no `nn.Transformer*`, no HuggingFace model classes, no pre-built attention). Each model is ~25M parameters, trained for one epoch over its own monolingual corpus.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Prateek-Tiwari10/LMA_phase2,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"Decoder-only Transformers trained **from scratch** on Hindi and Nepali, on corpora collected and cleaned for this project. No pretrained weights were used, and the two languages share no data, no vocabulary and no parameters — only the model code and the training recipe.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
bardiaegz/gpt2-124m-fineweb,0,0,mit,,,false,"GPT-2 124M pretrained from scratch on FineWeb-Edu, then supervised fine-tuned for instruction following. Trained on a single rented RTX 4090 for about $6.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
manyajain111/lma-phase2,0,0,mit,,,false,Pretrained decoder-only Transformer language models (~24.2M parameters each) built and trained from scratch in PyTorch without third-party framework abstractions.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mixailplastinin/llm-from-scratch-1b,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,GPT-style decoder-only transformer trained from scratch with custom framework.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
NathanielArfin/gpt-hansard-11m,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"A GPT trained **from scratch** on the official Debates (Hansard) of the House of Commons of Canada, 2006–2026. The tokenizer, the weights, and the training stack all start from zero.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a2-part1-dense,0,0,mit,,,false,Decoder-only transformer with dense two-layer MLP feed-forward (the baseline).,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a2-part2-adamw,0,0,mit,,,false,"Decoder-only transformer with AdamW, implemented from scratch.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a2-part2-mars,0,0,mit,,,false,"Decoder-only transformer with MARS (variance-reduced AdamW variant), implemented from scratch.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a2-part1-moe_4e1a,0,0,mit,,,false,"Decoder-only transformer with Mixture-of-Experts feed-forward, 4 experts, top-1 routing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a2-part2-lion,0,0,mit,,,false,"Decoder-only transformer with Lion (memory-efficient sign momentum), implemented from scratch.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a2-part1-moe_4e2a,0,0,mit,,,false,"Decoder-only transformer with Mixture-of-Experts feed-forward, 4 experts, top-2 routing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a2-part2-muon,0,0,mit,,,false,"Decoder-only transformer with Muon (matrix-based, Newton-Schulz orthogonalised momentum), implemented from scratch.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a2-part1-moe_shared,0,0,mit,,,false,"Decoder-only transformer with 1 shared expert always active plus 3 routed experts, top-1 routing.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a2-part2-sophia,0,0,mit,,,false,"Decoder-only transformer with Sophia-G (Hessian-based, clipped diagonal preconditioner), implemented from scratch.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
neemon/anlp-a2-part1-moe_active_matched,0,0,mit,,,false,"Decoder-only transformer with Mixture-of-Experts, 4 experts, top-2 routing, active parameters matched to the dense baseline.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
mxv456/klitzeklein-europarl-translator,0,0,mit,,,false,"*klitzeklein* (German): teeny-tiny. Four transformer translators of 23–25M parameters, trained **from scratch** on Europarl on a single RTX 3060, from the research repo **https://github.com/Marvel4U/klitzeklein-europarl-translator** — a systematic small-scale comparison of specialization vs. general pretraining, encoder-decoder vs. decoder-only, language direction and architecture. Read the repo README for the full results, findings and limitations; this card documents the weights.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
plimb/gladios-0.3b-eng-prototype,0,2,mit,,,false,"<div align=""center"">",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
oli-mebberson/lattice-cadence,0,1,cc-by-4.0,,,false,"Cadence is a 26M-parameter decoder-only transformer, trained from scratch on MIDI music. Given a short text prompt (tempo, time signature, instrument), it composes original multi-track MIDI under a grammar-constrained sampler that keeps every generation structurally valid.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
javimosch/mtlm-7m-base,0,0,mit,,,false,"**MTLM** (machin tiny language model) is an experiment in building an LLM with no ML framework at all: the tokenizer training, the pretraining loop (AdamW, RoPE, RMSNorm, SwiGLU, tied embeddings), the int8 export and the inference server are all written in [machin](https://github.com/javimosch/machin) (MFL, a machine-first language that compiles to C), and the whole thing was trained on a 6-core CPU shared with other services.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
KrynexLabs/KrynexAI-vNS-Overfitting-Mobile-TFLite,0,2,mit,,,false,**KrynexAI** is a GPT-style language model written **from scratch in pure NumPy**. No PyTorch. No TensorFlow. No datasets. No common sense.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
huangyusi/MiniSystemOne,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"**Train a probabilistic decision model from scratch — no LLM, no decoding, no JSON generation.**",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Dhevenddra/slm-lab-base-15m,0,0,mit,,,false,"A **12,587,904-parameter** decoder-only transformer, trained from scratch on TinyStories on a free Colab T4 — this repo is the pretrained base model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ianaldenjones/notes-you-cant-delete,0,1,mit,,,false,"Small from-scratch symbolic-music transformers from the study **[Notes You Can't Delete](https://notes-you-cant-delete.vercel.app)**: take a musical idea out of *everything* a model is trained on, and it rebuilds the idea anyway.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
eakeakxandro/Lucky-Paud-13M-indonesia,0,0,mit,,,false,"Model bahasa 13 juta parameter, decoder-only GPT-style, dilatih dari nol (bukan fine-tune) untuk bahasa Indonesia. Dibangun solo sebagai proyek belajar: tokenizer, korpus, dan training loop semuanya ditulis dan dijalankan sendiri di Kaggle (GPU T4, gratis).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
umutonuryasar/microclip-checkpoints,0,0,mit,,,false,"Every trained checkpoint behind the results in [github.com/umutonuryasar/microclip](https://github.com/umutonuryasar/microclip): a CLIP-style image–text model built from scratch on a single-GPU budget, used to test whether SigLIP's sigmoid loss keeps its small-batch advantage over softmax (InfoNCE) at small scale. At this scale it does not: softmax matched or beat sigmoid at every batch size from 128 to 512.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Compactbot/logo-gan,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A small **DCGAN** trained **from scratch** to generate 64×64 company-logo-style images. Trained on 1,500 real logos resized to 64×64×3.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Circuits-V2/Meridian-Mini,0,0,mit,,,false,> **Status: training in progress.** Weights will be uploaded when the run finishes. This card describes the plan and will be updated with results.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
AkkiMaharaj/slm-30m-base,0,0,mit,,,false,"A 30M-parameter decoder-only GPT model, built and pretrained entirely from scratch as a personal learning project to understand how language models work under the hood — not intended for production use.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
FrameXlabs/fragment-2,0,1,apache-2.0,,,false,"A **36.3M-parameter System-One decision model**, built by FrameXlabs on the original fragment build and trained **entirely from scratch** — own BPE tokenizer, own encoder, own RLCD loop. No pretrained weights, no fine-tune of Laya or any other model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
ParallaxOpen/ParallaxOpen,0,0,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,false,A collection of small language models trained from scratch on consumer hardware.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
asikrshoudo/demo-ai,0,1,mit,,,false,"A tiny GPT-style language model, built completely from scratch — no pretrained weights, and no external AI API involved anywhere in the model itself. This is a personal project to understand how a language model actually works under the hood: tokenization, attention, backpropagation, training loops, checkpointing, all of it implemented and trained from zero.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
yoshio-aono/a-gpt,0,0,cc-by-sa-4.0,,,false,"**A-GPTプロジェクト**は、LLM の仕組みを、最小のモデル(モデル1。重み1,361個)から 約10億パラメータ(モデル10。約10億7千万個)まで、AI と一緒に、自分の手で順番に作って確かめる、学習用のプロジェクトです。 Transformer の計算・BPE のトークナイザー・学習の仕組みは、既製のモデルを使わず一から作成しています (学習は、モデル9までは Mac の GPU(MLX)、モデル10はクラウドの GPU(NVIDIA B200、PyTorch))。",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
dharandhamo/Forge-20M,0,0,mit,,,false,"A 20.75M parameter, GPT-2-style decoder-only transformer, architected and trained completely from scratch — no pretrained weights, no fine-tuning of an existing model. Trained end-to-end on a single NVIDIA T4 GPU (Kaggle, free tier).",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Skywalker1910/BB8,0,0,mit,,,false,"A GPT-style decoder-only Transformer implemented from scratch in PyTorch, plus LoRA fine-tuning experiments on pretrained Qwen models. This is a graduate-level learning project exploring LLM internals across 11 experiments.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Compactbot/logo-gan-3.5m,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"A small **Deep Convolutional GAN** trained **from scratch** to generate 64×64 logo-like images. This is the deliverable for (CompactAI: ""a small model that generates logo-like images"").",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
quachtohai/mini-code-generator-v7.3,0,0,mit,,,false,A small **Python code-generation model trained entirely from scratch** in PyTorch.,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
d0mzw/pvml-tinystories,0,0,mit,,,false,"Six small transformers trained from scratch on TinyStories, on one machine.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Bayernator/horst-ai,0,0,apache-2.0,,,false,"HORST ist ein Encoder-Decoder-Transformer (**209 Mio. Parameter**), der deutsche Texte korrigiert: Rechtschreibung, Groß-/Kleinschreibung, Kommas und einfache Grammatikfehler. Das Modell ist **komplett von Grund auf trainiert**. Es gibt kein Fine-Tuning und keine vortrainierten Gewichte oder Tokenizer anderer Modelle.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
hkabhimanyu/microlm-shakespeare-1.8m,0,0,mit,,,false,"A custom, character-level causal Transformer trained entirely from scratch on CPU using pure PyTorch.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Juanillaberia/TinyForge-60M,0,0,mit,,,false,"TinyForge-60M is a 60M-parameter decoder-only transformer, pretrained from scratch on ~2.5B tokens of FineWeb-Edu. It's a base (non-instruction-tuned) model: the next release, `TinyForge-60M-Instruct`, adds SFT on top of this checkpoint.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Dhevenddra/slm-lab-chat-15m,0,0,mit,,,false,"A **12,587,904-parameter** decoder-only transformer, trained from scratch on TinyStories on a free Colab T4 — this repo is the mid-trained model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Dhevenddra/slm-lab-sft-15m,0,0,mit,,,false,"A **12,587,904-parameter** decoder-only transformer, trained from scratch on TinyStories on a free Colab T4 — this repo is the instruction-tuned model.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
lea97338/LouV1GPU,0,0,mit,,,false,"T2I diffusion from scratch (VAE+UNet+DDIM, torch pur). Texte = openai/clip-vit-base-patch32 gele + projection. Dataset diffusers/pokemon-gpt4-captions. Res 64->2048. Classe Lou: train/generate/display/push.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
txktxkabcd/fahqgpt-rag,0,0,mit,,,false,> 这是让 **FahQgpt 1.0 Nano**（145.9M 参数，从零训练）能可靠回答问题的完整方案。 > 裸模型单独用只有约 **23%** 的日常问题能答对；加上这套架构后， > 测试集里 **16/16 全对**。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
Viv0605101/anlp-a2-part1-moe,0,0,mit,,,false,"Five decoder-only transformers trained from scratch on for vi->en and ja->en translation, each on the same 30,000,842-token stream. The runs differ **only** in the feed-forward block: variants 1-4 share a total parameter budget and variant 5 matches the dense baseline's *active* parameter count.",yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
hotsteel09/small_llm_O1,0,0,mit,,,false,一个用 PyTorch 从零实现、从零训练的中文对话语言模型。没有使用任何预训练权重——所有参数都是在这台机器的 CPU 上，从随机初始化开始训练出来的。,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag
