dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-Nemotron-12B-Instruct-GGUF,3500,8,other,nvidia-open-model-license,https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/agreements/enterprise-software/nvidia-open-model-license/,false,"Dicta-LM 3.0 is a powerful open-weight collection of LLMs, trained on extensive corpora of Hebrew and English texts. The models are available for download and for unlimited use. The models set a new SOTA for their weight-class for Hebrew, both as base models and chat models.",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
