nvidia/c-foundationstereo-s,2496,11,other,nvidia-open-model-license,https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/agreements/enterprise-software/nvidia-open-model-license/,false,[FoundationStereo](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2501.09898) is a foundation model developed by NVIDIA Research for Stereo Depth Estimation. The model takes as input an RGB stereo-image pair and outputs an accurate disparity map. The model was designed to achieve strong zero-shot generalization and has been shown to generalize to various scenarios with wide zero-shot coverage.,noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
