Atharva31/indicslm-from-scratch,293,0,,,,false,"A ~22M-parameter decoder-only transformer built **fully from scratch** — no HF `Trainer`, no `tokenizers` library, no library RoPE/RMSNorm/SwiGLU/attention implementations — for Indian government/legal-domain Q&A (RTI Act 2005, Consumer Protection Act 2019, myscheme.gov.in scheme eligibility) in English, Hindi, and Marathi. This is a portfolio/applied-research project demonstrating an end-to-end LLM pipeline (tokenizer → architecture → pretraining → SFT → DPO) at small scale on free-tier compute (Kaggle T4s), **not a production information source.**",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
