d0rj/q-prefixlm-51M-base,259,0,,,,false,"A **50,866,688-parameter** English base model trained from random initialization in the [Tiny llm ablation](https://huggingface.co/collections/d0rj/tiny-llm-ablation-6aafca336122dd2c2868f923) experiment.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
mssfj/qwen25-0.5b-finemath-4plus-lit,256,0,,,,false,"The LitGPT-format export of a baseline model for TDT comparison experiments, trained on FineWeb-Edu and then FineMath-4plus. It contains the same weights as the Transformers-format model.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Huypero/AgentContentVietnamese-110m,251,0,,,,false,"Base language model tiếng Việt, train từ đầu trên corpus báo chí tiếng Việt. Đây là bản **final**, đã hoàn thành một epoch tại bước **14,411**.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Mercity/pretrain-longcat-ngram-25pct,249,0,,,,false,"A ~1B-parameter Llama 3-style decoder that spends about 25% of its parameter budget on hashed n-gram embedding tables, following the [LongCat n-gram embedding module](https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.21204). To keep the total near 1B, it has 23 transformer layers instead of the [baseline's](https://huggingface.co/Mercity/pretrain-baseline-qknorm) 32. Everything else matches the baseline, including the 6B FineWeb training tokens.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
hsanyyasyn97gmail/cosmos-v2,248,0,,,,false,"Cosmos-v2 is a 2.1 billion parameter causal language model trained **from scratch**. It is based on a Qwen-like architecture and was developed over a period of 3 years through extensive experimentation (more than 116 training runs, of which 113 failed).",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
mradermacher/T1Alpen-240M-GGUF,247,0,,,,false,<!-- ### quantize_version: 2 --> <!-- ### output_tensor_quantised: 1 --> <!-- ### convert_type: hf --> <!-- ### vocab_type: --> <!-- ### tags: --> <!-- ### quants: x-f16 Q4_K_S Q2_K Q8_0 Q6_K Q3_K_M Q3_K_S Q3_K_L Q4_K_M Q5_K_S Q5_K_M IQ4_XS --> <!-- ### quants_skip: --> <!-- ### skip_mmproj: --> static quants of https://huggingface.co/Dl26/T1Alpen-240M,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
maf1oz1/llm-course-hw1-rope,247,0,,,,false,"Вариант модели из домашнего задания №1 курса по LLM (HSE), в котором позиционное кодирование **ALiBi заменено на Rotary Positional Embedding (RoPE)**. Всё остальное — архитектура, токенизатор, данные и гиперпараметры — совпадает с основной моделью: [maf1oz1/llm-course-hw1](https://huggingface.co/maf1oz1/llm-course-hw1).",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Mathieu680/Rastignac-1.0-126M,246,2,other,,,false,"Rastignac 1.0 est un modèle de langage causal français de **126 481 920 paramètres**, entraîné entièrement depuis zéro sur **3 348 livres de la littérature française**. La date de publication indiquée pour les œuvres datées est en moyenne d’environ **1898**. Le modèle est destiné à la complétion de texte : à partir d’un début de phrase ou de paragraphe, il génère la suite dans un registre français à dominante littéraire.",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
maf1oz1/llm-course-hw1-mla,246,0,,,,false,"Вариант модели из домашнего задания №1 курса по LLM (HSE), в котором Grouped-Query Attention **заменён на Multi-Head Latent Attention (MLA)** — механизм из DeepSeek-V2. Остальное — токенизатор, ALiBi, SwiGLU, данные и гиперпараметры — совпадает с основной моделью: [maf1oz1/llm-course-hw1](https://huggingface.co/maf1oz1/llm-course-hw1).",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
tensorblock/Qwen1.5-4B-GGUF,241,0,other,tongyi-qianwen-research,https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen1.5-4B/blob/main/LICENSE,false,"<div style=""width: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto""> </div>",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Mercity/pretrain-kda-1b,241,0,,,,false,"A dense ~1B-parameter Llama 3-style decoder where one attention layer in every four is Kimi Delta Attention (KDA), a linear-attention layer from [Kimi Linear](https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.26692). It is otherwise identical to the [QK-norm baseline](https://huggingface.co/Mercity/pretrain-baseline-qknorm) and was trained on the same 6B FineWeb tokens.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Mercity/pretrain-longcat-ngram-50pct,240,0,,,,false,"A ~1B-parameter Llama 3-style decoder that spends about 48% of its parameter budget on hashed n-gram embedding tables, following the [LongCat n-gram embedding module](https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.21204). To keep the total near 1B, it has 16 transformer layers instead of the [baseline's](https://huggingface.co/Mercity/pretrain-baseline-qknorm) 32. Everything else matches the baseline, including the 6B FineWeb training tokens.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
kurogane/pico-hiragana-4.0M-h256-l6-base-1BT,238,0,,,,false,共通仕様・Tokenizerの注意点・Transformersでの使用方法は [kurogane/pico-hiragana-3.8M-base-5BT](https://huggingface.co/kurogane/pico-hiragana-3.8M-base-5BT)を参照してください。 本モデルは別構成のチェックポイントです。既存3.8Mモデルの重みを変形したものではありません。,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
vaprooll/MiraLM-47M,235,0,,,,false,"A **47,640,968-parameter** hybrid language model trained **from scratch** — no pretrained weights, no distillation — under a hard 50,000,000 cap, on a single Tesla T4. Interleaved Mamba ∥ attention blocks (Jamba-style) with a sparse **top-2-of-8** mixture of experts whose router is domain-seeded by a guide loss.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Anurag9817/nepali-llama-590m-1.30b-tokens,232,0,,,,false,A 590M-parameter LLaMA-style causal language model trained from scratch and continued with additional English-language causal pretraining.,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
dicta-il/DictaLM-3.0-Nemotron-12B-Instruct-W4A16,230,0,other,nvidia-open-model-license,https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/agreements/enterprise-software/nvidia-open-model-license/,false,"Dicta-LM 3.0 is a powerful open-weight collection of LLMs, trained on extensive corpora of Hebrew and English texts. The models are available for download and for unlimited use. The models set a new SOTA for their weight-class for Hebrew, both as base models and chat models.",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
