Mercity/pretrain-baseline-qknorm,225,0,,,,false,A dense ~1B-parameter Llama 3-style decoder pretrained from scratch on 6B tokens of FineWeb. It is the reference model for our ablations of Kimi Delta Attention and LongCat n-gram embeddings: the other three checkpoints change one component and keep everything else identical to this one.,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
