zachwallace/bonsai-sapling-v1-290m-instruct,71,0,cc-by-sa-3.0,,,false,"Hi guys, I'm a high school student with a strong interest in AI and ML, and I wanted to create a model myself to better understand the process. This model is a 290 million parameter decoder-only transformer, and took around 30 days to pretrain on my Macbook Pro M5 Pro with 48GB of RAM. I wanted to make this project the most 'from scratch' as possible to do by myself, so the transformer, BPE tokenizer, data pipeline, and AdamW optimzer are all original implementations.",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
