geodesic-research/control-pretraining-30b-filtered-gpt55-4plus-v2-base,65,0,other,nvidia-open-model-license,,false,"The narrowly filtered arm's base model (V2): the Broadly Filtered arm's pretraining final (iteration 29881, 501.32B tokens on the `_filtered_mini_2plus` corpora) annealed through the same midtraining stage as the other arms, on corpora cut by the narrower rule: every document carrying a canary string or scored >= 4 by the GPT-5.5 judge, with every document the gpt-5-mini cost gate escalated actually judged (sudoers/control-pretraining-filter-annotated at revision 91f53004; no document unscored and none left unjudged). The corpora are the `_filtered_gpt55_4plus_v2` subsets of geodesic-research/control-pretraining-datasets at revision c6419e3cb7a083d2c22bc5f865d0e93dd50d61e3. It supersedes V1 (control-pretraining-30b-filtered-gpt55-4plus-base), which applied the same rule at an annotation th",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
bratao/portugueseT5,63,0,,,,false,`portugueseT5` is a Portuguese encoder-decoder research checkpoint trained from scratch with the architecture and configuration of [`google/t5-v1_1-large`](https://huggingface.co/google/t5-v1_1-large). The doctoral thesis describes pre-training on a 20% sample of GigaVerbo.,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
