KuanP/brain-uce-pilot-mix-v2,51,0,other,,,false,"A pilot **Universal Cell Embedding (UCE)-style** model for brain single-cell RNA-seq, trained from scratch on ""data mix v2"" (the `v2026-09` corpus): **26 caches, 147,675,214 cells, 13 species, 43.1 % brain tissue**. It maps a cell's raw counts to a 512-d, L2-normalised embedding through a chromosome-ordered ""cell sentence"" of frozen ESM2 gene tokens.",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
