d0rj/diffusion-51M-base,46,0,,,,false,"A small English **masked diffusion base model**, trained from random initialization as part of [Tiny llm ablation](https://huggingface.co/collections/d0rj/tiny-llm-ablation-6aafca336122dd2c2868f923). This is the successfully trained **v2** checkpoint: **51,392,512 stored parameters**, **50,867,200 optimized parameters**, exactly **3,932,160,000 processed source tokens**.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
