solintellegence/Sol-Nano,44,2,,,,false,"Nano is the 2.9M-parameter model in the Sol Lite family. We trained it on 5 billion tokens using `SolForCausalLM`, a 1,024-entry tokenizer, and TN-Gram memory. The exact parameter count is 2,895,188; 209,748 of those parameters belong to the memory component.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
