paw9810/qawel,43,1,,,,false,"qawel is a **9,592,720-parameter English causal language model**, trained from random initialization with Labqoat. This release follows three of our own scratch checkpoints, then an ARC training-question adaptation phase with general-text replay. It inherits **no external pretrained model weights**. Its tokenizer is our own 4,096-token digit-atomic byte-level BPE.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
