mvbalaji/1111AI-Tamil1B-Instruct,37,0,other,tbd-pending-review,,false,"A **1.24B-parameter Tamil-first language model trained from scratch** — not a multilingual model adapted to Tamil, and not an English model with Tamil tokens bolted on. Tokenizer, corpus and weights are all Tamil-native from the start.",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
geodesic-research/control-pretraining-30b-baseline-xl50b-v4-think,37,0,other,nvidia-open-model-license,,false,"The quality-filtered xl-50b reasoning model control-pretraining-30b-baseline-xl50b-v3-think trained again with only its peak learning rate changed, from 5e-6 to 5e-5. The base model, the SFT corpus and its order, the code and configuration, the global batch of 256, the schedule's shape (cosine to zero after a 10% warmup) and the 5,976 iterations are v3's. Its checkpoints sit at v3's iterations, so the two compare revision by revision.",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
robloxianer/ShitpostGPT-20M,37,0,other,,,false,"A 20.5M-parameter language model trained **from scratch** on one consumer GPU (RTX 3060 12GB) to write Twitch chat, imageboard posts and Reddit shitposts. It is a toy: small, unfiltered and chaotic on purpose. Inspired by Codeically's ""ChatGPT-2 on a potato"" video.",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
ccdv/lsg-legal-base-uncased-4096,36,2,,,,false,"**Transformers >= 4.36.1**/ **This model relies on a custom modeling file, you need to add trust_remote_code=True**/ **See [/#13467](https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/pull/13467)**",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
