zuhri025/byte-llm-pretrain-v1,18,1,,,,false,"A small Qwen3-architecture causal LM (31.6M params) trained from scratch with a **byte-level tokenizer** — 256 raw UTF-8 byte tokens plus `<|pad|>`/`<|bos|>`/`<|eos|>`/`[S1]`/`[S2]`/3 reserved slots (264 total vocab). Because any Unicode string decomposes losslessly into UTF-8 bytes, this tokenizer covers any language/script with no fitting step and no `<unk>`. `[S1]`/`[S2]` are greedily matched as single tokens whenever their literal string appears in the input text.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
jfrick/scholarly-code-modern-gpt-10m-5b,18,0,,,,false,"A **base language model trained from random initialization**, with **9,849,536 parameters**, **4,999,934,057 next-token training exposures** and **72,805 optimizer updates**. It is not instruction-tuned. Generated samples contain repetition, invented terminology and factual errors; the model is a small research artifact rather than a reliable assistant.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
ModalityDance/AR-Omni-Pretrain-v0.1,18,1,,,,false,"**AR-Omni-Pretrain** is a *single-decoder*, *single-token-stream* **autoregressive any-to-any** model that supports **text**, **images**, and **speech** in a unified next-token prediction framework (without expert decoders). This checkpoint serves as the **base pretrained model** for downstream instruction tuning and chat-style interleaved any-to-any conversation.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
