graphene-lab/AgentBridge,0,0,other,,,false,"**Add agentic power to your work.** AgentBridge is a self-hosted server that runs AI agents with two interfaces in a single process: a full-screen chat terminal (TUI) and a standard HTTP API compatible with OpenAI — plus a native MCP connector. Chat in the terminal while scripts, bots and apps use the same agents on the same port: same process, same conversations, no bridges, no synchronization.",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
