RaunakSeksaria/anlp-a2-optimizers,0,1,,,,false,"The dense 26.45M-parameter decoder of Task 1 (variant v1), pretrained from scratch on browndw/human-ai-parallel-corpus for 1x the training data (44.43M tokens) with AdamW, MARS, Lion and Muon (one per category of 'Fantastic Pretraining Optimizers'), plus Sophia-H from its Hessian-based category as a bonus.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Sami-on-hugging-face/anlp-a2-part2-optimizers,0,0,,,,false,"The same 8-layer decoder-only transformer (d_model 512, 37.8M parameters; the dense configuration of Part 1) pretrained from scratch for next-token prediction on `browndw/human-ai-parallel-corpus` (revision `b514ff64`) with optimizers implemented from scratch (Wen et al. 2025, *Fantastic Pretraining Optimizers*, Appendix A). Every run uses the same initial weights, the same batches (one epoch, 37.7M tokens) and the same learning-rate schedule; hyperparameters come from a sweep on a quarter of the data (`sweep_best/`).",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Ba2han/mini-qwen-next-31b,0,0,,,,false,"Training starts with one complete pass over `Ba2han/tokenized_mix_0507` and stops at its exhaustion. The learning-rate schedule spans 31 billion input tokens; the packed long dataset is a later continuation. Two GPUs use 1 packed row each per forward and 32 accumulation passes: 655,360 input tokens per update. Activation checkpointing is disabled. N-gram gradients accumulate in FP32 and communicate in BF16. The full 1.8B n-gram table remains on GPU; measured steady throughput is about 41k input tokens/s. Adam groups use AdamW8bit at a peak LR of 0.001; Muon groups use the selected 8-step Polar Express recipe at 0.024. Warmup lasts 500 updates. Linear decay starts at 24.8 billion input tokens.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Ba2han/mini-qwen-next-model2-fineweb-500,0,0,,,,false,"Fresh initialization: 22 layers, hidden width 1152, SwiGLU intermediate width 3168, tied token embedding and LM head. The backbone contains 550,888,224 parameters; the width-64 bigram/trigram table contains 1,800,199,552 parameters. The existing 60,800-token vocabulary is retained. Source data is pinned to `66b78cd134ab7b0545a1a618a1cc029f3091eb20`. Document-aware packing adds BOS/EOS and preserves causal/state isolation with segments no longer than 2,560 tokens.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Ba2han/mini-qwen-next-model2-fineweb-v2,0,1,,,,false,"22 layers, hidden 1152, intermediate 3168; tied embedding/LM head. Backbone 550,888,224 parameters plus a 1,800,199,552-parameter width-64 bigram/trigram table. Existing 60,800-token vocabulary; context 2,560, four rows per GPU, two GPUs, 32 accumulation passes = 655,360 input tokens/update.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Ba2han/mini-qwen-next-model2-fineweb-2p1b,0,0,,,,false,"Speed test stopped on user request after 13 updates (8,519,680 input tokens), without saving weights. This repository contains the recipe and tokenizer; it does not contain a trained 2.1B-table checkpoint. Matching post-warmup updates 6–10 measured 28,719 input tokens/s versus 28,773 for the preceding 1.8B table. Peak allocation 45.705 GB/GPU, about 1.25 GB higher. These are short-sample measurements.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Ba2han/mini-qwen-next-model3-short-2b,0,0,,,,false,"Fresh training from step zero. Hidden 1024, MLP 2816, head dimension 128; 21 GDN + 7 attention layers, tied embeddings, full-head RoPE theta 10000, pre-norm zero-centered RMSNorm epsilon 1e-6, four gated residual branches. Exact parameters: 2,571,643,424 = 571,494,816 backbone + 2,000,148,608 table.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
MulinLab/hEvo-pretraining-code,0,0,,,,false,This repository contains the source code for the hEvo pretraining pipeline and its cohort-aware preprocessing statistics workflow. Access to files is manually reviewed by MulinLab. Sign in to Hugging Face and select **Request access** on this page; approved users can then clone or download the source.,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
heisenberg5869/dueling_dqn_cartpole,0,0,,,,false,This repository contains a **Dueling Deep Q-Network (Dueling DQN)** agent trained on the `CartPole-v2` environment. This model was implemented from scratch using PyTorch as part of an RL competition.,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
kotlarmilos/gpt2-nano,0,0,,,,false,This is a 44M-parameter decoder-only transformer implemented in PyTorch. The published checkpoint predates the mixed-precision extension.,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
quanghuynt14/LLM-from-First-Principles,0,4,,,,false,"> **Goal:** Go from zero to confidently understanding, building, fine-tuning, aligning, and deploying Large Language Models. > > **Time commitment:** ~20 weeks (10–15 hrs/week) — flexible, self-paced. > > **Prerequisites:** Python proficiency. Basic calculus & linear algebra (or willingness to learn in Week 1).",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
eateggs0989/eateggsAI-49.34M,0,1,,,,false,eateggsAI-49.34M is an experimental SLM created as a low-VRAM challenge to train a 49.343M parameter transformer on a GTX 1060 4GB GPU using PyTorch.,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
NinjaZombie76/CW_SLM,0,0,other,,,false,"Mini-SWE-RL CodeLM Final is a small decoder-only Python code language model trained from scratch on local ROCm hardware, then supervised fine-tuned for no-leak Python docstring generation.",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
dancinlab/anima-clm-corpus-7b-mid-byte-202m,0,0,odc-by,,,false,"**CHEAP MID corpus-validation probe** (a_toy_scale_recheck) on `dancinlab/anima-corpus-5lang-7b-webscale` (R2 ODC-BY webscale bytes, balanced 5-lang subset incl Korean).",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
map-boy/wandaa-kin-gpt,0,0,,,,false,"A small GPT trained from scratch on Kinyarwanda text (not a fine-tune of another model). It is a research project of VAF Ubwenge Tech, built step by step: start small, measure, fix the data, repeat. It continues text. It is not a chatbot yet.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
tchauffi/diffusionlm-from-scratch,0,0,,,,false,"A masked (absorbing-state) **diffusion language model**, built and trained from scratch on TinyStories. Instead of generating left-to-right one token at a time, it starts from a sequence of pure `[MASK]` tokens and **denoises the whole sequence in parallel** — committing the tokens it is most confident about first, in whatever order the meaning falls into place.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
sourav6565/ppo-LunarLander-v2.1,0,0,,,,false,A CleanRL-style PPO agent trained from scratch on LunarLander-v2.,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
USAGAMES365/cpu-chat-llm,0,0,,,,false,A GPT-2 family language model trained **entirely from scratch on CPU** using the Alpaca instruction dataset. This project demonstrates training a choppable language model with limited compute resources.,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Sayood/flagship-v4-fromscratch,0,0,other,,,false,"The full 59.0 h (212,544.6 s wallclock) from-scratch v4 run: joint planner + world-model training with the lambda_plan seam ramped to `lam_mult_final = 1.0`.",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
ItsProtesilaus/MiniKimiK3,0,0,,,,false,"A 50M parameter language model written from scratch in plain PyTorch, combining **Kimi Delta Attention**, **Multi-head Latent Attention**, a **latent Mixture-of-Experts** with auxiliary-loss-free load balancing, **hyper-connection block residuals**, and a **Muon + AdamW hybrid optimizer**. Trained on TinyStories on a single Apple Silicon GPU.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
vous99/mini-diffusion,0,0,other,celeba-non-commercial-research,https://mmlab.ie.cuhk.edu.hk/projects/CelebA.html,false,"A denoising diffusion model written from scratch in plain PyTorch. The U-Net, the noise schedule, four samplers and the training loop are all in the repository — `diffusers` is never imported.",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
vous99/mini-llm,0,0,cdla-sharing-1.0,,,false,"A decoder-only GPT written from scratch in plain PyTorch. No `transformers`, no `accelerate`, no `fastai` — the model, the tokenizer training and the training loop are all in the repository.",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Fallovski/french-serer-transformer-scratch,0,0,other,,,false,"Part of a benchmark of six configurations for French→Serer neural machine translation. Serer is a critically low-resource Niger-Congo language (~1.2M speakers, Senegal/Gambia), phylogenetically close to the well-resourced Wolof.",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
0Curious0/faster_rcnn_resnet50,0,0,,,,false,"A from-scratch PyTorch implementation of Faster R-CNN (Ren et al., 2015), aiming to closely — not exactly — reproduce paper-level results on Pascal VOC under real compute constraints.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Arsen4ikVar/tlab-looped-transformer,0,0,,,,false,"Weight-tied looped transformer: one 3-layer Qwen3-style block applied `r` times, 448-dim, **9,064,608 parameters**, trained from scratch on FineWeb next-token prediction. T-Lab test task submission. Run `full_control90_kaggle`, 90.0M tokens, step 43944.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
N8Programs/lil-bard-checkpts,0,0,,,,false,"This repository contains 25 loadable Transformers checkpoints from the pretraining run for [`N8Programs/lil-bard`](https://huggingface.co/N8Programs/lil-bard). The final step-25,485 model is kept in that separate repository so ordinary users do not download the full checkpoint history.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
