JoTalbot/ua-legal-lm-gpu,0,0,,,,false,- Val loss: 0.6955 - Дата: 2026-09-16 23:50 UTC,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
RaunakSeksaria/anlp-a1-transformers,0,0,,,,false,Five encoder-decoder transformers trained from scratch to map an XOR-encrypted binary sequence to English plaintext. Each configuration differs from the base by exactly one architectural component.,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
wangyue114514/small-agent-1b,0,0,,,,false,这是从头训练约 1B 参数、面向基础代码、数学与工具使用能力的研究模型预留仓库。,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
abidlabs/mnist-from-scratch-1min,0,0,,,,false,A small CNN trained from **random initialization** (no pretrained weights) on [`ylecun/mnist`](https://huggingface.co/datasets/ylecun/mnist) for **~1 minute of GPU time**.,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
Pedro21613/PS-1.0-translate,0,0,,,,false,Modelo **criado do zero em PyTorch** + treino pesado em 6 idiomas.,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
balaji9043/zeromem-pointer,0,1,,,,false,"About 34M parameters, trained from scratch on a laptop. Reads a question plus a chunk whose sentences are tagged [A] [B] [C] ... and answers `<KNOW>[C]` or `<REFUSE>`, so it never retypes (or invents) text. `best.pt` is a PyTorch checkpoint for the ZeroMem code (not a transformers model); `tokenizer.json` is its byte-level BPE tokenizer.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
BernaLabs/berna-r7-mother,0,0,other,berna-research-1.0,https://github.com/Berna-Labs/berna-r7/blob/main/LICENSE,false,**A 1.06B multilingual language model with a modular cell-based architecture.**,noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
muhamedkamil/berna-r7-mother,0,0,other,berna-research-1.0,https://github.com/Berna-Labs/berna-r7/blob/main/LICENSE,false,**A 1.06B multilingual language model with a modular cell-based architecture.**,noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
kunal10tripathi/tinystories-10m,0,0,cdla-sharing-1.0,,,false,"**Status: recipe complete, weights not trained yet.** This repo holds the architecture and the single script that builds the whole model end to end. Running the script will train the model and replace this file with the results card (final val loss, bits-per-byte against the published TinyStories baselines, and sample generations).",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
SuperGoatScriptGuy/Mnemonic,0,1,,,,false,"Small chat models where every part (data pipeline, tokenizer, GPU training, quantization and inference) is hand-written assembly: x86-64 on the CPU, PTX on the GPU, WebAssembly in the browser.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
bcdennis/hcd-tinystories-smoke,0,0,,,,false,"- arm: `hcd-causal` - params: 45,144,966 - steps: 30 - seq_len: 256, batch: 32 - final val LM loss: **10.3050** - data: PleIAs/SYNTH (en subset: query+reasoning+answer, streaming, gpt2 tokenizer) - optimizer: AdamW lr 0.0001, wd 0.1, cosine, warmup 200",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
bcdennis/hcd-synth-hier-causal-tight,0,0,,,,false,"- arm: `hcd-causal` - params: 45,144,966 - steps: 12000 - seq_len: 256, batch: 32 - final val LM loss: **4.4077** - data: PleIAs/SYNTH (en subset: query+reasoning+answer, streaming, gpt2 tokenizer) - optimizer: AdamW lr 0.0001, wd 0.1, cosine, warmup 200",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
bcdennis/hcd-synth-ncp,0,0,,,,false,"- arm: `ncp` - params: 50,500,737 - steps: 12000 - seq_len: 256, batch: 32 - final val LM loss: **6.1264** - data: PleIAs/SYNTH (en subset: query+reasoning+answer, streaming, gpt2 tokenizer) - optimizer: AdamW lr 0.0001, wd 0.1, cosine, warmup 200",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
bala-skv/anlp-a2-part1-moe,0,0,,,,false,"Part 1 of ANLP Assignment 2: decoder-only transformers (D=384, 6 layers, 6 heads, context 256, 32k byte-level BPE) trained to translate Vietnamese and Japanese to English (belumind/en-vi-ja-curated-500k-triplets), one per feed-forward variant, all trained for 3 epochs (110.0M tokens, identical batches for every variant).",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
bala-skv/anlp-a2-part2-optimizers,0,0,,,,false,"Part 2 of ANLP Assignment 2: the dense decoder-only transformer pretrained for next-token prediction on browndw/human-ai-parallel-corpus for 1x the dataset (43.6M tokens), one checkpoint per optimizer, all from identical initial weights on identical data. Optimizers implemented from scratch on torch.optim.Optimizer (Wen et al. 2025, Appendix A); hyperparameters chosen by a validation-loss sweep.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
netrunner20/gpt2-124m-fineweb-edu,0,0,,,,false,"GPT-2 small (124M parameters) trained from scratch in PyTorch on 10B tokens of [FineWeb-Edu](https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-edu) (sample-10BT), following Andrej Karpathy's [Let's reproduce GPT-2 (124M)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l8pRSuU81PU).",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
nirca/nirca-mini,0,1,,,,false,"Nirca Mini is a small chat model trained from scratch, with ternary weights: its linear layers' weights are -1, 0 or +1, with a scale and a bias for each block of 128 weights. It reads and writes bytes, so it needs no tokenizer. It is published as it trains: each new checkpoint replaces `latest/`.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
devilart1980/NOVA8-53M,0,1,other,polyform-noncommercial-1.0.0,https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0/,false,"> **Runs only with the NOVA-EVO program.** NOVA is not a transformer and does not load in `transformers`, > llama.cpp, Ollama or LM Studio. The program, the whole experiment and every measurement are on GitHub: > **https://github.com/roppikevo/AI-NOVA-EVO** — how to run it is below, under ""Running it"".",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
saroj479/tenslam-minilm-60m,0,0,,,,false,This page describes the project; model files are not hosted here. See the [GitHub source repository](https://github.com/sbartaula/Minillm-pretrain) for code and instructions. The source code is MIT-licensed; that licence does not apply to the datasets or trained weights.,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
MrCookieJos/prism-brain,0,1,,,,false,"PRISM is a small language model built and trained from scratch: its own tokenizer, its own architecture code, and no weights borrowed from any other model.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
muaibinrah/ppo-LunarLander-v2-from-scratch,0,0,,,,false,"This is a from-scratch PyTorch implementation of PPO (HF Deep RL Course Unit8 Part1), trained on LunarLander-v3 (Kaggle gymnasium removed v2; checker tags kept as LunarLander-v2 to match the exact env-id string the course checker expects).",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
EliasTad/qwen2.5-0.5b-w4-custom-quant,0,1,,,,false,Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B quantized with a **from-scratch PyTorch quantizer** (no bitsandbytes / torch.ao / GPTQ libraries).,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
jfrick/simple-llm-124M-10.879B,0,0,,,,false,"Public inference release of the latest completed **124,389,632-parameter** Simple LLM checkpoint, trained on **10,878,562,619 next-token targets**. This is a base language model, not an instruction-tuned assistant. Generations can be inaccurate, incorrect as code, and severely repetitive, especially with greedy/low-temperature decoding. The new multilingual continuation is not included in this release.",no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
AAJ007/kiyotaka-ayanokoji-56m,0,0,other,,,false,"A **10-layer, 640-wide decoder-only transformer trained from random initialisation** on a single 6 GB RTX 4050 laptop GPU. No pretrained weights, no fine-tuning of an existing model: the architecture, BPE tokenizer, pretraining corpus and SFT data were built for this project.",noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag
